<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUKE Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Dungjuiya Chongkahoi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke dungjuiya chong kahoihi Inzootna Kathar (NT) ah mili huuina Jisu Christa ringkho jarra inrilcheen larik kha eii. Hiwa ngai rakiphi “Gospel” tia inkoi, atinachu “Chong kahoi” tina eii. Matthew, Mark, Luke, khat um John inmani ngai'n Jisu Christa thisuoliya inmajia kha eii. Halli Luke in Jisu ringkhuo thurchibit majiama-ah Jisu siamruoi ngai'n athisuoli khat um aringsuo nuk ah angme intho tijarra Tirtonngai chuontho iti larik hi-um amajia. Tuteii'n incheenna jetmu Luke chongkahoihi angtikpha ah imajiame khat um hunna imajiame, takkha kasing kathei ngai'n inzootna khachu Christa inneisuonuk kum 70 phaiwei ah imajia lei ete.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hiwa kamajia pachu Luke eii, halli amahi mi-kaen kathiam inkhat alei eii. Ama'n imajia omchan khat um chong iliingna ngaihi nimu phakhan amahi larik kathei miring inkhat eii tia nijet. Luke in Jisu ringkhoa kasuok omchan rakip kha-um angthothowa kasuokme tia kadik ah amajiazoot, khawa e-inchu hiwa larik kateel mi rakip in aneemna mu-inte (Luk 1:1-3). Amahi Jihudi emak (Col 4:10-14) halli Jihudi ka-emak mi ngai innum jetmatornasik-ah amajia. Hiwa nijetnachu ama'n Jihudi ngai sinadan incheenna amalarna khan eii. (Luke 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke chongkahoi dungjuiya Matthew khat-um Mark larik hi in-angdom, ajarchu inmani'n in-angrip chong omchanna inmajia. Hiwa ngai larik inthum karra Luke in John Baptish inneina jarra incheen doomma amajia. Luke in ngaidamna jarra aril (Arup 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) halli Pathian ninasik jarra aril (Arup 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Luke ama chongkahoi amalarna khat um angjarra imajiame tia arilcheenna <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Halli Jisu inneina jarra arilcheenna halli ama'n angtho thoa chuonthonasik-ah insuukme <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 1:5-4:13">1:5–4:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Chongkahoi suungnga kalokkhet ajarkhachu, Luke in Jisu Christa chuontho jarra aru ka-eja ama'n inlak chuonngai athojarra khat-um aminchuna chuon ngaikha eii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 4:14-21:38">4:14–21:38</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Aheknakhet arup inni khan angtho thoa Jisu thime, inphuumme khat-um kathi makheiya hongringme tijarra aril <char style="ior">(<ref loc="LUK 22-24">22–24</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Minriang kaom Theophilus:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Eini karra kaleisuok omchan rakip jarra mi katamtak in inmaneiseng majianasik inleingaidon. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Inphutna makheiya inmit tak-ah kaleimu ngai'n einidiang naleiti khat um naleirilpi chongngaikha inmani'n inmajiajei. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Eh, intor Theophilus, hiwa thurchi jarra inphutna makheiya kei'n incheenna ki-entok rakipkha amason kaomma nangnadiang majia matorkate tia kei'n kangaidon. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Khawajarra nangnadiang naleiminchu angrakip ngaikha nang in incheenna najetnasik-ah kei'n hiwahi kimajia eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist Inneisik jarra Minjetna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Herod Judea reng alei elai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Judea: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hinna itichu aram suung raya ah Palestine ta-eii.</char></note> Abijah phungrui makheiya Thiampu inkhat araming Zechariah inti aleiom, ama numeikha Aaron phungrui makheiya alei eii, araming kha Elizabeth inti. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Khang 24:10</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Inmani'n Pathian diang kadik ah inleiom, Pumi chong li Dan kha katha ah inleijui. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Takkha inmani'n sa-chu leineimu, ajarchu Elizabeth hi wonkachoimak alei eii, halli inmani innireella upa-um inlei ejei.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Zechariah in biak-inna Thiampu inkhat-ah Pathian sepa aleitholai, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Thiampu ngai sina Dan dungjuiya, rasi in-enna, ama kha Pumi biak-inna arimkahoi Berou kahaalsik-ah inleikadang. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Arimkahoi berou inhaal phakhan mipui katamtak in toulla nina inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Halli Pumi Tirton kha arimkahoi haalna maichaam pena mun changtiang a-ngirra amadiang alei inlar. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zechariah in ama kha amuphakhan alei-inlai, halli ama'n china aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Takkha Marwaan Tirton in aleiti, “Chimaro, Zechariah! Pathian in nang inikha anara-ngaipijei, halli nang nanumei Elizabeth kha sapasal inkhat neita ama raming John natisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nang in angtuk hoinali rokna naneisikme ama innei phakhan, halli mipui kha-um rokna inneisik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Pumi mit-enna ama kha kalok esik eii, ama'n ju emakli jusak innuni, anu wonsuungnga inphut Ratha inthiang in asipsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">Teelna 6:3</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Halli ama'n Israel mi katamtak Pumi Pathian diang ahei keikirnooksik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />John in ajar eya innu inpa ngai'n insa ngaikha kheella ingaidon. Halli hiwa angnga, atuunna chongkajuimak mi ngai khaum Pathian minngaidon sik eii. Halli John in mipui ngaikha Pumi sikbeiya inringchak ah minom nasik ah ama'n Elijah ratha khat-um ranak angnga ama'n Pumi matiang asisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 4:6">6</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zechariah in marwaan tirton diang aleiti, “Angtho thowa hiwahi kajetsikme? Kei um upa ka-ejei halli kanumei um upa ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />“Kei Gabriel kaei” Marwaan tirton in ati, “Kei Pathian maikuungnga kangir Gabriel ka eii, nangnadiang hiwa chong kahoihi kanarilpisik ah najuotir eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:2">9:2</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Enro, nang in chongkha riltheinutin, ang rakiphi asuok maklaiseng, ajarchu apha dungjuiya kasuoksik kachong ngaihi nang in inngamna makchejei.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Halli mipu'n Zechariah kha inleingaak, khat-um biak-inn suungnga kasoot ah aleiom jarra ngakna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ama'n aheisuok phakhan, inmani diang chongkha leiril matormakjei, khale inruoiya imani'n inleijet, biak-inna mangtalar leimujeite, ajarchu chong leisuokmak jarra akut ah injetna omchan aleithopi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Achuon thonasik nikhuo ngaikha ahekli Zechariah in inntiang aleisijei. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Apha sootlekleiya anumei Elizabeth kha nai leiwonna tha ra-nga tuol suoklekleiya innna aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“Awinichu Pumi'n kei kadiang anasanjei,” “Halli ama'n aleiti, kei kadiang mipui'n rilse nakha ama'n nakhaipijei!”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Neinasik ah Minjetna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Elizabeth naiwonna tharuk ahongtung phakhan Pathian in tirton Gabriel kha Galilee khopui suungnga kaom Nazareth khuo khan ajuotir.<verse eid="LUK 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />David phungnga Joseph diang inbiakjei inthiang numeisa chungnga Pathian tirton aleijuo, halli inthiang numeisanu kha Mary inti, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 1:18">Matt 1:18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Halli marwaan tirton kha ajuoa ati, “Nang nadiang kadai omrase! Pumi kha nang nachungnga aom, Numeisa ngai karra nanghi rawaan kathakhet na eii!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Takkha ama'n marwaan tirton chongkha ajet phakhan amalung upleiminchaak, angkachang chongme tia amalungnga lei-inngaidon. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Marwaan tirton in amadiang ati, Mary, “China neimaro, Pathian minriang nakha nangnadiang omjei.<verse eid="LUK 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Enro, nang in napum inrikta pasal inkhat naneisik eii, halli ama raming Jisu tinata nakoisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 1:21">Matt 1:21</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ama kha kalian e-sik eii, halli insaangkhet Pathian sapa tia inkoisik eii, khat um Pumi Pathian in amadiang apa David reng in-ong nakha apesik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:13">13</ref>,<ref loc="2SA 7:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ama'n Jacob phungruiya hektik kaboiya reng achangsik eii, halli Ama Rengram kha haktik omnuni!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mary in Pathian tirton diang aleiti, “Kei inthiang numeisa ka eii, angtho thoa hiwahi etheiniyame?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Marwaan tirton in khawa neinudiang amasang, “Ratha inthiang in nang nadiang ajuosik eii, halli Pathian ranakkha nang nadiang namakhusik eii, hiwajarra nang in nai neinata inthiang naiteii ramingkha Pathian sapa intisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Enro, nang naphung Elizabeth kha, upa e-innum pasal inkhat awonjei, halli wonkachoimak intinukha atuunchu tharuk ejei.<verse eid="LUK 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tichu, Pathian diang angrakip ka e-matormak ommak.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Inphut 18:14</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mary in ati; “Kei Pumi suoknu ka-eii,” “Nang iti chongkha kei kadiang isuok erase.” Halli Pathian tirton in aleimathaanjei.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mary in Elizabeth I-hongpha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mary in innottheiya intheiya khawa chingram Judea khuopui khan aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ama'n Zechariah inn kha leiluut ah Elizabeth diang inpaakna chong aleipei. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Halli Elizabeth in Mary inpaakna chong aleijet phakhan, awonsuung makheiya naiteikha siing hong-insa halli Elizabeth kha Ratha Inthiang in aleisip. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ama'n inringnga ahongkheek, “Numeisa ngai karra nanghi rawaan katha na eii, khat um nawonsik naiteii kha-um rawaan katha esik eii! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Tichu Pumi nu'n keidiang i-najuophahi angjarra hiwa ka-ang kalok chuonhi keikadiang isuokme? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Enro, nang minpaakna rasa kajet phakhan, kawon suungnga kaom naiteii khan arok-ah lei-inchoom. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Pumi'n angrakip kasuoksik amadiang chong irilpi ngaikha kangamnajei ama kha, rawaan katha eii!”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mary Minpaakna Laa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mary in aleiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Kamalungnga Pumi kha kaminpaak; <char style="rq"><ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">1 Sam 2:1-10</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Karatha'n kanakatanpa Pathian diang karokpui,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ajarchu keihi ama suok kasiinkhet ka e-innum ama'n ana-ngaidon! ­­­­­­­­­</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">Atuun makheichu, mi rakip in keihi rawaan kathanu innatisikjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1SA 1:11">1 Sam 1:11</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Ajarchu Karaat khet Pathian in kei kadiang kalian choun athojarra eii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Araming kha inthiang eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ama minriang nakha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Ama khoya katho midiang khang rakip ah aminmu.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ama ngarna abaankha aduong</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">halli in-or miringngai i-ngaidon kha aminmangpi.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Pathian in rengkalian ngaikha in-ongna mun makheiya aminpur,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">halli inniam mikha kadomsaang. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JOB 5:11">Job 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:19">12:19</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ama'n won kachaam karaal ngaikha katha ah leiwaisip,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">halli inchong rakipkha kutkaruok ah leiminsi,<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ama minriang nakha inngaidonna sik ah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">Asuok Israel ngaikha aleisan,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ama'n nipi nipu ngaidiang ileiril angnga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Abraham khat-um ama tu-lesa rakip diang um hektik kaommak minriang nakha minmurase!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 17:7">Inphut 17:7</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mary in thathum Elizabeth le inleiom halli ama'n inntiang aleikirnook.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist Innei na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Elizabeth nainei nasik pha alei-eya, ama'n sapasal inkhat aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Ama indiang inwaipui ngaili a-u-ngai'n Pumi minriangna loknakha amadiang om tihi inleijet ah amale roksuomna inleinei.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Niriat huuini naiteii kha wuntannasik-ah inleisi, halli inmani'n apa raming kajuisik ah ama ramingkha Zechariah tia inleikoizoot. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 1:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Takkha anu'n aleiti, “Chamak! ama raming John nitisik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Inmani'n anudiang inleiti, “Atuteii nangni insuungkurra hiwa raming karoon ommu!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n apa diang angkachang raming natisikme tia jettheinasik-ah inleirakeel.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zechariah in majianasik lungpeek kha aleiniya aleimajia, “Ama ramingchu John.” Halli inmani rakip in ngakna inleinei! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Khawapha takkhan Zechariah in chong hong riltheinook-ah Pathian minpaakna chong ahongriljei. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ama sirpangnga kaom ngaikhan kachi'n aleisip, halli hiwa jarra Judea chingram suungnga kaom khuo rakipdiang inleirilthang. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Hiwajarra kajet mirakip in inmalungnga inlei-inkel, “Angme hiwa naipangpa'n hong e-sik?” Pumi chuontho kha amadiang om.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zechariah in Pathian Chong Irilsuok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />John pa Zachariah kha Ratha Inthiang in asip ah Pathain chong aleiril:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Israel Pumi Pathian kha minpaakru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Ama'n ami ngai kasansik aleijuo halli ami ngaikha akatanjei,”<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Asuok David phungrui makheiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">ama'n einisik ah akalian Nakatanpa Pumi anapejei.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ama chongkhit nakha inthiang Pathian chongkachoi ngaidiang tialleiya inphut inleiril,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Tichu, ni inhalpui mi makheiya anasansik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ranak kanei ni-inhalpui rakip kutchungnga anasansik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ama riangwai chongkhit nakha nipi nipu ngaidiang minmunasik.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">Halli ama inthiang inzootnakha ngaidonnasik.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Nipa Abraham diang chongkhit nale inruoiya,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Ama'n eini ni-inhalpui mi ngai makheiya nasannasik eii tia chong inkhetna naleipei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">halli ama kha kachi omlekleiya sepa thothei nasik anazootpi.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Eini ringkho omlaiseng ama maikuungnga inthiangnga niomsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Nang, kei kasa, Insaangkhet Pathian chong kachoipa innatisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MIC 3:1">Mic 3:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Nang in Pumi neek ah ma-sanata ama lamkha naboolsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />inmani manu ngaikha ngaidampita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ama mi ngaikha kalakatansik eii tia tipinasik eii.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Ajarchu Pathian chu minriang kasip eii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">Ama'n sanminring nakha ziingtiang khowar angnga einidiang aminwar<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Kaziingnga kaom ngaili thina raliya kaom ngaidiang war inchangnasik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ama'n kadai lamtiang lam nakeiruoisik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Naiteikha insoonna taksali Ratha ah ahong raatjei, halli ama'n Israel mirakip maikuungnga inlar maklaiseng ramruok khan aleiom.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Inneina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matt 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Augustus rengpa'n Rome ramsuungseng milu teelnasik-ah chong aleipeii phakhan, <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Quirinius in Syria wairoon suungnga hiwahi ma-insakhet milukateel kha a-eii. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Mirakip in inmani inmani khuopui suungnga inraming kapeluut inleisi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Joseph um Galilee inti Nazareth khopui makheiya Bethlehem tia inkoi David khopui Judea ramsuungnga aleisi, ajarchu ama kha David phungrui e-jarra eii. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ama numei ka-esik naikawon Mary khale raming kapeluut inleisi, <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />halli inmani'n Bethlehemma inleiom phakhan, nainei nasik pha alei ejei. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Mary in sapasal ma-insakhet aleinei, khale inruoiya puonna leikasuunna, sarakuong suungkhan aleiminzaal, ajarchu inmani'n omnasik innkha leiommak.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keelngam kakhaal ngai khat-um Mawaan Tirton ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Khawa phakhan keelngam kakhaalngai kha, keelngam khaalna munna keelngam kha zaalsoot inngaak ah inleiom. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Pumi marwaan tirton kha inmani diang aleiinlar, han Pumi poinakha inmani diang aleiminmu, halli inmani kha kachi'n aleisip. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Marwaan tirton in inmani diang aleiti, “Chimaru! Kei'n mirakip roknasik chong kahoikha nangnidiang kajuochoi. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Awini nikhuohin Kanasanpa Christa Pumi kha David khopuiya inneijei. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Hiwahi nangnisik-ah jetna eii; nangni'n naiteii kha puonna kasuun inta sarakuongnga inleiminzaal kha ningjuomusik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Jetlei theileiya tirton khale marwaan raalmi tirton katamtak in Pathian minpaakna laa injuosak;<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Marwaan insaangnakhet khan Pathian lurlian nakha omrase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">halli ama kaminriang mi rakipdiang manmasituolla kadaikha omrase!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Tirton ngai'n marwaan tiang inleikir phakhan, keelngam kakhaal ngai'n khatli khatdiang inlei inti, “Pumi'n einidiang ileiti ngaihi, Bethlehemma juosi inlang angrakip kasuok ngaikha juoenrui.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n innottheiya insiya mary li Joseph kha injuomu halli naiteii kha-um sarakuongnga inminzaalla inleidakha injuomu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Inmani'n neiteii kha injuomu phakhan, Tirton kha'n naiteii jarra ileiril rakipkha inmani diang inleirilpi. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Keelngam kakhaal ngai'n inril chong kajet mi rakip in ngakna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mary in inmani'n inleiril chong rakip ngaikha kathatak ah amalung suungnga aleingaidonrep. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Keelngam kakhaal ngai'n inleikirra inmani diang Pathian tirton in ileirilpijek kha injuomu injuojet jarra Pathian kha inminlur inminlianna inleiminpaak.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Raming Inphuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Wuntan nasik niriat honghuui phakhan, marwaan tirton in ama kha inwonma ah araming inleiphuopi angnga, aramingkha Jisu inleitijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Levi 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk 1:31</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Biak-inna Inpeluut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Moses Dan chongpei dungjuiya Joseph li Mary in naiteii kha minthiang nasikpha ahongtungjei. Khawale inruoiya naiteii kha Pumi diang peluutnasik-ah Jerusalemma inleichoi, <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 2:22-24">2:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Levi 12:6-8</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Pumi Dan khan hinthoa leiinjia angnga, “Pasan ma-insakhet ah innei rakipchu Pumi diang minthiangnasik-ah inpeluutsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Suok 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Halli Pumi Dan khan areiom iti dungjuiya, “Wathu inni, emakli pharbaliteii inni kha penasik-ah inleichoi.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 12:6-8">Levi 12:6-8</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Jerusalem ma miring inkhat araming Simeon inti aleiom, ama kha kadik khat um Pathian kachi mi alei eii, halli Israel ngai sanminringna kamusik-ah kangaak chak ah kaom mi kha-um aleieii. Ratha Inthiang khan amadiang alei-inruoipui <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />halli Pumi chong inkhitna ah ipei Messiah kha namumaklaiseng thinutin tia amadiang inngamna-um aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Simeon kha Ratha in inruoipuiya biak-inna aleiluut. Dan dungjuiya anuli apa'n naiteii Jisu kha biak-inna inleiruoi phakhan, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeon in naiteii kha akut-ah pomma Pathian leiminpaak ah ati:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Pumi atuun chu, nang chong inkhitnakha namintungjei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">nasuok keihi kadaiya naminsitaro.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Nang Sanminringna kha kamit tak-ah kamujei.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Nang in mipui maikuungnga nileimisuukpikha.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Hiwa war in zaatlop ngaidiang nalungdou minmunasik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">halli nang lurlian nakha nang nami Israel ngaidiang minmusik eii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Simeon in naiteii jarra irilpi chong rakip kha anu li apa'n aleijet phakhan inleingak. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Halli Simeon in inmani diang rawaan aleipeiya Mary diang aleiti, “ Hiwa naiteii hi Israel ngaidiang insuina khat um sanminringna angjet kapesik-ah Pathian in ikadang ejei. Ama'n Pathian injettheina eta miring angjet in enhal-inta inrilsesik eii, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />halli inthup ah kaom inmani ngaidonna ngaikha malarsik eii. Halli malung kasekha chemlujumma innasun angnga namalungkha asunkhoisik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Pathian chong kachoi numeisa araming Anna inti Phanuel sanu Asher zaat makheiya inkhat aleiom, ama kha upa lei ejei halli inn aneiya aruotharle kumsari bit aleiom, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />halli ama'n kumsoomriat leimili katung chuulmei inkhat eya aleiom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:37. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Halli ama'n kumsoomriat leimili katung chuulmei inkhat eya aleiom, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kumsoomriat leimili chuulmei inkhat eya aleiom. </char></note> halli ama'n biak-inn kha leimathaan lekleiya suunli zaan Pathian chubei thoa bu ngeiya Pathian niya aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Khawapha takkhan numeisanu kha-um heitungnga Pathian leiminpaak ah Jerusalem katannasik-ah Pathian kangak mi ngaidiang naiteii jarra aleirilpi.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth tiang Heikirna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Josheph li Mary in Pumi Dan dungjuiya angrakip thodan kasuok ngaikha inminhek ah Galilee ramsuungnga kaom inmani khopui Nazareth ah inleikirjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Matt 2:23</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Naiteii kha ahong in-soonna ahongngarjei; singnatheina'n leisip ah Pathian rawaan kha amadiang aleiom.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Biak-inna Jisu Ileiom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kumsuoa Jisu nuli apa kha Jerusalemma rakaanna kahoi inchelsik-ah inleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Suok 12:1-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-18">Innidan 16:1-18</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Jisu kha kum soomleini ahong ephakhan a-ngai angnga inmani'n Jerusalemma rakaanna kahoi inchel inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Kahoi kha hakli inmani'n inntiang inleikir phakhan, Jisu'n Jerusalemma aleiom, anuli apa inchu leijetmu. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Inmani karra inchel tia suunsoot lamkhan inleisi, halli inmani'n Jisu kha insuungkhur ngaili insappui ngai karra kaentok inleiphut, <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Inmani'n Jisu kha leimumu, khale inruoiya inmani'n Jerusalem tiang inkirra ama ka-entok inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Nithum suoa ama kha biak-inna Jihudi karu ngaile in-ongnga inmani chongkha rangaiya halli inmani diang chong rakella ileiomkha injuomu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Ama'n kasing kathei tak ah imasangli irakelngai kajet rakip in inleingak. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Anuli apa'n injuomu phakhan ngakna inleinei halli anu'n amadiang ati, “Sapa, angsik ah nang in keinidiang hin ninathome? Napa li kei'n malung kapoong tak ah nangkha kinnaentok eii.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Halli Ama'n inmani diang heimasang, “Angsik-ah nangni'n kei ningna entokme? kei'n Kapa inna kaomsik tihi nangni'n jetmak chuwabe?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Halli ama irilpi kha inmani'n leijet matormu.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n chongjuina aleineiya inmanile Nazareth tiang inleikir, halli anu'n akasuok choun rakip kha amalung suungnga aleida. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Jisu'n singna theinali taksa ah hong insoonna, Pathian khat-um mipui ngai minriang nakha alei inkheel. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1SA 2:26">1 Sam 2:26</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:4">Chongngil 3:4</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">John Baptist in Pathian chong iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Jn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Tiberius in kum soomleira-nga reng hongroonna kum khan, Pontius Pilate kha-um Judea waikaroon alei eii, halli Herod kha um Galilee ramkaroon alei eii, halli ama naipa Philip kha Iturea khat-um Trachonitis ramsuung karoon alei eii, Lysaniah kha Abilene ramkaroon alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Annas li Caiaphas hi thiampu kalian inlei eii, halli Pathian chongkha Zechariah sapa John diang neelramma aleijuo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Khale inruoiya John in Jordan tuidung ikakuol ramsuung rakip ah aleisiya, “Ningmalung thuul inlang baptized thoro, halli Pathian in ningmanu ngaikha nangaidam pisik ei iti chong kha aleiril.”<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Pathian chongkachoi Isaiah larik ah lei-injia angnga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mi inkhat in neelramma aleikheek:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Pumi lamkha minsuuk ru;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">halli ama sinasik lamkha mintuunru! <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Akuok rakip kha aminsipsik eii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">chingmuol khat-um chingbung insaang rakip alaminzoolsik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Lam kakem rakip alamintuunsik,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">kathamak lam rakip aminthasik eii.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Miring rakip in Pathian Sanminringna kha inlamusik eii!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />John diang baptized kathosik kaheiwa Mipui rakipdiang ama'n inmani diang aleitipi, “E maruul sangai!” “Pathian rachaakna akajuosik makheiya ning inthup matornasik eii tihi atu'n natipiyame? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Ningmanu makheiya malung kinthuuljei tina chuon kha malarru, halli ningni karra Abraham kha kinpukaru eii tikhaimaru. Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Pathian in hiwa lungpui ngaihi Abraham tuli sangai amin-eii mator. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Jn 8:33</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Han thingkuung kha arajungnga tukkhiak nasik-ah rei insuuk ah aomjei, Thingkuung rakip akara katha kakara makseng reiya tukkhiak inta meiya inhaalsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Matt 7:19</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Mipui'n amadiang inrakel, “Halle angme keini'n kinthosik?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ama'n inmani diang amasang, “Atu ka-ang in songkol inni anei inchu, kaneimak padiang inkhat perase, halli atu ka-ang baksik kanei ngai innum hiwa angnga thorusu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Rampar kakhoom mi lekkhat baptize kathosik-ah inheiwa halli inmani'n amadiang inleirakel, “Karu, angme keini'n kithosik?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 7:29">Luk 7:29</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ama'n inmani diang aleitipi. Ningni'n ningleisik kasuok kheella leimaru,<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Raalmi lekkhat innum amadiang inleirakel, “Keini leii angme kinthosik?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Ama'n inmani diang ati, “Mi ngaikha kadikmak lamma sial leimaru emakli kadikmak noonkuung pemaru. Nangni'n ningthoman nape khan hunru.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />John Jarra Mipui'n inmalungnga inleingaidonle inruoiya inlei inkel, amahi Christa be e-makbe. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />John'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei'n nangni kha tuiya baptized kanatho, takkha kei neek ah kalok mi inkhat kha ajuosik eii, Kei'n ama kekokrui kha kashuut sik a-um rahoi emong, Ama'n nangni kha Ratha inthiang li meiya baptized nathosik eii. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ama'n saangzaap nakha akut ah achoiya, saangseng zaapthiangta sapangnga adasik eii, halli sarasi sengkha hektik kaboi meikhan ahaalsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Khale inruoiya John in omchan intei angjet ah mipui diang chong kahoi kha aleiril halli inmani omchan ngaikha thuulnasik aleirilpi.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Takkha John in waikaroon Herod kha leiran, ajarchu Herodias anaipa Philip numei aneipiya halli ama'n kathamak choun angjet um aleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Matt 14:3</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:18">18</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Khale inruoiya Herod in kheella kathamakthei chuon aleitho-ah John kha mikhumna ah aleida.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Baptism thona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matt 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Mi rakipkha Baptized inleithosuo phakhan, Jisu kha-um baptized aleitho. Ama'n Pathian aleini phakhan marwaan alei inlong,<verse eid="LUK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Halli Ratha Inthiang kha taksa omchanna wathu angnga amadiang aleijuo. Halli marwaan makheiya rasa'n ajuoti, “Nanghi kei iminriang khet kasapa na eii, nangdiang kei kamalung atai.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Inphut 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Minpkla 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Matt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luk 9:35</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Phungrui</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matt 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Jisu'n achoun aleiphut phakhan, Ama kha kum soomthum alei eii. Halli amahi mipui'n Heli sapa Joseph sa eii tia inleingaidon, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli hi Matthat sapa eii, Matthat hi Levi sapa eii, Levi hi Melchi sapa eii, Melchi hi Jannai sapa eii, Jannai hi Joseph sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Joseph hi Mattathias sapa eii, Mattathias hi Amos sapa eii, Amos hi Nahum sapa eii, Nahum hi Esli sapa eii, Esli hi Naggai sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Naggai hi Maath sapa eii, Maath hi Mattathias sapa eii, Mattathias hi Semein sapa eii, Semein hi Josech sapa eii, Josech hi Joda sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joda hi Joanan sapa eii, Joanan hi Rhesa sapa eii, Rhesa hi Zerubbabel sapa eii, Zerubbabel hi Shealtiel sapa eii, Shealtiel hi Neri sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Melchi hi Addi sapa eii, Addi hi Cosam sapa eii, Cosam hi Elmadam sapa eii, Elmadam hi Er sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er hi Joshua sapa eii, Joshua hi Eliezer sapa eii, Eliezer hi Jorim sapa eii, Jorim hi Matthat sapa eii, Matthat hi Levi sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi hi Simeon sapa eii, Simeon hi Judah sapa eii, Judah hi Joseph sapa eii, Joseph hi Jonam sapa eii, Jonam hi Eliakim sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliakim hi Melea sapa eii, Melea hi Menna sapa eii, Menna hi Mattatha sapa eii, Mattatha hi Nathan sapa eii, Nathan hi David sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />David hi Jesse sapa eii, Jesse hi Obed sapa eii, Obed hi Boaz sapa eii, Boaz hi Salmon sapa eii, Salmon hi Nahshon sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nahshon hi Amminadab sapa eii, Amminadab hi Admin sapa eii, Admin hi Arni sapa eii, Arni hi Hezron sapa eii, Hezron hi Perez sapa eii, Perez hi Judah sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Judah hi Jacob sapa eii, Jacob hi Isaac sapa eii, Isaac hi Abraham sapa eii, Abraham hi Tera sapa eii, Tera hi Nahor sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor hi Serug sapa eii, Serug hi Reu sapa eii, Reu hi Peleg sapa eii, Peleg hi Eber sapa eii, Eber hi Shilah sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shilah hi Cainan sapa eii, Cainan hi Arphaxad sapa eii, Arphaxad hi Shem sapa eii, Shem hi Noah sapa eii, Noah hi Lamech sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamech hi Methuselah sapa eii, Methuselah hi Enoch sapa eii, Enoch hi Jared sapa eii, Jared hi Mahalaleel sapa eii, Mahalaleel hi Kenan sapa eii, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan hi Enosh sapa eii, Enosh hi Seth sapa eii, Seth hi Adam sapa eii, Adam hi Pathian sapa eii.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Matheemna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matt 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Mk 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Jisu kha Ratha Inthiang in asip-ah Jordan makheiya ahongkirra ama kha Ratha'n neelramtiang aleiruoi, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Nisoommili seitan in aleimatheemma iteii leibakmak, khawa hekli awon aleichaampi.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Seitan'n amadiang aleiti, “Nang in Pathian sapa na-e-inchu, hiwa lunghi waipool uolro tipiro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chong inthiang in ati, ‘Miring ngai'n waipool abit ringnunu.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Innidan 8:3</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Khale inruoiya seitan in ching insaangtiang aruoiya inoottheiya manmasituol rengram rakip aleiminmu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />“Kei'n hiwangai rakip ranak khat-um neinaak ngaihi kanapesik eii,” Seitan'n aleti, “Hiwa ngai rakiphi kei kadiang inape kha ejei, halli kei'n kipezoot miring diang kapesik eii. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nang in chubei nanatho inchu hiwa-ngai rakip hi nang nata esik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chong Inthiang in ati, ‘Nang na Pumi Pathian khabit chubei nathosik khat-um ama sepabit nathosik eii!’ ”<char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Innidan 6:13</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Khale inruoiya seitan in Jerusalem tiang aruoiya biak-inn chung insaangnakhet munna aminngirra amadiang aleiti, “Nanghi Pathian sapa na-e inchu hiwa makheiya inchoomro. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Chong inthiang khan hin ati, nang kanasansik-ah ‘Pathian in ama tirton kha chong peta juotirsik eii.’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Minpkla 91:11</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 91:12">12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Halli inmani'n nang nakeii kha lungngai khan nasukmaknasik ah inmani'n inkut ngaikhan innaleipomsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Takkha Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chong inthiang in ati, ‘Nang in na Pumi Pathian kha madan in enmaro.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Innidan 6:16</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Seitan in Jisu kha angrakip lamma matheemsuoli ama'n aphakhat sik-ah Jisu kha aleimathaan.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Gelilee ah Choun Ileiphut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matt 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mk 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Jisu kha Ratha ranak in sip-ah Galilee tiang aleikir, halli ama jarra khawa ramsuung rakip ah araming kha lei-inthang. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ama'n Synagogues ah aleiminchu, halli mi rakip in inleiminpaak.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nazareth ah Jisu Inleizootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matt 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Khale iruoiya Jisu'n ama honglok namun Nazareth ah aleisi, halli Sabbath nikhoni Synagogue ah a-ngai angnga aleisiya ama'n Pathian chong kateelsik ahongngir, <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />halli amadiang Pathian chongkachoipa Isaiah larik kha inleipeii. Ama'n larik kha aphongnga hinthoa inleimajia ajuomu,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Pumi Ratha kha kei kachungnga aom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">ajarchu ama'n keihi sara ngaidiang chongkahoi karil sik-ah anakadangjei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">halli ama'n mikhumna-ah kaom ngaidiang katanna chong karilsik, khat um</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Mit kamumak ngaikha minmunasik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">halli inkanengjuon mi ngaikha kakatansik, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 61:2">2</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />halli Pumi in ami ngaikha sannasik ah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:19">aphakha juotung sikjei tia minjetnasik ah inajuotir eii.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Jisu'n larik kha akhumma, sepa kathopa diang aleipekirnook ah alei in-ong, Synagogue ah kaom mirakip in amadiang katha ah inlei-en. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Halli ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Awini nangni'n ningrangai jarra hiwa Pathian chonghi huui tungjei.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Halli mi rakip in ama jarra kathatak ah inleiril, ama murra inphut juokasuok rawaan chongngaikhan inleingak ah inmani'n inleiti, “Hiwa miring pahi Joseph sapa emak abe?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n suoilekleiya hiwa chongngil hi kei kadiang ningnatisik eii, ‘Kathiam, napumtak damna inpero.’ Keini'n kin ijet Capernaumma nang in chuon nitho rakip kha hiwa nang nakhopui hinnum thonookro. <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangkha natipi kate,” “Pathian chong kachoi ngaihi angtikseng inkhuosuung achu kayanunu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jn 4:44</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Takkha Kei'n inthiangnga natipikate, Elijah phakhan Israel la chuulmei katamtak inleiom, halli kumthum le tharuk hi ruo leisurmak jarra khawa ramsuung rakip ah bukawaang aleisuok, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Reng 17:1</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Elijah kha tu diang um leiminsimak, takkha Zerephath inti Sidon ramsuungnga kaom chuulmei numeisanu diang aleiminsi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 17:8-16">1 Reng 17:8-16</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Khale inruoiya Pathian chong kachoi Elisha phakhan, Israel karra mi angjet takbang ri karoon inleiom; tuteii kha kadam leiommu takkha Syrian makheiya Naaman khabit aleidam.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="2KI 5:1-14">2 Reng 5:1-14</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Synagogue ah kaom mipui'n inleijet phakhan, inmani'n inleiraang. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Inmani'n inhong intheiya Jisu kha inmani khopui makheiya inheiruoiya inkhuo luona chingbungnga inleirruoi. Halli ama kha karoolla matanasik ah inleingaidon, <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />takkha ama'n mipui karra aleiluut ah suokdeljei.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathamak Ratha kaluut Pasal inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Jisu'n Galilee khuopui Capernaum tiang aleisi, Sabbath nikhoni ama'n aleiminchu. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Halli ama minchu nakhan inmani'n inleingak, ajarchu ama'n ranak kaom tak-ah chong aleiril. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Matt 7:28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Synagogue khan ratha kathamak kaluut miring inkhat aleiom; halli ama'n inringnga ahongkheek, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“E! Nazareth Jisu, Angme keinidiang makheiya nimanuom? keini rakip kanamingmang sik-ah nijuobe? kei'n tu na-eme tihi kanajet, Pathian diang makheiya inthiangkha na eii!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Jisu'n ratha kathamak diang aleiran, “Omchian inlang amadiang makheiya heisuokro!” Raikhuo khan ama kha mipui maikuungnga juoworjuolla ama kha iteii minpop lekleiya asuokjei.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Mipui'n ngakna inleineiya khatli khatdiang inlei-inti, “Angkachang chongme hiwahi? ranak li thomatorna kanei hiwa mipa'n kathamak ratha ngaidiang chong apeili inmani'n inheisuok!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Halli Jisu jarra khawa ramsuungnga kaom mun rakip ah inleirilthangjei.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mipui angjet Midamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matt 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Jisu'n intheiya Synagogue alei mathaanna Simon innkhan aleiluut, Simon tarpi kha ritun kangar in aleina-ah aleiom, halli inmani'n kananu jarra Jisu diang inleirilpi, <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Jisu'n kananu koolla ngirra ritundiang aleirakook, halli ritun khan alei mathaanjei, khawa suoa numeisanu khan intheiya inmani sepa aleitho.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Kani ajuota phakhan rirai karoon angjet inmani'n Jisu diang inheiruoi; ama'n inmani rakip takchungnga akut duongnga mindamna aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />“Nanghi Pathian sapa na eii tia raikhuo angjet in inkheek ah inleisuok.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Takkha Jisu'n raikhuo diang ranna aleinei, halli chongkha leiminrilmak, ajarchu inmani'n injet amahi Christa eii.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Synagogues ah Chong Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Khuo ahongwar phakhan Jisu'n mi ommakna muna aleisi, Takkha mipui'n ama kha inhei entok, halli inmani'n injuomu phakhan Jisu kha inmanile inthenpuimak nasik inleitho. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Takkha inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n Pathian Rengram chong kahoihi aleiilaak khuopui diang um kajuorilsik eii, ajarchu hiwa sikbeiya keihi inajuotir eii.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Khale inruoiya khawa ramsuungnga kaom Synagogue ngaikhan Pathian chong aleirilpi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamruoi Ma-insakhet Koina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matt 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Jisu'n Gennesaret tuidiil pangnga aleingirra aleiom phakhan mipui'n Pathian chong karangaisik ama kooltiang innengtirra inheiwa. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:1">Matt 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:9">Mk 3:9</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 3:10">10</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Halli ama'n tuipangnga rakuong inni aleimu, takkha ngakasur ngaichu rakuong makheiya insuok ah leen inrasuwa inleiom. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Jisu'n rakuong inkhat ah aleiluut, khawakha Simon ta alei eii, halli ama'n aleitipi tuilaitiang lektei heinamru. Halli Jisu'n rakuongnga in-ongnga mipuidiang kaminchu aleiphut.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ama'n arilsuoa, Simon diang aleiti, “Rakuong kha tui inthuup natiang namluutro, halli naleen kha nga surnasik worro.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simon'n aleimasang “Karu,” “Keini'n Zaansoot leen kinworra iteii kinsurmak ejei. Takkha nang iti dungjungya kei'n leenhi wortakte.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jn 21:3</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Inmani'n leen ngaikha inwor phakhan nga katamtak lei-inkhit ah leen ngaikha leichetsik leithojei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 21:3">Jn 21:3</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Halli inmani'n rakuong khat ah kaom insap ngaikha inkut inzaap ah nasannasik inleikoi. Inmani'n inheiwa ah rakuong innikha nga inleiminsip wiak ah inmani rakuong kha tuiya luutsik aleitho. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simon Peter in kasuok rakip amu phakhan, Jisu kekuungnga inbok ah aleiti, “Ka Pumi” kei kadiang makheiya sitaro, ajarchu keihi manu karoon mi ka eii.<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simon khat-um amale kaleiom mi rakip in inmani'n nga katamtak inleisur jarra ngakna inleinei, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Khawa khanna kaleiom kha Simon le inlop Zebedee sapa Jame li John in eii, halli Jisu'n Simon diang aleiti, “Chimaro; atuun makheiya inphut nanghi mikasur na-esikjei.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Inmani rakuong kha muongtiang inleinuksuok, angrakip inmathaanna halli Jisu kha inleijui.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Takbang ri karoon Pasal Inkhat Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matt 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Jisu'n khuopui inkhat ah aleiom phakhan, pasal inkhat takbang ri karoon inkhat aheiwa, ama'n Jisu aleimu phakhan, inbok ah Jisu diang aleini, “Pumi, nang nalungdou e-inchu keihi namindam mator nate!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Jisu'n akut duongnga ama kha aleikatook, “Kei'n kazoot,” “Damtaro!” khawapha takkhan takbang ri'n amathaanjei. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Jisu'n amadiang chongpena aleinei, “Tudiang tipimaro, takkha nang in si inlang thiampu ngaidiang juoinmuro; khale inruoiya nang mindamna jarra Moses chongpeii dungjuiya mipui diang sakhi enasik doiphur juoinchangro.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levi 14:1-32</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Takkha Jisu jarra chongkha kheella rilthiangna inlainei, halli mipui'n amadiang chong karangaisik khat-um kana ngaikha indamnasik amadiang inheiwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Takkha Jisu'n mi lengmakna mun ngaikhan aleisiya Pathian aleini.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Apangkathi Pasal Inkhat Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matt 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Nisuo khatni Jisu'n aleiminchu phakhan, Galilee, Judea khat-um Jerusalem khuopui makheiya kaheiwa Pharisee li juina Dan karu ngai'n akoolla inlei in-ong, halli Pumi ranak mindam matornakha Jisu diang aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Pasal lekkhat in apangkathi miring inkhat azaalnale inruoiya inheichoi, halli inmani'n mindamnasik beiya insuungtiang keiluutnasik khat-um Jisu koolla danasik ah inleitho. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mipui katamtak in ajar eya leiluutpui matormu, inmani'n innchungnga inkaalla innchung inminwengnga ama zaalna khale inruoiya mipui karra Jisu maikuungnga injuomachum. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Jisu'n inmani ngamna aleimupha khan ama'n ati, “Suopui, Nang namanu ngaikha kanangai dampijei.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Dan karu ngaili Pharisee ngai'n inmalung suungnga inngaidonna inleiti, “Pathian karilsehi tume? Pathian eleiya, tu innum manu ngaidam matormu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Jisu'n inmani i-ngaidonkha aleijet phakhan inmani diang aleitipi, “Angjarra hiwa ngaihi ning malungnga ning ngaidonme? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />‘Nang namanu ngaikha kana ngaidamjei,’ emakli ‘Inthei inlang sitaro’ tihi hume kabei? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nangni'n jetningte miring Sapa in manmasituolla manu ngaidamnasik ranak anei” Ama'n apang kathipa diang ati, “Kei'n nang nadiang kanati, inthei inlang nazaalna choi inlang na inntiang kirtaro.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Khawa phakhan pasalpa khan inmani maikuungnga intheiya ama azaalna kha achoiya inntiang Pathian minpaak ah aleikirjei. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Inmani rakip in ngakna inleineiya Pathian inleiminpaak, halli kachi khan leisip ah inti, “Awini eini'n angtuk inlak chuonme nimujei!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Levi Ikoisuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matt 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Hiwahi ahekli Jisu'n aleisuok ah rampar kakhom araming Levi kha ama chuon thona inna in-ongnga ileiomkha aleimu, Jisu'n amadiang atipi, “Kei najuiro.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Angrakip ama'n amathaanna khat-um intheiya Jisu nuk ajuijei.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Halli Levi'n a-inna bubakna kalok inkhat Jisu sik-ah aleiminsuuk, khawakha rampar kakhoom khat-um aleiilaak mi katamtak inmani khale inlei-inong. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Pharisee li Dan karu lekkhat in asiamruoi ngaidiang inleitipi. “Ang jarrame nangni'n rampar kakhoom li manu karoon ngaile bak-in suomna ningnei?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 15:1">Luk 15:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 15:2">2</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Jisu'n inmani diang leimasang, “Kanamak ngaidiang kathiam arei ommak, takkha kana ngaisik achu areiom. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Kei'n Pathian kajetngai kakoi kijuo emak, takkha manukaroon ngai malung minthuulnasik kijuo eii.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saakngeina Jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matt 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Inmani'n Jisu diang inleiti, “Ang jarrame John siamruoi ngai'n apha rakip bu ingeiya Pathian inni, halli Pharisee siamruoi ngai um khawa angnga inleitho; takkha nang nasiamruoi ngaichu inbak in-in.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Moipa kha inmanile omsuom laikhan moikaruoi kajuo mi ngaikha bu minngei niyabe? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Takkha moipa kha inmani diangnga inphut laruoidel nasik nikhuo kha alajuosik eii, khawapha khan inmani'n bu inngeisik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Jisu'n hiwa chong minkhina aleitipi: “Tuteii in puonkathar lek inkhat puonmaruo ah kathuidelmu, khawakha natho inchu akathar lek kha kamaruo le inhoinuni. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Tuteii in theibomju kathar kha jutuong maruo khan damu, khawakha ningtho inchu theibomju kathar in jutuong maruo kha minkoita aminmangsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Takkha theibomju kathar khachu akatha jutuongnga nidasik eii! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />halli inkhat innum theibomju maruo innli thabomju kathar kha inzootnunu, ajarchu ama'n ati, theibomju maruo hi athadoom.”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Sabbath Jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matt 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Sabbath nikhuoni Jisu'n gehubil laiya rakaanna aleisi, halli ama siamruoi ngai'n gehulor ngaikha inmani'n inchinna inkut ah inkanurra inleibak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Innidan 23:25</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Pharisee lekkhat in inleitipi, “Sabbath nikhuoni thosik ka-emak chuonkha angsia nithome?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Nangni'n lasermak chube, David in awon chaampili ama inruoipui ngaile inthokha angme? <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 6:3">6:3</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ama'n angtho thoa Pathian inna aluutli Thiampu eleiya tuteii innum bakkachamak Pathian diang inpeii waipool kha aleiya abak halli ama inruoipui mi ngaidiang um aleipeii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levi 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Jisu'n inmanidiang aleitipi, “Miring sapa hi Sabbath Pumi kha um eii.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akut Kathi Pasal inkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matt 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mk 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Sabbath nikhatni Jisu'n synagogue ah aleisiya minchuna aleinei, Pasal inkhat akut changtiang kathi inkhat aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Sabbath nikhuoni Jisu'n mi mindambe tia Dan karu li Pharisee lekkhat in ama kha injuichak ah noonkuung penasik ah ajar inleientok. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani rakip ngaidonna kha aleijetpi, halli akut kathi pasal padiang aleitipi, “Inthei inlang matiang juongirro.” Pasalpa'n intheiya khawakhan ajuongir. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleitipi, “Kei'n nangnidiang kanarakel: Sabbath nikhuoni Dan in izoot thokacha kha katha khabe emakli kase khabe? tichu ringkhuo sansik emakli ringkhuo minmang sikbe?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ama'n amit en minloonna inmani diang ahei enna; pasal padiang ati <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">araangnga aleiti.</char></note> “Nakutkha heisoonro.” Ama'n aheisoon, halli ama kutkha aleidam nookjei.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Inmani'n inraangtheiya Jisu chungnga angme nithomatorsik tia khatli khatdiang inlei inbiak.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Tirton Soomleini Kadangna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matt 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Khawa phakhan Jisu'n amuoltiang aleikalla Pathian kani aleisi, halli zaansoot Pathian diang aleini. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Khuokha ajuowarra, ama siamruoi ngaikha akoichunna inmani karra soomleini kadangnga inmanikha Tirton tia raming aleiphuo: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon (amahi Peter tia inkoi) halli ama anai Andrew; James, John, Philip khat-um Bartholomew, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matthew li Thomas, James Alphaeus sapa, Simon Zealot tia inkoi, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Judas, James sapa, halli Judas Iscariot Jisu kajuorpa eii.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Minchu nale Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matt 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Jisu'n chingmuol makheiya atirton ngaile ajuochumma inzoolna munna asiamruoi angjetle injuongir. Halli mipui katamtak Judea ramsuung khat-um Jerusalem makheiya khat-um Tyre li Sidon tuipuikham makheiya; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Jisu koolla karangaisik khat-um inmani kana rakip mindamnasik ah inheiwa. Khale inruoiya ratha kathamak ngai'n minpoongna kaneingai um inheiwa ah inleidam. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Mipui'n ama kha katooknasik inleitho, halli ama ranak khan aheisuok ah mi rakip damna inleinei.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hoina khat-um Poongna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matt 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang ahei enna aleiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Sara ngaikha rawaan katha in-eii, ajarchu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Pathian Rengram kha nangnita eii!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Tuunna won kachaam nangni ngaikha rawaan katha ning eii ajarchu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">nangnikha nawai minkhopsik eii.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">“Tuunna Kachap nangni kha rawaan katha ning eii ajarchu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ningla innuisik eii!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Miring sapa jarra mirakip in namatir, nazootmak, narilthai, halli nangkha kathamak na eii kanati nangni kha rawaan khatha ning ejei!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pet 4:14</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Rokru khawa phakhan, rok in laamru, ajarchu nang nachuon thomankha marwaan ramma alok, khawakha angnga inmani pile pu ngaikhannum Pathian chong kachoi ngaidiang inleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Khang 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Chuon 7:52</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Takkha angtuk poongna khame inchong nangnidiang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">nangni'n hoina ningmusuojei!”<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Tuunna won kasipngai nangni kha angtuk chikaome ajarchu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nangni'n inwai ningta kachaam in lasipsik eii!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Tuunna ka-innui ngai nangnidiang angtuk chikaomme ajarchu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nangni'n in-ngui ningta ninglachapsik eii!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Mi rakip in innaminpaak nangnikha Poongna kha eii; ajarchu inpi inpu ngai innum kadikmak Pathian chong kachoi ngaidiang hiwa angnga inleitho.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ninhalpui ngaikha Minriangro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matt 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Takkha kei kadiang kanarangai nangnidiang kei'n kanati, ning inhalpui ngaikha minriangru, kana enzootmak mi diang kathakha thoru, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />nang nadiang khumak kanasaam ngaikha rawaan pero, halli nang nadiang kase kanatho ngaisik Pathian diang nipiro. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Mi ngai'n na-ngeem inkhattiang inkabeel inchu inkhattiang um doupi nookro; nang napuonsin kha mi inkhat in nakasut inchu nasongkol kha um pedelro. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nang nadiang kanani mi rakipdiang pero, halli nang naneinaak kaleikha nikirkhai maro. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Nang in mi ngaidiang ni minthozoot angnga nang innum mi ngaidiang thoro.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 7:12">Matt 7:12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Nang kanaminriang mi ngaikhabit naminriang inle, angtho thoa rawaan mutinname? manukaroon ngai innum inmani kamiriang ngaikha inminriang! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Halli nang in nang nadiang katha katho ngaidiangbit katha natho inchu, angtho thoa rawaan mutinname? manu karoon ngai innum khawachu intho! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Khat-um nang in kanape matorsik ngaidiangbit sial naminwei inle, angmo nemna mutinna? Manu karoon ngai um manu karoon ngaidiang sial inminwei, in-ang rip ah munooknasik-ah. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Ning inhalpui ngaidiang mingriangru khat-um akatha kha thoru; minweiru halli nachangnook sik eii tia ngaidon khaimaru, Nang nathoman kha kalok ah nachangsik, halli nang in insaangkhet Pathian sangai na-esik eii, Ajarchu ama'n minriang kajetmak khat-um manukaroon ngaidiang aminriang. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Nipa Pathian hi minriang kajet angnga minriang kajet eru.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi ngaidiang Chongkatan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matt 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Mi ngaidiang chong tanmaru, halli nangnidiang um Pathian in chong natannuni, mi ngai rilsemaru, halli Pathian innum nang narilsenuni, ngaidamru, nangkha um Pathian in nangaidam sik eii. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Mi ngaidiang pero, halli Pathian innum nangdiang napete. Katha minteiichu, namdeen inlang, kanik inlang khat-um minliamthaak inlang pero, halli nang iminteii angnga Pathian innum minteiita najuo penooksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Jisu'n inmani diang hiwachong minkhinahi aleiti: Mit kacho inkhat in mit kacho inkhat lam keitheiniabe? akei inchu, inmani innikha khurra tamaknuwabe? <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Matt 15:14</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Inchu mi rakip in ama karu neek ah kalok ommu, takkhat inchu mi rakip in kathatak ah inchusuo inchu inmani kha inkaru in-angsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Matt 10:24</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Namit ah kaom thinglek kha mulekleiya, angjarra na-u nanai mit ah kaom madir kha nimume? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Angtho thoa na-u nanai ngaidiang natisime, namit ah madir kha nakhaipi kate, tichu nang in namit ah thinglek kha mulekleiya? Nang mi katha omchanna inleem mi! mansakhet ah namit ah thinglek kha khaimasaro, kha e-inchu nang na-u nanai mit ah kaom madir kha inthiangnga munate.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akuungli Akara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matt 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Thingkuung katha'n akara kathamak karanuni khat-um thingkuung kathamak in akara katha karanuni. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Thingkuung rakip akara khan nijetmator; ralingbil makheiya theichang kara khiaknunu, halli ralingkuung makheiya theibom kara khiaknunu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Matt 12:33</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Akatha mi'n amalung suungnga akatha abuk ah idakhan akatha omchan aheikeisuo, halli akathamak mi'n amalung suungnga kathamak abuk ah idakhan akathamak omchan aheikeisuo. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Matt 12:34</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inn Kasak Inni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matt 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Ang jarra ‘Pumi, Pumi,’ tia ningnakoime, halli kei iti khachu thomakchu? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Halli atu ka-ang in kei kadiang heiwali kachong rakip karangai khat-um kajui amakha keihi nangdiang angkachang mi eme tikha kanaminmusik eii. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ama kha khur inthuuk akhuorra lungpui chungnga inn kasak miring inkhatle in-ang eii. Halli tuikha ajuolianna inn kha ajuoshuk ah inn kha katuul matormak, ajarchu inn kha katha ah asak jarra eii. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Takkha atu ka-ang in kachongchu karangai kajuichu kajuimak mi khachu, inn ngirna boolleiya neipil chungnga inn kasak ka-ang eii, halli tui ajuolianna inn kha woikhat ajuosuk phakhan inn kha aleichiam darjei!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Roman raalmi kalokpa suok inkhat imindam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matt 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Jisu'n mipui rakipdiang chong aleirilsuo phakhan, ama'n Capernaum tiang aleiluut. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Halli Rome raalmi kalokpa'n iminriangkhet suok inkhat aleiom; khawa mipa kha ana-ah thisik aleitho, <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Roman kalokpa'n Jisu jarra aleijet phakhan, Jisu kha heiwa inlang suokpa kha juomindam nasik-ah, Jihudi upa lekkhatdiang juotipinasik aleitir. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Inmani'n Jisu koolla inheiwa ah katha tak-ah inleiti, “Hiwa mi'n nang sannakha inthiangnga amanuom. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ama'n keini mi ngai aminriang khat-um ama'n keinisik-ah synagogue anasakpi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n inmanile aleisi, ama'n inn makkheiya inlaakjen phakhan, raalmi kalokpa'n ama asapngai aleitirra ajuominti, “Pumi natheinuo ah poongna inneimaro, nang in kei ka-inna heiwasik hi rahoi kasuok emong, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />halli kei um nang nakoolla kaheiwasik rahoi kasuok emong, khawa jarra Chongnga natipiro halli kei kasuokpa kha adamsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ajarchu kei um ranak kanei nuoiya kaom ka eii, halli kei kanuoiya raalmi angjet inom, Kei'n chongpena kanei, ‘Siru!’ katili insi; halli aleiilaak diang, ‘Heiwaru!’ katili inheiwa; halli kei'n kasuok ngaidiang, ‘Hiwahi thoru!’ katili intho.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Jisu'n hiwa ajet phakhan amadiang ngakna aleinei; halli Jisu'n inlet-ah ama nukkajui mipuidiang aleitipi, “Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, hiwa ka-ang ingamna kalok hi kei'n Israel ngai kara-um lamumong!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Halli i-tir mi ngaikha inntiang inleikirra, inmani'n ama suokpa kha adamma ileiom kha injuomu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Chuunmei Sapa Minringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Khawa suoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:11. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">innot theiya khawa thengnga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat ah inchen </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ni-khuo khat thengnga.</char></note> Jisu'n Nain inti khopuikhan aleisi, halli asiamruoi khat-um mipui katamtak amale inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Khuopui luutna kotkuung aleinai phakhan, mikathi inkhat reii-nasik ah inheisuokpui, akathi mikha chuulmei sapa inkhatbit kha alei eii, halli mipui katamtak in khawa khuopui makheiya numeisanule inleisuok. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Pumi'n khawaneinu amu phakhan, Ama malungnga khawa nainusik-ah poongna aleinei, halli ama'n aleiti, “Chap maro,” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />halli ama'n asiya u-pukha ajuo katookli akathipa karapuut ngaikha inleingir, halli Jisu'n ati, “Kadoong pasal! Kei'n kanati, intheiro!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Halli akathi miringpakha ahong intheiya chongkaril aleiphut, halli Jisu'n naipang pakha anudiang aleipeii.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Inmani rakipkha kachi'n leisip ah Pathian inleiminpaak ah inti, “Eini karra Pathian chongkachoi kalian inkhat inlarjei!” Halli inmani'n inti, “Pathian in ama mi ngai kasansik ajuojei.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Khawa ramsuung khat-um innaipui khuopuisuung rakip ah Jisu jarra inleirilthang.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">John Baptist makheiya Taangwa ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Matt 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Halli John siamruoi ngai'n angrakip kasuok ngaikha amadiang inleirilpi phakhan, ama'n inmani inni kha aleikoi, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />halli John in asiamruo inni kha Pumi diang hintho inlang juorakelru tia aleiminsi, “Nanghi John in ileiti akalajuosik ama kha na-ebe? emakli keini'n miring inkhat kinla-en sikbe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Halli Inmani'n Jisu koolla inleitung phakhan inleitipi, “John Baptist in keinihi hintho inlang juorakelru tia nang nadiang naheitir eii, nanghi kalajuosik mi kha na-ebe, emakli keini'n aleiilaak inkhat kinla-en sikbe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Khawapha takkhan Jisu'n kana angjet, rirai kathamak, khat-um ratha kathamak angjet aleimindam, halli mitkacho angjet-um aleiminmu. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Mitkacho khan muna innei, kasitheimak in insithei, takbangri karoonngai amindam,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22. </char><char style="fk" closed="false">amindam: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5:12.</char></note> kuorkaseet in injet, kathi kha aminring, halli chongkahoi kha sara ngaidiang arilpi tia nangni'n ningmuli ning ijet ngaihi si inlang John diang juotipiru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Isa 61:1</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Kei jarra inngamsammak mi ngaikha rawaan katha in-eii!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />John siamruoi ngai'n inleisisuoli, Jisu'n mipuidiang John jarra chongkaril aleiphut: “Nangni'n ang mukate tia neelramma ningsime? thikaraang in leihar ikatuul ka-en ningsibe? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ang ka-enme ningni'n ningsuok ah ningsi? puondiar katha inluk ah kaom mi ka-en ningsibe? Enru, enzoot kaom puondiar inluk mi khachu reng inna nimusik eii. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Angme ningsiya ningjuo en? Pathian chongkachoipa khabe? kei'n nangnidiang kanati, takkha nangni'n ningjuomu kha Pathian chong kachoipa neek-ah kakheel eii. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ajarchu John hi eii chong inthiang in ileitikha. ‘Pathian in ati, kei'n nang nalam kaboolsik katirton kha nang matiang kajuotirsik eii.’<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Khat-um Kei'n nangnidiang kanati,” “Tuteii innum John neek-ah kalok kaleiring laommu. Takkha Pathian Rengramma kasiinkhet kha John neek-ah alokwiai.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Khawajarra miring rakip in Jisu diang inlei rangai, khat-um aru ka-eya rampar kakhoomngai innum John diang makheiya baptized inthoa Pathian kha kadik eii tia inzoot.<verse eid="LUK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Takkha Pharisee ngaili dankaru ngai inchu Pathian lungdou kha inmanisik-ah leizootmu halli John in baptized inthosik kha-um leizootmu. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Matt 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Halli Jisui'n aleitinook, “Atuunlaiya mi ngaidiang kei'n angle kaminkhi sikme? halli angme inmani imanuom? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Inmani ngaihi phaiya naipang in-ongnga khatli inkhat diang inkheek ah hin intia kaom ka-ang eii, ‘Keini'n inmanisik moiruoina dar kinminringpi phakhan, inmani'n laamnunu! keini'n mithina laa kinsakpi phakhan inmani'n chapnunu.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Han John Baptist ajuolai bu a-ngei halli ju inmak halli nangni'n ningti, ‘Amadiang raikhuo om!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Pathian sapa kha abak a-inna aleijuo phakhan, ‘Enru, Ama hi! mahaam kalian khat-um jubuolrai eii, halli rampar kakhoom ngaili manukaroon ngai sappui eii tia nangni'n ningti!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Pathian singna theinakha, ama kangamna mi rakip in kadik eii tia inleiminmu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Pharisee Simon Inna Ileisi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Halli Pharisee inkhat in Jisu kha amale bubaknasik aleikoi, halli Jisu'n ama inna aleisiya bubaknasik ah alei in-ong. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Halli khawa khuopui suungkhan manu karoon numeisa inkhat aleiom, Khawa numeisanu khan Jisu kha Pharisee ngai inna bu bak-ah om tihi inleijet phakhan, ama'n alabaster kok kasip arim kahoi sariak aheichoi,<verse eid="LUK 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />halli Jisu kekuungnga aleingirra achap ah akeiikha amit rathi'n aleiminthupi, halli asamma akeiikha aleinuulpi, akeiikha aleimazoop, halli sariakrim kahoikha aleikanootpi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 26:7">Matt 26:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3">Mk 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Pharisee pa'n aleimu phakhan atheinuo ah alei in-ngaidon, “Hiwa miringpa hi inthiangnga Pathian chong kachoi e-inchu, ama'n ajetsik suok atume khat-um angkachang numeisame ama kakatook hi, ajarchu amahi manu karoon mi eii!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Simon, Kei'n nang nadiang angkemekhat kanatisik aom.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Ama'n leimasang, angme Karu?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Halli Jisu'n kamindik aleiphut, “Sepupa diang sialkapuuk miring inni inleiom,” “Miring inkhat in dangkaru rajara-nga aleipuuk halli miring inkhat pa'n dangka soomra-nga aleipuuk. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Han Inmani inni'n leithuul matormujei, khale inruoiya ama'n inmani inni kha ngaidampi jei, atu khame ama'n iminriangdoom?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simon in amasang, “Kei'n kangaidon” “Katamma intuol mipa diang. Halli Jisu'n aleiti,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">“Nang in kadik ah nanamasang jei.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang enna Simon diang aleitinook, “Hiwa numeisanu hi namubo? Kei'n nang na-inna kajuoluut phakhan kakeii rasunasik nang in tui napemakche, takkha enro hiwa numeisanu inchu amit rathiya kakeii minthu halli asamma nanuulpi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Nang in namazoop inlang nadon makche, takkha kei kaheiluut ah inphut hiwa numeisanu inchu kakeii kamazoop ladamak. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Nang in kei kalu khan sariak nakanoot pimakche, takkha hiwa numeisanu inchu sariakrim kahoihi kakeiiya nakanootpi. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Kei'n kanati, ama manu katamtak kha ngaidampina kaneijei, ajarchu ama minriang nakha alok; halli tu ka-ang ngaidamna lekteii kamu khan lekteii minriang.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleitipi, “Nang namanu ngaikha kana-ngaidam pijei.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Khawa khamtuolla in-ongnga kaom leiilaak mi ngai'n inmani karra inkel, “Tume hiwahi, manu ngai kha-um ka-ngaidam?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Takkha Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleitipi, “Nang ngamna khan ringna naminmujei; kadaiya sitaro.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu inruoipui Numeisa ngai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Khawahekli Jisu'n khuopui rakip khat-um khuo ah asiya Pathian Rengram jarra chongkahoi aleiril, halli siamruoi soomleini ngai kha-um amale inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Halli ama'n numeisa lekkhat-um kathamak ratha khat-um rirai kana ngai makheiya imindampi inmani ngaikha amale inleisi, Mary (Magdalene tia inkoi) ratha kathamak sari ipuutsuokpi numeisanu kha-um Jisu le aleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 27:55">Matt 27:55</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:56">56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:40">Mk 15:40</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 15:41">41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:49">Luk 23:49</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Chuza numei Joanna Herod inna chuon kaensui kalei eii, khat-um Susanna le katamtak aleiilaak numeisa ngai'n inmani neinaakngai inliingna-ah Jisu khat-um asiamruoi ngaikha sanna inleinei.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aru Kaworpa Minkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matt 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Khuopui khatli khuopui khat makheiya mipui angjet inheisuok-ah Jisu koolla inlei-inchun halli Ama'n hiwa minkhinahi aleirilpi:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Aru kaworpa'n asuok ah arukawor aleisi; halli ama'n aleiwor phakhan, lekkhat in lamma inleichulla mi ngaikhan inleitouwa halli wa ngai'n inleiruutjei. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Lekkhat in lungbuk ah inchulla inhongmongnga innottheiya incharjei, ajarchu neipil kha leinommak. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Aru lekkhat in ralingbilla inchulla, ralingkhale inhongmoong suomma raling in adiipthatjei. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Aleiilaak aru'n akatha neipilla inchulla inhongmoongnga inwor makheiya tum rajakhat inliak inleikara”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Jisu'n ahekna ah aleiril, “Rangairu kuor kanei rakip!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minkhina ajar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matt 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n Jisu diang inleirakel hiwa minkhinahi ang tiname, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “Pathian Rengram jarra inthup chongkha nangnidiang innaminjet kha eii, takkha aleiilaak ngaidiangchu minkhina-ah aminmusik, khawajarra inmani ngai'n in-enpumma mununu, halli inrangai pumma jetnunu.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Aru Kaworpa Minkhina Jarra Rilcheenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matt 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Hiwahi minkhina aratha kha eii: arukha Pathian chongkha eii. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Lamma kachul aru tinachu Pathian chong chu karangai, takkha inmani ngaikha ngamna khat-um ringna minmumaknasik seitan aheiwa ah inmani malungnga inphut Pathian chongkha akeisuopi. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Lungkarra akachul aru ngai tinachu Pathian chong injetli karok ah kakeiluut, halli inmani'n malung inthuuk-ah kakeiluutmak in eii, inmani ngamna kha aphakhat sikbit eii, halli matheemna heiwa phakhan purna innei. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Raling karra kachul aru tinachu, inmani ngaikha chongchu karangai, takkha malungkadong, kaneikanung halli ringkhuo hoinakhan inmanikha aminmang halli inmani kara kha minmatormak. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Nuoipil hoina ah kachul aru ngai tinachu, Pathian chong inrangaili katha khat-um chongkajui malungnga inda ah inra maklaiseng kadei mi ngaikha in eii.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koknuoiya Sariakmei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Tuteii in sariakmei kawar kha kok nuoiya makhu inlang damakmi, khat-um zaalmun nuoiya damakmi, takkha meiserkeii khan nida inchu mipui kaheiwa rakip in awarkha muinte. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11:33</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Ang rakip ruukchuon ngaikha la-inlarsik, khat-um chonginthup ngai rakipkha inlajetsik.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Matt 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12:2</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Khawajarra nangni'n angtho thoa ningjetme, iringtheiru, ajarchu tu ka-ang kanei amadiang kheella apesik, takkha tu ka-ang kaneimak amadiang lekteii kanei tia i-ngaidon kha-um inleidelsik eii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Matt 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19:26</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Anu li Anai ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matt 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Jisu anuli anai ngaikha Jisu diang inheiwa, takkha inmani'n mipuikhan ajar eya Jisu le lei-inmu matormu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Tu ka-ang khat in Jisu diang inleitipi, “Nang nanuli nanai ngai'n tuolla inngirra nang kana inmupuisik-ah inom.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei kanuli kanai ngai khachu Pathian chong karangaili kajuingai kha in eii.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Thipui Imindai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matt 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Jisu'n nisuokhat ama siamruoi ngaile rakuongnga inleiluut ah inmani diang aleiti, “Eini'n hiwa tuidiilpang khattiang rakaan inlang sirui.” Halli inmani'n kasi inleiphut. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Inmani'n rakuong inleisep phakhan, Jisu kha aleizaaljei, jetlei theileiya thikaraang kangar inkhat khawa tuidiil khan alei-inthei halli rakuong kha tui ahongluut ah inmani rakipkha poongna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n Jisu koolla insiya Jisu kha inlei keitheiya inleiti, “Karu, Karu! keini kathisik kin-ejei!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Jisu'n intheiya thiraang li tuithisiip diangkhan chong aleipei halli thiraang li tuithisiip kha ajuodaijei. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleitipi, “Hume nangni ngamna kha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Takkha inmani'n ngaknale china inleinei, halli inmani khatli khat inlei-inkel, “Amahi tume? Thiraang li tuithisiip innnum ama chongpe injui!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Raikho kaluut Pasal Mindampina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matt 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Khat-um inmani'n Galilee tuidiil raalkhattiang kaom Gerasene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gerasene </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat in </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gadara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(Matt 8:28); lekkha in inti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gergesa </char></note> ramkha inleituung. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Jisu'n khawa tuidiilpang aleitung phakhan, ama'n khawa khuopui makheiya raikhuo kaluut pasal inkhat alei intongpui, apha kasoot tak-ah puondiar inlukmak khat-um inna kaommakjei, thaantaang reiya kaom mi alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Jisu kha aleimuli akheek ah ahongchap halli Jisu kekuungnga inbok ah rasa inringnga aleiti, “Jisu, Insaangkhet Pathian sapa! Angme nang in kei kadiang nimanuom? kei'n kanani, narachaak maro!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Jisu'n mipa makheiya heisuok nasik raikhuo diang chong aleipeii, apha angjet ah ama kha surna anei, khat-um ama kha mikhumna khan inleida, ama kutli akeii thirruiya inleikhit takkha ama'n kapotchat ah raikhuo in ramrouk tiang aleiruoi.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Jisu'n amadiang aleirakel, “Naraming angme inti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">“Kei karaming chu ‘Katam,’ ” tia aleimasang, ajarchu ama takchungnga raikhuo angjet inleiom jarra eii. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Raikhuo ngai'n Jisu diang inleimatheem poongna meikhur khan keinihi naminsimaro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:31: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Poongna meikhur: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ahekna poongna nikhuo aheitung maklaiseng Reikhuo kha nuoipil khurra khuma adasik eii.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Khawa chingpang khan wok rahooi inleiom, khawa raikhuo ngaikhan wokngai suungnga luutnasik ah Jisu diang inleini halli ama'n aleizootpi, <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Pasalpa makheiya insuok ah wok ngaidiang inleiluutjei halli wok rakip kha insuknatiang sumplingkhang inthoa tuidiilla inlei inraakthatjei.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Khawa wok kakhaal mi ngai'n kasuok rakip inmuli intaanna insiya, kasuok omchan ngaikha khuopui khat-um khuosir khuopangnga kaom mipuidiang inleirilpi. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Mipui'n angme kasuok tia kaen inleisi, halli Jisu koolla inheitung phakhan, raikhuo kaluut pasalpa kha Jisu kekuungnga in-ong kha inleimu, ama'n puondiar katha ilei-inluk le inruoiya herweengnga ileiom injuomu phakhan, inmani rakip in china inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Akamu rakip in angtho thoa raikhuo kaluut ama kha idamme tikha mipuidiang inleirilpi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Khale inruoiya khawa ramma kaom mipui ngai'n Jisu kha sitro inleitipi, ajarchu inmani'n khatuk china inleinei, khale inruoiya Jisu'n rakuong achuongnga khawa munkha aleimathaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Raikhuo ipuut suokpi pasalpa'n Jisu diang aleini, “Kei um nangle sikate.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Takkha Jisu'n hin tipiya aleiminsi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Nang in na-inntiang kir-inlang, Pathian in nang nadiang itho chounkha juorilpiro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Pasalpa khan khuopui suungnga aluut ah, Jisu'n ama diangnga itho rakip aleirilthang.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jairus Sanu khat-um Jisu Puonmor kakatook Numeisanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matt 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Jisu'n tuidiil raalkhattiang aleikir phakhan mipui'n inleingaak chak ah ama kha karok ah donna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Synagogue karoon, Jairus intia inkoi miring inkhat aheiwa ah, ama'n Jisu kekuungnga inbok ah a-inna sirui tia biakna aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Ajarchu kum soomleini ka-ejei asanu inkhatbit kha thisik leithojei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Jisu'n aleisi phakhan mipui'n inlei-uum. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Inmani karra numeisa kum soomleini thikasar inkhat aleiom; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:43: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat ah chu inchenmak </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kathiam ngai diang in enna-ah ama'n inei rakip aleiminhek</char></note>ama'n inei rakip keisuoa kathiam ngaidiang in-en innum tuteii innum ama kha leimindam matormu. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Khawa numeisanu khan nuuktiang makheiya Jisu nuk ah aheiwa ah apuonmor aleikatook halli khawapha takkhan athikasar kha aleidamjei. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Jisu'n aleirakel, “Tume kei kanakatook?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Mipui'n leizootmu, halli Peter in aheiti, “Karu, mipui'n nang nakoolla na-uumma inom.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Takkha Jisu'n aleiti, Kei'n kajet miring inkhat anakatook, ajarchu kei karana kkha kei diang makheiya isuok kajet. <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Khawa numeisanu khan anajetjei tia amupha khan ama'n intuul pumma aheiwa ah Jisu kekuungnga ajuo inbok, khawa munkhan mi rakip maikuungnga ama'n Jisu diang angsik-ah ama kha ikatookme, han, ang omchanna innnoottheiya idamme tikha aleiril. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Jisu'n numeisanu diang aleitipi, “Kasanu, nang ngamna khan nadamjei, kadaiya sitaro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Jisu'n hiwa chong arillaitak, waikaroonpa inn makheiya taangwa inkhat aheiwa, ama'n Jairus diang ati, “Nasanu kha athijet” “Karu kha minpoong khaimaro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Takkha Jisu'n hiwahi ajetli Jairus diang aheiti, “Nang in chimaro; ngamnabit ngamnaro, halli ama kha adamsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Jisu'n inn atung phakhan, Peter, John, Jame, halli naipangnu nuli pa eleiya tuteii amale kaluut sik leizootpimak. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Khanna kaom mi rakip in numeisanu sikbeiya chapnali poongna inleinei, takkha Jisu'n aleiti, “Chapmaru, naipang nuhi kathi emak kalazaal keeng!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Numeisanu kha kathi eii tia injet jarra inmani rakip in Jisu kha innuipuina inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ama'n naipangnu kha akut ah mahuumma aleiti, “Naipangnu intheitaro!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Halli khawapha takkhan ama'n ahongringnga hong intheijei, halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, bakphur inkhat peru. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Halli anule apa'n ngakna inleinei, takkha Jisu'n inmani diang akasuok hi tuteii diang rilpimaknasik chong aleitipi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamruoi Soomleini ngai Itir</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matt 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Jisu'n siamruoi soomleini ngaikha akoichunna kathamak raikhuo puutsook nasik khat-um kanangai rakip mindam matorna ranak khat-um thomatorna aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Khale inruoiya ama'n Pathian Rengram rilthangnasik khat-um kana mindamnasik aleiminsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Halli inmani diang atipi, “Nangni'n ningsi phakhan iteii choimaru, kherol, khouchou, baksik, sial, songkool inliak kha-um choimaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10:4-11</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Khawa khuopui ningmathaan maklaiseng nangni innadonna innkhan omru. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Hun enum mi ngai'n nangnikha innadonmakna khuopui kha mathaanru, halli inmani diang chongmakhaina ningleida angnga ningkeiiya kaom rahutkha kathingthaak inlang leidaru.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Chuon 13:51</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Inmani'n khuosuung rakip inluut ah Pathian chong kahoi inrillarra khat-um mikana ngai kha-um amun rakip-ah inmindampi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Herod's Inhaangna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matt 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Galilee karoonpa Herod in angrakip kasuok choun ngaihi ajet phakhan ama malungkha inhaangna aleinei, ajarchu mipui lekhat in John Baptist kha ahongring nookjei tia inleiril. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Matt 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mk 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9:19</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Mi lekkhat in inti Elijah eii nimunook jeihi, halli mipui lekkhat in inti tiallaiya Pathian chongkachoingai karra inkhat eii hongkaring nookjeihi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herod in aleiti, Kei'n John ariing kitan ejei, tuunna kei'n kijetnook amahi tume? halli ama'n Jisu kha munasik-ah alei entok.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi lising Ra-ga Waina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Jn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Tirton ngaikha inheikirra, inmani chountho rakip Jisu diang inleirilpi, halli Ama'n inmani kha aleiruoiya Bethsaida inti khuopuitiang inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Mipui'n inleijet phakhan ama nuk inleijui, khat-um Ama'n inmani kha aleidonna inmani diang Pathian Rengram chongkha aleirilpi, khat-um kadamzoot ngaikha inleimindam.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Kani ahongta phakhan siamruoi soomleini ngai'n inheiwa ah amadiang inleiril, “Hiwa munhi ramchik ejarra khuosir khuopangnga sisu-inlang baksik insik khat-um riakna zaalna injuo entok nasik mi ngaihi minsitaro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n inmani baksik peru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Inmani'n inleimasang, “Keini'n waipool ra-ngali nga inni kinnei, Nang in hiwa mipui ngaisik-ah baksak juorachasik namanuombe?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Khawa khan Pasal lising ra-nga inleiom.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Jisu'n ama siamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Mipui rakip kha buk khat ah mi soomra-nga soomra-nga daam heimin ongru.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Ama siamruoi ngai'n khawakha inthosuoli, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Jisu'n waipool ra-ngali nga inni aleiya marwaan tiang enna Pathian iminpaak le inruoiya akather khoiya ama siamruoi ngaidiang sempinasik aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Inmani rakip in inbak ah inleikhopjei, halli asiamruoi ngai'n inbakbang kaliam kok soomleini inleikhoomchun.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu jarra Irilsuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matt 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mk 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Jisu'n atheinuo ah Pathian aleini phakhan asiamruoi ngaikha amadiang inheiwa, halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleirakel mipui'n keihi tu-eii innatime?<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />“Mi lekkhat in innati nanghi John Baptist na eii,” inmani'n inleimasang. “Leiilaak in nanghi Elijah innati, khat-um mi lekkhat in innati tiallaiya Pathain chongkachoi ngai inkhat kahong kirnook ejei innati.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Matt 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mk 6:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9:7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Inmani diang aleirakel, “Nangni inle keihi tu-eii ningnatime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peter in aleimasang, “Nanghi Pathian Messiah na eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jn 6:68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ama Poongnali Thina Jarra Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matt 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mk 8:30–9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Khawasuoa Jisu'n inmani diang hiwahi tudiang rilpimaknasik chongkacheet aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ama innum inmandiang hin aleitipi, “Miring sapa kha poongna angjet aneisik khat-um katar ngai, thiampu kalian ngai halli Dan karu ngai'n zootnunu khat-um ama kha thina inpesik eii, takkha nithum huuini ahongring nooksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Halli inmani rakipdiang aleitipi, “Tu ka-ang in keile kasi amanuom inchu, ama'n apumkha inzoot marase, cross kha nisuorakip kadomrase halli kei kha najuirase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Matt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14:27</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ajarchu atu ka-ang in aringkhuo kaminringzoot mi khan amangsik eii, takkha tu ka-ang in kei kasikbeiya aringkhuo kaminmang mi khan ringna aneisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Matt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Mi inkhat in nuoipilchung pumpui amata min e-innum ama ringkhuo kha aminmang inchu angme anemna kaom? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nangni ngai'n kei kasikli kachongsik-ah ning injak inchu, miring sapa innum ama apoina khat-um Apa Pathian li tirton ngai poina kha achoiya ajuonikhan nangnidiang injaksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Kei'n inthiangnga kanati, hiwahin mi lekkhat Pathian Rengram inmumak laiseng kathimaksik inom.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Meelsuo Inthuulna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matt 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mk 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Hiwa chongngai rakip atipina niriat athengli, Jisu'n Peter, John, khat-um James aruoiya chingmuoltiang Pathian kani inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Jisu'n Pathian aleini phakhan ama meelsuo kha ahong inthuul, halli ama puondiar kachek in nalei-eel. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Jetlei theileiya, miring inni kha amale chong inleiril, inmani kha Moses li Elijah inlei eii. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Inmani'n marwaan poina khan injuo inlarra Jisu'n Jerusalemma ang omchanna thisikme tijarra Pathian chuon minsuok sikkha innottheiya huui mintungnasik chong jarra inlei inbiak. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Peter li ama sappui ngai'n inzaalbirra inleiom, takkha inmani'n inhong inthei phakhan Jisu apoinale miring inni amale inngir suomma inleiom kha inleimu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Khawa mi inni ngai'n Jisu kha inleimathaan siktiang, Peter in Jisu diang aleiti, “Karu, eini'n hin niomhi angtuk kathame! eini'n maichaam inn inthum, sakrui, nangsik inkhat, Moses sik inkhat, halli Elijah sik inkhat.” (Peter in angme itikha ama innum leijet matormak.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ama'n chong aleiril phakhan, suumphai khan aheiwa ah inmani ngai rakipkha aleimakhu; halli suumphai khan aleimakhu phakhan siamruoi ngai'n inleichi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Suumphai bukkhan rasa inkhat in aheiti, “Hiwahi kei ikadang kasapa eii, nangni'n ama iril chongkha rangairu!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Matt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1:17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Rasa khan aleirilsuoli Jisu kha atheinuo ah aleiom, halli khawa phakhan asiamruoi ngai'n inmu rakip ngaikha tudiang rillekleiya inleiomchian.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Raikhuo kaluut Naipang inkhat Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matt 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mk 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ziingkhuo warli Jisule asiamruoi inthum ngai'n chingmuol makheiya injuochum phakhan, Mipui'n Jisu kha inlei inmupui. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mipui karra pasal inkhat in ahongkheek, “Karu! Kei'n nangdiang kanani kasapa inkhatbit hi na-enpiro! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Enro, ratha kathamak in amakha asurra jetlei theileiya akheek halli akeichang khangnga aleideengjuon halli inkei-orra amurra amachilphuonbit lei eii, halli angjet aleiminpoong kachak-ah asuokzoot makpumma aleisuok kachak. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Kei'n nang siamruoi ngaidiang puutsuok nasik ah kaleini, takkha inmani'n leimatormu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Angtuk ngamna kasuolli kathamak mi ning eme! nangnile angtuk soot kalaom sikme? angtuk kasoot nangnile kanaladeipui sikme?” khawasuoli khawa mipadiang atipi “Nang nasapa kha hin heiruoiro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Neipangpa'n heiwa phakhan raikhuo khan ama kha nuoipilla juomapura inkei-orra omjei, halli Jisu'n ratha kathamak diang chong aleipeii, halli naipang pakha amindamma apadiang aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Pathian ranak kalokkha mipui rakip in ngakna inleinei.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Jisu'n Athisik jarra Irilnook</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Matt 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Takkha Mi rakip in Jisu itho rakip ah ngakna inleinei phakhan, asiamruoi ngaidiang aleitipi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Angme kei'n nangnidiang kanarilpisik hi manilmaru! Miring Sapahi ranak kanei manmasi kutchungnga inpesik eii.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />(Takkha asiamruoi ngai'n hiwahi angtiname tihi leijetmu, hiwahi inmani'n injet mator maknasik inthup chongkha alei eii, hiwajarra inmani'n amadiang karakelsik um inleichi.)<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tume Kalokkhet?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matt 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mk 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Khawa phakhan atume kalokkhet tia siamruoi karra muruolsiak inleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22:24</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Jisu'n inmani i-ngaidon kha aleijet, khale inruoiya ama koolla kaom naipang inkhat aheiruoiya akoolla aleiminngir, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />halli inmani diang aleti, “Tu e-innum hiwa naipang pahi kei karamingnga ningkeiluut inchu, keikha ningna keiluut ejei, halli atu ka-ang in kei ningna keiluut inchu kei kanajuotirpa kha-um ningkeiluut ejei, hanna nangni karra kasiinkhet mi kha kalokkhet esik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Matt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eini Kanazoot Mi kha Eini Mi eii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mk 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />John in aleimasang, “Karu, keini'n miring inkhat nang naramingnga raikhuo ipuutsook kinmu, halli ama kha eini karra inchelmak jarra ama kha kinkhaap.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />“Takkha Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, nangni'n ama kha khaapmaru,” “Tichu nangni kana inhalpuimak mi kha nangni mi eii.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaritan Khuo'n Jisu kha leizootmak.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Jisu kha marwaan tiang kalnasik aheinai phakhan, ama'n Jerusalem tiang sinasik aleingaidonna kasi aleiphut. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Halli ama taangwa ngaikha ama neek ah ma minsa-ah aleiminsi, inmani'n ama sikbeiya angrakip insuuksik-ah Samaria khuo khan inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Takkha Jisu kha Jerusalem tiang kasisik ejarra mipui'n ama kha leidonzootmu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Asiamruoi James li John in hiwa injetpha khan, Inmani'n inti, “Pumi, marwaanna inphut keini'n mei koithak ah inmani minmangsik hi nang in namanoumbe?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:54: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eliyah etho angnga Larik lekkhat ah lei injia. </char></note> <char style="rq"><ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Reng 1:9-16</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Jisu'n inlet ah inmani kha ranna aleinei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:55: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat in inhap</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">halli ati, “Nangni'n jet makchube angkachang ratha ah me nangni in ning inchen; khawajarra miringsapa in manmasituolla i-juohi mipui ringkho kaminmang sik emak takkha inmnani ngai kaminring sik eii.”</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Khalle inruoiya Jisu li asiamruoi ngaikha aleiilaak khuotiang inleisi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Nuk Kajui ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matt 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Inmani'n lamma inleisi phakhan, mi inkhat in Jisu diang aleiti, “Kei-um nang nasina rakip ah nanuk kanajuisik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Jisu'n amadiang aheimasang, “Ram-ui ngaichu inkhur om, wa ngai-um inrabu innei, takkha miring sapa chu alu danasik um amun ommak.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Jisu'n miring inkhatpa diang ati, “Kanuk najuiro.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Takkha ama'n aheiti, “Karu, kei'n mansakhet ah kirkata kapa juophuumdirong.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Jisu'n aheimasang, “Akathi ngai'n akathi ngaikha leiphuumrasu, takkha nangchu si-inlang Pathian Rengram chongkha juorilthangro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Miring inkhat innum ati, Karu; “Kei um nang kanajuisik eii, takkha mansakhet ah kei insuungkhur mi ngaidiang chong juomathaan masadirong.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 19:20">1 Reng 19:20</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Jisu'n amadiang atipi, “Atu ka-ang in akut ah laangkuol mahuumli anuktiang enna leikakhuoi miring kha Pathian Rengram sik-ah rahoi emak.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi Soomsari leini itir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Hiwahi hekli Pumi'n miring soomsari leini aleikadangnga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">soomsari leini; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat in chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">soomsari.</char></note> halli ama amatiang miring inni inniya ama sinasik khuopui rakip ah aleitir. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleitipi, “Leirakhool sikchu atam, takkha karakhoolsik michu lekteii in eii, leimapupa diang niru leikarakhoolsik mi angjet ajuo minjuonasik. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Matt 9:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 9:38">38</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Siru! Kei'n nangni ngaihi malang karra keelngamtei angnga kinatir eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Matt 10:16</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Nangni'n sialkhou, bunina khou khat-um kekok choimaru; halli lamma ning intongpui mi ngaikha rakooknasik ngirmaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Matt 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Hun enum nangni'n ningluutna inna mansakhet ah ‘Inn khan Kadai omrase tiru.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Khawa khan kadai kamanuom mi om-inchu, Nang diangnga kadaikha ama takchungnga omsik, kha emak inchu, ning ipeii kadai kha keikirnookru. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Inmani'n naperei kha bak inlang innkhan omro, tichu chuon kathopa'n athoman amusik hi rahoi suok, innkhat makheiya innkhat ah leeng-inlang ommaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1 Cor 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tim 5:18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Nangni'n khuopui ningluutpha khan, inmani'n innaleidon inchu ningmaikuungnga innaperei kha bakru. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Khawa khuopuiya mi kana ngaikha mindampiru, halli inmani diang tipiru Pathian Rengram kha ajuonaijei. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Takkha ang ka-ang ningsina khuopuiya inmani'n innaleidonmak inchu, inmani lampui ngaikhan si-inlang tipiru, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Chuon 13:51</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />Tichu ning khuopui makheiya ningkeiiya kakop rahuut kikathingthaak hi nangni kinzootmakna eii, halli nangni'n ngaidonru Pathian Rengram kha nangnidiang ajuonaijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:7-14">Matt 10:7-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mk 6:8-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3-5">Luk 9:3-5</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, hiwa khuopuihi Sodom poongna khaneek ah hiwahin poongna omsik eii! <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Inphut 19:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:24">Matt 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">Matt 10:15</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kangamnamak Khuopuingai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matt 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Angtuk poongna esikme Chorazin nangdiang! angtuk poongna esikme Bethsaida nangdiang um! nangni diangnga intho chuon inlak kha Tyre li Sidon diang inleitho inchu, buorasongkol kahak inta, khat-um inkilrahut inthekthuon inta inmani'n manu makheiya inmalung kha apha matiang leithuuljei inte. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Ezek 26:1–28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Jo 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9">Amo 1:9</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zech 9:2-4</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Pathian chongtan Nikhuoni khan nangni neek ah Tyre li Sidon diang aminriang nakha omsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Capernaum! Nanghi, marwaan katung na-indomsaang zootbe? etheinuni, nangchu meikhur khan nadeengluutsik eii!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Isa 14:13-15</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang ati, tu-ennum ningchong karangai mikha kei kachong karangai kha in-eii; tu-ennum nangni kanazootmak ngaikha, kei kanazootmak in-eii; halli tu-ennum kei kanazootmak mi kha, kei kana juotirpa ama kha um izootmak kha eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Matt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jn 13:20</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi Soomsari leini ngai Inheikir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Mi soomsari leini <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">soomsari leini; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat in </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">soomsari.</char></note>ngaikha ratha karok ah inheikirjei, inmani'n inleiti, “Pumi,” “Nang naramingnga chongpena kinnei phakhan raikhuo ngai innum kinchong injui!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n marwaan makheiya seitan kha kool-inlek angnga ijuota kaleimu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Rangairu! kei'n maruul khat-um ailuweetngai chungnga simatornasik halli ningnile ning inhalpui ratha kanei rakip daimatornasik ranak kanapejei, han iteii in nangnikha nakatooknuni.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 91:13">Minpkla 91:13</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Takkha nangni'n ratha kathamak ngai'n ningchong injuijarra rokmaru, khawa neek ah marwaanna ningraming injia jarra rokru.<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Rokna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matt 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Khawa phakhan Jisu kha Ratha Inthiang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ratha inthiang makheiya, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">larik lekkhat ah injia </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ratha makheiya; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aleiilaak ah injia, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama Ratha makheiya.</char></note> in aleisip jarra arok ah aleiti, marwaan le nuoipil Pumi E-Kapa! nangkha kei'n kanaminpaak ajarchu kasing kathei ngai'n injetmak khat-um inmu matormak kha, i-kajetmak diang namalarpijei. Oh, Kapa, hiwahi nang inmanuom li nalungduotak kasuok ejei.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Kapa'n angrakip kei kadiang napejei, halli asapa hi tume tikha apa elekleiya tuteii in jetmu, emakli atu khame apa tihi-um asapa eleiya tuteii in jetmu, khawa jarra asapa'n ikadang mi ngaidiang ama kha amalarsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n inlet ah asiamruoi ngaidiang ruuk-ah aleitipi, “ Ningmit in musik ka eii phur rakip ningmu kha rawaan katha ning eii! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Khawajarra nangnidiang kanati, Pathian chong kachoi ngaili rengngai innum, nangni imu rakipkha inmuzoot, takkha inmani'n mumatormu, halli nangni irangai kha inrangaizoot, takkha rangai phangnunu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katha Samaritan Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Dan kathei ocha inkhat in aheiwa-ah Jisu'n angme namasang tia, ama'n chong rakelna aleinei, “Karu” “Hektik kaboi ringkhuo munasik ah kei'n angme kathosik?” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 22:35-40">Matt 22:35-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mk 12:28-34</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Chong inthiang in angme iti? nangni'n angtho thoa ningmaletme?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Halli ama'n aleimasang, “ ‘Pumi na Pathian kha namalung pumpuiya naminriangsik, khat-um na ratha pumpuiya, naranak pumpuiya, halli na-ngaidonna rakip ah ama kha naminriangsik’ halli ‘Indiang inwai ngaikha napum ni inriang angnga naminriangsik eii.’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Innidan 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levi 19:18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Jisu'n aheimasang “Nang in kadik ah natijei,” “Hiwahi thoro halli ringna namusik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Levi 18:5</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Takkha Dan kathei ocha in atheinuomma kadik ezoot jarra Jisu diang aheirakel, “Tu khame kei indiang inwaipui?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Miring inkhat Jerusalem makheiya Jericho tiang aleichumma aleisi, halli inruup ngai'n ama kha puondiar inliikpiya wuokna inleinei khat-um inwuokthat dengnga inleida. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Jetlei theileija thiampu inkhat in khawa lamkhan ajuochum, halli khawa miring pakha alei intongpui, takkha alooiya aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Khawa angnga Levite inkhat um khawakhan aheiwa ah miring pakha aleimu, ama innum alooiya aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Takkha Samaritan miring inkhat in khawa lamkhan aheiwa ah miring pakha aleimu phakhan, ama malungkhan minriang in aleisip. <char style="rq"><ref loc="2CH 28:15">2 Khang 28:15</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Amadiang asiya kapop rakipkha sariak li theibomtui abunpiya khuopina anei, halli ama salungdai chungnga minchongnga khomal tungna innkhat ah aleiruoiya ama kha sepa thona aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ziingkhuo warli khawa inn kangaak padiang dangkapum inni ama diang aleipe. Halli inn kangaak padiang aleiti. ‘Ama kha sepa leithoro,’ woikhat kahei kirnookli, ‘Kei'n ama diangnga niminluut rakip kanapesik eii.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Hi ngai inthum karra tukhame nang in inruup ngai'n inleiwuok ah inleidapa diang indiang inwaipui eii tia ningaidon?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Dan kathei ocha in aleimasang, “Ama diang katha tak-ah sepa katho mipa kha eii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Jisu'n aheimasang, “Nang in si-inlang hiwa angnga juothotaro.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Martha li Mary diang Ijuopha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Jisu li asiamruoi ngai'n lamma inleisi phakhan ama'n khou aleiluut, araming Martha inti numeisanu'n Jisu kha a-inna aleidon. <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 11:1">Jn 11:1</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Khawa numeisanu nainu inkhat aleiom araming mary inleiti, ama'n Pumi kenuoiya in-ongnga Pumi minchuna kha aleirangai. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Takkha Martha'n ama chounthosik khan malungsena aleinei, ama'n aheiwa ah Jisu diang aleiti, “Pumi, nang in jetmakchebe kei kanainu'n katheinuobit chuon inaminthohi? Amadiang kei najuosan nasik tipiro!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Pumi'n ama diang aleimasang, “Martha, Martha! Nang in ang rakip sik-ah namalung namindongnga naom, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />takkha inkhatbit khakeeng arei kaom, Mary in akadik kha ikadang ejei, halli amadiang makheiya woikhat leikir nunujei.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Pathian Kani Iminchu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matt 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Nisuokhat Jisu'n amun inkhat ah Pathian aleini phakhan, khawa aminhek suoli asiamruoi inkhat in amadiang aleiti, “John in asiamruoi ngaidiang iminchu angnga, Pumi, Pathian kani naminchuro.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Nangni'n ningni phakhan hintiru:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Kapa:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">naraming inthiangkha kayarasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">narengram kha juotungrase.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nisuo rakip ah kinbaksik napero.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nisuo rakip ah kinbaksik napero; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ziingkhowara bukbaksik.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Kin manu rakip nangaidampiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">keini innum keinidiang kathamak kanatho ngai kinngaidam angnga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">intheemna khan naminchulmaro takkha kathamak ah inphut nasanro.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aheiti, “Nangni karra tu ka-ang inkhat in suopui inkhat omtia ngaidonrui, han ama'n zaanchimma asiya amadiang ajuoti, ‘Suopui waipool inthumdam leipuuk kate. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Tichu kei kasappui inkhat khuol-injil eya ka-inna ahongtungnga omjei, halli kei'n ama kha iteii minbaksik neimong!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Halli ama'n insuungnga inphut aheimasang, kahoimak nathokhai maro, kei'n kot kha-um kakharjei, halli kei kasa ngaile zaalmunna kinomjei, kei'n intheili phurkhat napesik hi matorkhai nuningjei. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Kei'n kanati, nanghi kasappuipa na-eii tia ama'n intheiya iteii nape matormak innum, nang in injak omleiya naninook naninook inchu ama'n intheita nang diang arei kaom rakip anapesik eii. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Khawa jarra, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Niro, halli nangnidiang anapesik, ratokru, nangni'n muningte, khat-um rakhoongru, nangnidiang namalongpite. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Tichu, Akani rakip in muinte, kaentok inmani in muinte, halli karakhoong rakipdiang malongpite. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nangni karra tu ka-ang asapa'n apa diang nga anili maruul peniabe? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Emakli ama'n artui anili, apa'n ailuweet peniabe? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nangni kathamak mi ning e-innum, ningsa ngaidiangchu kutchoi katha angjet pesik ningjet inle, marwaanna kaom ningpa Pathian in angtuk kheella, kaniya kaom nangni ngaidiang Ratha inthiang napemak niame!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu khat-um Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-23">Matt 12:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mk 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Jisu'n raikhuo kaluut chongkaril theimak khat aleiputsuokpi; raikhuo kha aleisuok phakhan chongkaril theimak mipa kha chongkaril aleiphut, halli mipui'n ngakna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Takkha mi lekkhat in inti “Raikhuo ngai karra kachingpa Beelzebul ama'n raikhuo puutsuok matornasik ama diang ranak ipekha eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Matt 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Mi lekkhat in Jisu diang surnasik-ah ensuina inleinei, khawa jarra inman'n amahi Pathian izoot inkhat eii tia jetnasik-ah choun inlak thonasik inleini. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Matt 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1">16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mk 8:11</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani i-ngaidon kha aleijetle inruoiya ama'n aleimasang, “Rengram inkhat in insuungnga inthenkhoina inneiya khatli khat raal intho inchu kasoot ah omnunijei, halli inmani karra inthenkhoi insuungkhur kha akoidarsik eii.” <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Seitan rengram suungnga inthenkhoiya khatli khat raal intho inchu khawa rengram kha angtho thoa angir matorsikme? nangni'n ningti kei'n raikhuo kipuutsuok hi Beelzebul itho eii ningti. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Kei'n Beelzebul ranak ah raikhuo ipuutsuok ningnate inle, angtho thoa nangni nukkajui ngai'n inmani kha inpuutsuokme? Khawa jarra inmani ngai'n nangni chungnga chongkatan ngaikha in esik eii. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Pathian ranak ah kei'n raikhuo ngaihi kipuutsuok e-inchu, Pathian Rengram kha nangnidiang ijuo ejei.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Mi kangar inkhat in, aomna innkhan chemli thalle inruoiya angaak inchu ama neinaak ngaikha mangtheinuni. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Takkha mi kangar inkhat aheiwali ama kha insuol puiya amatorjei, halli ama'n inn kangaak pa'n inn ngaak theinasik ah ida chemli thal ngai achoidella halli inei rakip achoidelsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Keile kaommak mikha kei kanazootmak mi eii; keile inruoimak mi kha inchekchaisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mk 9:40</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ratha Kathamak Heikirnookna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matt 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Ratha kathamak inkhat in mi inkhat diangnga inphut asuok phakhan, ama'n asi ahongnga poong machumnasik-ah ahuulnamun aleientok, ama'n amumak phakhan atheinuoa inti, ‘Kei'n kaheisuokna innkhan kirnook takte.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Woikhat ama'n aheikirpha khan innkha inthiang hiaiya khat-um intiam week ah ileiomkha ajuomu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Halli ama'n ratha kathamak sari inliak ama neek ah kathamak heiruoi nook ah khawakhan injuo-om, halli khawa khan inmani'n inleiluut ah inleiom, halli ahekna khanchu mipa omchan kha matiangnga neek ah ahongse detjei.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hoina Kadik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Hiwahi Jisu'n aleiti phakhan, “Numeisa inkhat in mipui kar makheiya ahongkheek ah amadiang ahongti, nang kanawon numeisa khat-um kanawailok ama kha rawaan katha eii!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Takkha Jisu'n aheimasang, “Khawa neek ah, Pathian chong karangaili kajui ngaikhan angtuk ah rawaan katha in-eme!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chuon Inlak Thonasik ah Inleini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matt 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Mipui katamtak in Jisu kha inhei-uum phakhan ama'n masonna chong ajuoril nook, “Hiwa khangnga mi ngaihi kathamak khang in-eii, inmani'n inlak chuon inentok, takkha Jonah diangnga inlakchuon aleiya etei inkhat um penunijei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Tichu Jonah in Nineveh mi rakipdiang choun inlak ajuo inchang, khawa angnga Miring sapa innum hiwa khang sik-ah jetna inkhat esik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Chongtan Nikhuoni Simtiangnga rengnu'n hongngirta tuunna pha miring ngai chungnga rilsena aneisik eii, tichu hiwa rengnu khan aramtak makheiya Solomon singna chongminchu kha karangai aleihong, enru, Solomon neek ah kalian inkhat hin aomjeii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Chongtan Nikhoni Nineveh ah kaom miring rakip in inthei inta hiwa khangnga mi ngaikha minsena inneisik eii, ajarchu inmani kha Jonah chongril inrangai phakhan inmalung inthuul halli enru, Jonah neek ah kalian miring inkhat hin omjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taksa War</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matt 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">6:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Tuteii in sariakmei kha minkaili kok suungnga danuni;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat ah chu inchenmak </char><char style="fq" closed="false">minkaili kok suungnga danuni.</char></note> takkha akaheiluut mi ngai'n warkha inmunasik sariakmei kha meiserkeii chungnga inda. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Matt 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mk 8:12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Nang namit kha nataksa war eii, namit kha adam inchu, nataksa pumpui war in asipsik eii; takkha namit kha thamak inchu napum raja aziingsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Khawa jarra, nangni war kha ziingmak nasik inringtheiru, <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nang napum saram rakip kawar in asip inchu nang nadiang kaziing omnunijei, han sariakmei khan awar phakhan nangdiang na-eelwar angnga nang napum rakip awarsik ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Pharisee ngai li Dan Kathei Ocha ngai rilsena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Jisu'n chong aleirilsuoli, Pharisee pa'n amale bubak nasik aleikoi, halli ama'n asiya bubak nasik ah alei in-ong. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Jisu'n bubak ma-ah kut leirasumak jarra Pharisee pa'n ngakna aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Khale inruoiya Pumi'n ama diang aleitipi, “Atuunchu, Pharisee nangni'n putiangnga ningrabing li ningbukheeng ngai ningminthiang, takkha nangni malung suungnga chu kathamak li mikathazoot in asip. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ka-am nangni! jetmak chube, Pathian in tuoltiang abool halli suungtiang kha-um ibool ema abe? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Takkha nangni'n ning bukheeng li ning rabiingnga kaom ngaikha sara ngaidiang peru, halli angrakip nangni sinadan dungjuiya inthiang kha ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Nangni Pharisee ngai angtuk chi kaomme! ninglei makheiya kamoong phurrakip, thikaraanglei (mint) rue, ngaikha tum soomma tumkhat ningpeii, takkha Pathian kadik khat-um minriang ngaikha ningmathaanjei, hiwa ngai rakip hi nangni'n mi ngaidiang manil lekleiya chuonna ningthosik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Levi 27:30</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Nangni Pharisee ngai angtuk chikaomme! nangni'n Synagogues in-ong na mun kahoi kakadang ningmanuom, halli phai suungnga khoya kaomma naleikoi kha ningmanuom. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Angtuk poong kaomme nangnidiang! nangnihi musik kaommak thaankha ning eii, halli mi gai'n jetmuwa khawa thaan chungnga insiya inom.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Dan kathei ocha inkhat in Jisu diang aheiti, “Karu, hiwa natinachu, nang in keinidiang ninarilse eii!”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Chongkatan karu ngaidiang um poongna kha omrase! nangni'n mi ngai chungnga inroon matormaksik phurrik kha ningpeii, takkha nang inchu khawa phurrik roonpuinasik nakutmor kha-um heisoonmakche. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Poongna kha omrase nangnidiang! ajarchu nangni'n ningpa ngai'n inleithat Pathian chong kachoingai thaankha ningboolla ning om. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Nangni'n ningpa ngai inleitho chuonkhan ning inpesuok ah sakhi ning inchangjei; inmani'n Pathian chong kachoi ngaikha inthat, halli nangni'n thaan ngaikha ningboolla ning omjei. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Hiwa jarra Pathian singna theina khan ati, Kei'n Pathian chong kachoi khat-um Pathian tirton ngaikha kajuotirsik eii; Inmani'n lekkhat inthatsik eii khat-um inrachaaksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Khawa jarra manmasituol inbool makheiya inphut Pathian chongkachoi ngai thisen kasar kha atuunna khang ngai'n poongna kha ningmusik eii. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Abel thisen makheiya Zechariah thisen katung khat-um maichaam inn makheiya Inthiang namun katung koongkarra kathi ngaikha atuunna khang mi ngai'n poongna inneisik eii! ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Inphut 4:8</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Angtuk poongna khame Dan karu ngaidiang! ajarchu nangni'n singna theina sou kha ningleijei, halli nangni inchu khawakhan luutmak chujei, halli nangni'n akaluut mi ngaidiang isuina ning ejei!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Khawa mun kha Jisu'n alei mathaanna aleisili, Dan karu ngaili Pharisee ngai'n Jisu kha setheiya inleirilthai, halli amadiang chong angjet rakelna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Ama surtheinasik ah chong kase rilbe tia inngaak chak ah inleiom.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Katha inleem ngaidiang chong Makaina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Matt 10:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mipui lising angjet intuothatsik inthoa inlei-intuup, halli Jisu'n mansakhet ah asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Katha inleem Pharisee ngai chol makheiya inngaaktheiru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Matt 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:15">Mk 8:15</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Inkhu-ah kaleiom kha inlongsik eii khat-um ruukchong rakip inlajetsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mk 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luk 8:17</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Khawajarra angrakip aziingna muna ningril kha awarna ah inlajetsik eii, khale inruoiya insuungnga ning inbiakchian kha innchung makheiya inlaril thangsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tume Nichisik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matt 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Kasapngai, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, taksa kathat mi ngaikha chimaru, khawasuoli inmani'n iteii nathomatorsik ommak. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Takkha atu khame nangni'n ningchisik kei'n namindik kate, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Pathian kha eii nichisik, anathat suoli woikhat meikhurra kanadeengluut mator ranak kanei Pathian kha chiru!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Wacharek ra-nga kha dangkapum innisik-ah jormak chuwabe? takkha Pathian inchu wacharek inkhat kha-um manilmak. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ningluwa kaom ningsam ramol rakip khaum anateelpi, khawa jarra chimaru; nangni ngaihi wacharek katamtak neek ah aman katam ning eii!”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inrilsuok khat-um Christa inzootmak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32">Matt 10:32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Kei'n nangni diang kanati, mipui maikuungnga kei kami kin eii intia inrilsuok inchu, Miring sapa innum Pathian tirtonngai maikuungnga anarilsuok pisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Takkha atu ka-ang in keihi mipui maikuungnga ningnazootmak inchu, Pathian innum tirtonngai maikuungnga nazootpinuni.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Atu ka-ang in Miring sapa zootmakna chong aril inchu ngaidamna apesik eii; takkha atu ka-ang in Ratha inthiang diang kathamak ah karilse khachu ngaidamna omnuni.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:32">Matt 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mk 3:29</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Nangkha inmani'n synagogue li choun karool ngai, halli ranak kanei ngai koolla innaruoi phakhan, nang in angtho thoa kamasang sikme khat-um karilsikme tia malung dongna neimaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Matt 10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:11">Mk 13:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:14">Luk 21:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:15">15</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Khawa phakhan Ratha inthiang in nangdiang angme narilsikkha naminchute.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inchong ka-am diang Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mipui kara mi inkhat in Jisu diang aheiti, “Karu, kei ka-u diang Kapa inleida neinaak rakip insemnasik natipiro.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Jisu'n amadiang aleimasang, “Suopui, nangni inni kara neinaak nasempinasik atu'n kei kadiang khawa inzootna chongtannasik anapeyame?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Halli ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni rakip mahaam kalian makheiya in-entheiru khat-um insingtheiru; tichu miring ringkho hi neinaak kaneihut in arei emak.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n hiwa minkhinahi aleirilpi: “Inchong inkhat saanglebaal katamtak kaminsuok ram inkhat aleinei. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ama'n atheinuoa aleingaidon, angme kei'n kathosik? ‘Kei saanglebaan ngai reiinasik amun neimongjei, <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />khawa jarra sasiar thiatkata’ halli ‘Sasiar kalok inkhat sakkata kasaangli kaneinaak rakip hiwahin kadasik eii tia ama'n hiwahi thonasik-ah atheinuoa alei inngaidong. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Khale inruoiya rawaan katha mi! ka intisik tia atheinuoa alei inngaidon, nang in kum angjetsik-ah arei ka eii neinaak katha ngaikha nabuk ah nadajei, ringkhuo hi kahoithei ejei, kabak, ka-in thoinlang natheinuoa hoitaro!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Takkha Pathian in amadiang ati, ‘Aka-am nang! Awini zaan makheiya nang naringkhuo kha aheksikjei; halli natheinuo sik-ah nabuk ah nida karei rakip ngaikha atu'n leiniame?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Halli Jisu'n hinthoa minhek, “Atu ka-ang in neinaak rakip atheinuo sik-ah abuk ah ada-innum Pathian diang chu inchongna emak.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian kha Ngamnaru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matt 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aheiti, “Hiwa jarra kei'n nangnidiang kanati, ningbaksik, niringnasik, khat-um taksa sik-ah areikaom puondiar sik-ah ningmalung mindongmaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ringkhuo hi baksik neek ah arei kaom eii, khat-um taksa hi puondiar neek ah arei kaom eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Wa-ak ngaidiang enru: inmani'n aru kha lingmu khat-um khoomma damu; inmani'n buknasik inn khat-um sasiar damu; Pathian in inmani kha awairing! nangni ngaihi wa ngai neek ah aman katam ning eii! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ningmalung ningmindoongli <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ringkho minseidet sik;</char></note> atu'n ning ringkhuo kha ningminseidet matorme? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nang in akasiin chounkhat sik ah iteii ningtho matormak inchu, angjarra aleiilaak sik-ah malung ning mindoogme? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Ngaidonru angtho thoa ramreibet in imoongme, inmani'n choun um thomu emakli puondiar um boolmu: takkha kei'n kanati Solomon rengpa'n ama inchong puondiar atho innum hiwa reibet inkhat katha angnga thamatormak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1 Reng 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2 Khang 9:3-6</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Pathian in hiwa leiya chinthouhi aminmong, Takkha awini kamong chinthuohi ziingngachu mei-oot nasik-ah inhaalsik eii, nangni ngamna kasiin ngai! ama'n nangni kha kheella puondiar napemak niabe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Nangni'n angme ningbak ning-in sik tia ningmalung minsemaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />(Manmasituolla zaatlop ngai'n apha rakip ah hiwasik-ah ratokna innei.) Hiwa ngaihi nangnasik arei om tia napa Pathian in ajet. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Hineek achu Pathian Rengram kha ratokru, halli hiwa rakip ngaihi nangnidiang anapesik eii.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Marwaanna Inchongna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matt 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Nangni keelngam rahooi kadoong ngai, china neimaru, tichu Nipa'n Rengram napenasik-ah aratha arok. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Nangni'n ningnei neinaak rakip jour inlang sara ngaidiang peru, nangni'n kamaruo maksik sialkhou kha choiru, halli Marwaanna inchuongna kha mintuupru khawa khan inkei omnuni, ajarchu inruup luuttheinuni, khat-um inngeii innum minmang matornunujei. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Nangni karei omna rakip ah, ningmalung khaum aomsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inringchak Suok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Puondiar inluk inlang khat-um sariakmei minkai inlang angrakip indeipuisik-ah insuukchak inlang omru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 25:1-13">Matt 25:1-13</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Suok inkhat akaru kha moiruoina makheiya heikirli ama'n innkhar kha woikhat aheirakhoong li heirakhoongmak kamalongpi sik-ah kangaak ka-ang ngaikha in eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 13:34-36">Mk 13:34-36</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Kei'n inthiangnga kanati, inringchak ah akaru kaheiwa ngaak ah kaom suok ngaikha angtuk rokna khame ama'n ajuomupha khan! ama'n asongkol inchuol kha liikta ama kha sepa inthosik-ah khamtuol khan juo in-ongsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Angtuk inroksikme Ama'n zaanchim khat-um khaneek ah inmoa aheiwa innum! inringchak ah kangaak ah kaomngai ajuomu phakhan. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Takkha hiwahi jetru: inn mapupa'n inruup heiwanasik apha ajet inchu angtiseng innkha mangnasik-ah a-inn mathannuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Matt 24:43</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:44">44</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Khawajarra nangni innum inringchak inlang omru, ajarchu miring sapa kha ni-ngaidonmak phakhan ajuosik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huoikajou khat-um Huoikajoumak Suok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matt 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Peter in ati, “Karu, Hiwa minkhinahi keinisik emakli mi rakip sik-ah nitibe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Pumi'n aheimasang, atu khame huoikajou khat-um akasing suok? ama kha karu'n a-inn kaensui sik khat-um aleiilaak suok rakip kha bu apha kacha-ah leiminbaknasik iminhuum suok khabe. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ama karu'n aheikir phakhan angrakip katha tak ah aleithopi inchu, khawa suokpa kha angtuk rokna esikme. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Kei'n inthiangnga kanati, ama'n aneinaak rakip kaensui amin-esik eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Takkha soukpa'n atheinuoa i-ngaidon ama karu kha inmo ah aheiwosik eii tia numeisali pasal asuok ngaikha aleiwuok ah khat-um ju ka-inli kabak thoa inruiya leiomma, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />ama karu kha a-ngaidon makna nikhuo khat-um ajetmakna phakhan aheiwasik halli ama kha abong abongnga tuktanta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:46: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ama kha abong abongnga tuktanta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kalekjuonro.</char></note>huoikajoumak tia aleisik eii.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Khat-um suok in akaru lungdou kha angme tia kajet, takkha insuuk leiya kaom, emakli ama lungdou nuoiyabit kasi ama kha kasetheiya awuoksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Halli suok in ama karu imanuom kajetmak, takkha sungmol kabaksik kasuok chuon lekkhat katho ama kha lekkhat wuoksik eii. Katamma inpeii midiang katamma ani; katamdoomma inpeii ama diang katamdoomma ani.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Ajar eya Inkhoithenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matt 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Kei'n nuoipil chunghi meiya kaminkaang kijuo eii, halli kei'n kaleikangjei kha kamanuom! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Kei'n Baptism ka-inthosik om, halli kei kadiang angtuk malungsename khawakha ahekmaklaiseng! <char style="rq"><ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mk 10:38</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Kei'n nuoipil chungnga kadai kanapesik kijuo eii tia nangni'n ningngai donbe? emak, kei'n natipikate, kanakhoithen sik-ah kijuo eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Atuun makhei achu innsuungkhurra mi ra-nga ningom nangkhan, mi ra-nga rakiple ning inhalsik eii, inthum ngai'n inni ngaidiang, inni ngai'n inthum ngaidiang. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Apali asapa inhalsik, asapali apa inhalsik, anuli asanu inhalsik, halli asanuli anu inhalsik, atarpi li amoinu inhalsik, halli amoinuli atarpi inhalsik eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mic 7:6</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apha kha Jettheinasik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2">Matt 16:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Jisu'n mipui diang aleitipi, “Niluuttiang ziingkhum aheiwa phakhan, nangni'n ningti ruo juosursikjei, halli ajuosur. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Halli simtiang thi aheiraang inchu, nangni'n ningti atuunchu ahong sasikjei halli hongsajei. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Katha inleem ngai! nangni'n nuoipille lairalaak ning enna nikhuo ningmadan, halle angjarra atuunna phadan jarra ningmalet matormakme?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ni Inhalpui ngaile Inngeina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25">Matt 5:25</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Angjarra nangni'n akadik thonasik-ah ningtheinuoa chong ning-intan matormakme? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nangni'n ning inhalpui khale chongtanna munna ningsi inchu, ningsina lam khan amale mintiamnasik thoru, emak inchu nangni kha chongkatanpa diang kadikmak namin eta, raalmi kalianpa diang napeluutsik ejei halli raalmi kalokpa'n nangnikha mikhumna ah innadasik eii. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, nangni'n dangkapum kha ningpemator maklaiseng namasuo nunujei.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Malung Thuulsik emakli Thinasik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Pilate in Galilee mi ngaikha athatli inthisen ngaikha Pathian diang maichaam ileipeii jarra Jisu diang karilipi mi lekkhat khawa phakhan inleiom. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangni'n hiwa Galileans inthat ngaihi aleiilaak Galileans ngai neek ah manu karoondet in eii tia ning ngaidonbe? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Emak! Kei'n kanati, nangni um ningmalung ninthuulmak inchu inmani angnga ningthiwiak sikjei. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Emakli Siloamma kaom inn insaang kha juopurra ideengthat mi soom leiriat ngaikha nangni'n Jerusalemma kaom mi ngai karra kheella manu karoon ngaikha in eii tia ningleibe? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Emak, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, nangni innum ningmalung ningthuulmak inchu inmani angnga ningthisik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakara Mak Theichang Kuung Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Halli Jisu'n hiwa minkhina hi aleirilpi: “Miring inkhat in arahuonna theichang kuung inkhat aleiling, halli ama'n theichang kara ka-en aleisi, takkha iteii leimumak. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Khale inruoiya rahuonna chuonkatho ngaidiang aleitipi, ‘Enru, kumthum ejei kei'n hiwa theichang kuungnga akara ka-en kaheiwana, halli iteii mumong: tukkhiaktru, angsik ah neipil luoa omsikme?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Takkha rahuonna chuon kathopa'n aheimasang, ‘Karu atuunkum sik beichu moongdirase, kei'n asir apangnga cheikata neipilthai dapidirong. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Halli nangkumtiang aleikara inchu athajei, takkha akaramak inchu nang in tukkhiak chajeite.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Sabbbath Nikhuoni Ruong inkun Numeisa inkhat Mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Jisu'n Sabbath nikhuoni synagogue inkhat ah aleiminchu. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Numeisa inkhat kumsoom leiriat, ratha kathamak in minna ah aleiom, ama kha aruong inkunna minji kathamak alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Jisu'n khawa numeisanu kha aleimu phakhan, numeisanu kha akoiya aleitipi, “Numeisa, nang nina makheiya nadamjei!” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Halli khawapha takkhan ama kutkha khawa numeisanu diang aleiduongnga inkun kha-um aleimindam pijei, Khawapha takkhan numeisanu in Pathian kha aleiminpaak.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Takkha Synagogue karoonpa'n Sabbath nikhuoni Jisu'n mi mindam tia mipuidiang hithoa aleirilpi, “Mi ngai'n niruk chuon inthonasik om, hiwa nikhuo ngaihin hong inlang hongmindamro takkha Sabbath nikhuo nichu chamak!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Suok 20:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13">Innidan 5:13</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:14">14</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Pumi'n amadiang aleimasang, “Nangni katha inleem ngai! nangni'n Sabbath nikhuoni sekuol makheiya inphut saraat li salungdai ngaikha ningkeiya tui kamin-in ruoimak chuwabe? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Halli hiwa Abraham sa ka-eii numeisanu hi, seitan in kumsoom leiriat surra khat-um khit ah idahi, Sabbath nikhuoni inkhit makheiya masuosik suokmak abe?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Jisu'n hiwa atipi phakhan, ama inhalpui ngaikha minjakna anei, halli mipui'n ama lurna chuontho rakip ngaikha rokpuina inleinei.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anchamru jarra Minkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matt 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mk 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Hiwasuoa Jisu'n aleiti, “Pathian Rengram hi angle in angme? halli hiwahi kei'n angle kaminkhi sikme? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Itichu, miring inkhat in anchamru choiya leiya ijuowor ka-ang eii, halli ahongmoongnga thing ejei, han lairalaak ah wayam inheiwa ah thing-ool ngaikhan inrabu inphan najei.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cholla Minkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matt 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Halli Jisu'n woikhat aleirakelnook, “Angleme kei'n Pathian Rengram kha kaminkhisik? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Khawa khachu hiwa ka-ang eii, numeisa inkhat in chol lekkhat aleili waipooldi kokthum polla chol hongka uolwiak ka-ang eii.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasiin Inkhar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Matt 7:13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Jisu'n Jerusalem tiang asina lamma khuopui angjet, khouteii angjet arakaanna aminchu tirra aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Khawa phakhan miring inkhat in aheirakel, “Pumi, mi lekkhabit ringna inmusikbe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Nangni'n kot kasiin khan luutnasik-ah ranak songru; ajarchu mipui katamtak in luutnasik inentok, takkha luutmator nunu. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Inn mapupa'n intheiya innkhar kha woikhat akharjei inchu, nangni'n tuolla kangir phutjei ningte halli inkhar kha rakhoong ningta ‘Pumi keini sik-ah inkhar namalongpidiro!’ halli ama'n nangnidiang naheimasang jeite, ‘Hu makheiya ning eme kei'n nangni kha najetmongjei!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Khawa makheiya nangni'n hin kati ningphutsik eii, ‘Keini'n nangle kinleibak kinlei in, keini khuopui khan nang in nanaleiminchu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Takkha ama'n hin aheiti nooksik eii, ‘Kei'n nangni kha najetmong huwa makheiya kaheiwo ning eme, kei kadiang makheiya sitaru, nangni kathamak mi ngai!’ <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Minpkla 6:8</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Khale inruoiya Pathian Rengramma Abraham, Isaac, Jacob halli Pathian chong kachoi ngai ningmu phakhan kachapli ha-kakarial in sipsik eii, halli nangni kha innahiaijuol sik ejei! <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Matt 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:11">Matt 8:11</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:12">12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Pathian Rengramma phamwaina kalok khan mipui angjet in nisuo, niluut khat-um sim, mar, tiang makheiya heiwa inta injuo in-ongsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Enru, nuk intong ngaikha, ma insasik eii, halli ma-insa ngaikha nuk intong sik eii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Matt 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mk 10:31</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Jerusalem Iminriang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matt 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Khawa phakhan Pharisee lekkhat in Jisu koolla inheiwa ah amadiang injuoti, “Nang in hiwa munhi innottheiya mathaan inlang amun khat ah sitaro, ajarchu Herod in nangkha nathatzootjei.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Si inlang ram-ui diang juorilpiru: ‘Enru, awini li ziingnga, ratha kachok ngaihi puutsuok kata mi mindam kata, nithum huuini khan kei kachuon kaminheksik ejei.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Halli awini li ziingnga khat-um akahong nikhuo katung kei'n kachuon kathoa kalaomsik eii, ajarchu angtikseng Pathian chong kachoi ngaihi Jerusalem bitkhan inthat wiaksik tihi ommak.”<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Pathian chong kachoi ngai kaleikathat khat-um nangnidiang ijuotir ngaikha lungnga kaleideeng, Oh Jerusalem, Jerusalem! arpui khan amurtha nuoiya ateii ngai ida angnga, kei innum nasa ngaikha apha rakip ah kadazoot takkha nang in leizootmakche! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Enru, nangni biak-inn kha, karuok ah nangnidiang kaleidajeii! halli kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Pumi ramingnga kajuo ama kha ‘Pathian in rawaan apesik eii tihi ningti maklaiseng keihi woikhat inlet-ah namunutunjeii!’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Minpkla 118:26</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Mi Kana Mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Jisu'n Sabbath nikhuo khatni Pharisee chuon karoon ka-eii inkhat inna Jisu'n bukabak aleisi, halli inmani'n Jisu kha inleiensui. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Enru, akei akut inthing pasal inkhat Jisu koolla aheiwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Halli Jisu'n dan karu khat-um Pharisee ngaidiang aleirakel, “Sabbath nikhuoni kana mindamnsik hi eini sinadan in zootbe zootmakbe?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Takkha inmani'n inleiomchian, halli Jisu'n pasal pakha akatook ah amindamma aleiminsijei. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Khawasuoa Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Ningkarra atu ka-ang in asapa emakli asaraat kha Sabbath nikhuoni tuikhurra ata inle innottheiya keisuomak tunnabe?”<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 12:11">Matt 12:11</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Halli inmani'n hiwajarra leimasang matormu.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nunchan inchuolli Mi kadonthei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Jisu'n in-ongnamun kathakhet kakadang khuolmi lekkhat alei intongpui, halli ama'n inmani diang hiwa minkhinahi aleirilpi, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Nangkha miring inkhat in moiruoina bubaknasik anakoi phakhan ongnamun hoina khetkhan in ongmaru, ajarchu nangneek ah kalok miring inkhat leikoicha. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PRO 25:6">Chongngil 25:6</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 25:7">7</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Khale inruoiya nang kanakoi sinpu khan heiwata nangdiang najuotite, ‘amahi hiwa munhin minongro.’ Khawa phakhan nang in nuoi innungkhet munna inongnasik ah injaknate, <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />khawa neek achu, nang innakoi phakhan, si inlang nuoi innungkhet munkhan in-ongro, kha e-inchu asinpu khan heiwata najuotite, ‘Heiwaro suopui mun hoinadet tiang sirui,’ khawa phakhan khuolmi ngai rakip in nangkha khoya thona innaneisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Halli atu ka-ang atheinuo ah inrilsaang amakha ajuominniamsik, khat-um atu ka-ang atheinuo ah inniam mikha aminsaangsik eii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Matt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n sinpu padiang aheiti, “Nang in ziingbu emakli kholeibu naminsuuk phakhan, nasappui ngai, na-u nanai ngai, naphung ngai, emakli inchongkaraang ngai, na-indiang inwaipui ngai kha koimaro, ajarchu inmani'n woikhat nang itho angnga nakoinook inta innamaleii nooksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Takkha nang in bubaknasik naminsuuk phakhan sara, ke inkhooi, siing insatheimak khat-um mit kacho ngaikha koiro, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />kha e-inchu nang in rawaan namusik eii, ajarchu inmani'n nangdiang napekir matornunu, Pathian in nangkha kangamna ngai inhongring nikhuoni khan anape kirnooksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phamwai kahoi kalok minkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matt 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Khamtuolla in-ong puisuom khuolmi inkhat in hiwahi aleijet ah Jisu diang aleiti, “Pathian Rengramma bu kalabaksik inmani kha rawaan katha in-eii!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Takkha Jisu'n amadiang aheiti, “Miring inkhat in phamwaina kahoi kalok amasouk ah mipui kha aleikoi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Bubak nasik phakha aheitung phakhan, ‘Angrakip insuuk suojei heiwataru tia, ikoi mi ngaidiang juotinasik-ah ama'n asuok inkhat atirjei!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Takkha inmani'n rakip in inruolrip ah inkeiduuk nasik inleirilwiak, mansakhet pa'n suokpa diang ati, ‘Kei'n ram inkhat karacho khawakha juoendirong, nangaidamro.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Miring inkhat innum aheitinook, ‘Kei um saraatchal bop ra-nga karacho khawajarra kei'n juo encheen dirong, ngaidam napero.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Miring inkhat innum aheitinook, ‘Kei um inn kalaneilim khawajarra heiwa matornuning.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Suok khan aheikirra ang rakipkha karu diang ajuotipi, karu khan araangnga ama suokpa diang atipi, ‘Innottheiya khuopui lampui ngaikhan si-inlang, sara, kasitheimak, mitkacho khat-um inkhooi inmani ngaikha heiruoiro.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Suokpa khan aheiti, ‘Karu, nang nachongpeii dungjuiya kathosikjei, halli tuunnum mun angjet alaruok.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Halli karu khan asuokpa diang aheiti, si-inlang lampui li khuo ngaikhan ‘Mipui kha ka-inn sipnasik heiruoiro. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kei'n nangdiang kinatihi eii, kei'n kikoimak inmani tuteii innum kei iminsuuk bu kha mintem theinunu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siamruoi Etheinasik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matt 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Mipui katamtak Jisule inleisisuom phakhan, ama'n anuk malet ah inmani diang aleiti. <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Kei kadiang kaheiwa ngai'n anu apa, anumei, asa, a-u anai ngai khat-um apumtak intirmak inchu kei kasiamruoi etheinuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Matt 10:37</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Atu ka-ang in ama cross raput leiya kei kanuk kajui mikha kasiamruoi atheinuni. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Matt 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mk 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9:23</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Nangni karra mi inkhat in insaangtak inn inkhat saksik tia ngaidon inchu, ama'n in-ongta hiwa minheknasik, angjetme kaluutsik tia mansakhet ah minsuukmak niabe? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Inn insaangtak kasak aphutli aminhek matormak inchu akamu mi rakip in ama kha innuipuisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Inmani'n ti-inte, ‘Hiwa mipa hi inn insaangtak kasak aphutli saksuo matormakjei.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Kha emakli reng inkhat in reng inkhat diang raal katho asi inchu, ama'n mi lisingsoom aruoiya inhalpui rengpa raalmi lising soomni ama chungnga raal katho kaheiwa ngaikha mator ningbo tia mansakhet ah ama'n in-ongta ngaidonmak niabe? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ama'n amator maksik e-inchu, kalaak ah inomlai khan asuok inkhat tirta inhalpui rengpa diang inngei nasik chong ajuominrilsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Hiwa angnga” “Atu ka-ang in inei rakip amathaan matormak inchu amakha kei kasiamruoi ematornuni.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka-almak Machi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matt 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mk 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Machi hi ka-al eii, takkha i-al kha amang inchu, angtikteii min-al matornuminjei. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Khawakha neipilthai sik-ah emakli neipil sik a-um nemna kaboi eii; khawa jarra indeengjuon. Kuor indou rakip in jetru!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Akamang Keelngam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matt 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Nisuokhat rampar kakhoom ngaili manukaroon ngai'n Jisu chong inngaisik ah inheiwa. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 5:29">Luk 5:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 5:30">30</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Halli Pharisee ngaili Dan karu ngai'n nemnum inleiti, “Hiwa mi in manu karoonngai idonle inruoiya inmanile aleibaksuom!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Khawajarra Jisu'n hiwa minkhinahi inmani diang aleirilpi.<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Etichu miring inkhat in keelngam rajakhat aneiya inmani karra inkhat aminmang inchu, angme ama'n athosik? Ama'n soomkuo leikuo ngaikha sachik billa data keelngam kamangkha amumaklaiseng kaentok simakniabe? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Halli ama'n khawa amu phakhan, roktheiya adarkhoiya ada, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />halli inntiang achoiya akirphakhan, asappui ngaili indiang inwaipui ngaikha koita inmani diang atisik, kamang keelngam kha kei'n kamujei, keile roksuomrui! <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Hiwa angnga, kei'n nangnidiang kanati, malung thuulsik arei kaommak mi kadik soomkuo leikuo ngai neek ah, manu karoon miring inkhat in malung athuul phakhan marwaanna kheella rokna omsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kamang Dangkapum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Kha emakli numeisa inkhat in dangkapum soom neili ama'n inkhatkha aminmang inle, ama'n sariakmei kha minkaita khat-um inn kha phiatta amumaklaiseng takkachangnga amun rakip ah ratokmak niabe? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Halli ama'n amu phakhan, asappui ngaili indiang inwaipui ngaikha akoichunna inmani diang aleiti, ‘Kiminmang dangkapum kha kamujei, keile roksuomrui!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Hiwa angnga kei'n nangnidiang kanati, manukaroon miring inkhat in amalung ahongthuul phakhan, Pathian tirton ngai'n inroksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sapa Kamang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Halli Jisu'n aleitinook, “Miring inkhat sapa inni kanei aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Naipangpa'n apa diang aleiti, ‘Pa, kei kachansik kasuok neinaak ngaikha napetaro,’ halli ama'n aneinaak ngaikha inmani diang aleisempi. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Nikhuo sootlekleiya neipangpa'n ama achangsik kasouk ngaikha khoomchunna ram kalaak inkhattiang aleisi, khawakhan ama'n neinaak rakip kathamak lamma aminheksuojei. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Khawasuoli ineirakip aminheksuo phakhan, khawa ramsuungnga bukawaang ahong suokjei, halli ama'n iteii leineimakjei. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Khawajarra ama'n khawa ramsuungnga kaleiom miring inkhat diang juokabeiya, khawa naipa khan wokdoonna munna ama kha wok kakhaal sik-ah aleiminsi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Halli tuteii innum amadiang baksik leipemuwa, ama'n wok ngai'n inbak bukhan awon aleiminsip zootjei. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Takkha ama'n atheinuo beiya alei inmudong, ‘Kapa'n chuon kathosik-ah ida suok angjet ngaisik ah baksik inliak bu ada, takkha kei'n hiwahin wonchaamma kathisik ka-ejeii! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Kei'n intheikata kapa koolla sikata, halli kei'n amadiang katisik eii, “Kapa, kei'n Pathian khat-um nangdiang manu kathojei. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Keihi nang nasapa tisik rahoi suokmongjei; keihi nangdiang sial kalousik suok inkhat angnga nadaro.” ’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Khawasuoli ama'n intheiya apa koolla aleisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Halli ama'n a-inn makheiya kalaakjenna iheiwa kha apa'n aheimu phakhan, apa'n ama kha aleiminriang, halli ataanna ama'n asapa kha ajuokakuoa aleimazoop. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Asapa'n aleiti, ‘Kapa,’ ‘Kei'n Pathian li nangdiang manu kathojei, keihi nasapa tisik rahoi suokmongjei.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Takkha apa'n suok ngaidiang aleitipi, ‘Innottheiya!’ ‘Retruo katha khetkha heichoi inlang ama kha minlukru, halli akutkhan kutsabi mintiangru, akeiya kekok milukru, <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />han sarat tuoiteii kanool khetkha heichoi inlang juothatru halli eini'n rokpuirui. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Tichu kei kasapa hi kathi makheiya kahongringnook ejei, ama hi kamangkha eii, halli nimunook ejei,’ khale inruoiya inmani'n karokpui inleiphut.”<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Khawa phakhan asapa upapa kha leiya aleiom, ama'n a-inn ahong naipha khan khuonglidar khat-um laamsiam rasa aleijet. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Halli ama'n suok inkhat akoiya aleirakel, ‘Angme kasuokjei?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Halli suokpa'n aleimasang, ‘Nang nanaipa kha ahongkirnook ah,’ ‘Napa'n kahoi kadamma amunook jarra saraat tuoiteii kanool inkha athatpijei.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Halli ama'n araangtheiya inna luutsik leizootmakjei, apa'n aheisuok ah ama kha insuungnga heiluutro tia aleimatheem. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Takkha ama'n apadiang aleimasang, ‘Enro, kum angjet nang nasuok ka-angnga sepa katho halli nang nachongkha rakaanmong, kha e-innum kei kasappui ngaile roknasik-ah nang in keeltei inkhat-um angtik niteii nalape ngaimakche. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Takkha hiwa nasapa'n zool-inthai ngaile naneinaak rakip aminmangnga heikir lichu ama sik-ah saraat tuoiteii kanool inkhat nathatpi!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Halli apa'n amadiang aheiti, ‘Sapa,’ ‘Nangchu keile apha rakip niomsuom, halli ang rakip kei i-nei ngaihi nang nata eii. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Eini'n kahoi nithoa nirokpuisik adik, ajarchu nanai pahi leikathi ejei, halli ahong ringnookjei, amahi aleimangjei takkha nimunook ejei.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Neikaensui mipa Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Inchong mi inkhat aleiom khat-um aneinaak kaensui sik suok inkhat aleida, mi ngai'n aneinaak kaensuipa khan aneinaak rakip kadikmak ah minhekjei tia inchong padiang inleitipi. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Khale inruoiya ama'n suokpa kha koiya aleitipi, ‘Kei'n nang najarra kijet rakiphi angkemejei? kaneinaak naensuina aluut asuokna ngaikha napero; ajarchu nanghi tuun makheiya kei kaneinaak kaensuipa etheinutinjei.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Suokpa khan atheinuo ah alei-inti, ‘Kei karu'n kachoun makheiya nakhaisik ejei, tuun angme kei'n kathosik? kei'n khur kakhuorsik a-um karaat emongjei, bu kanisik um ka-injakjei, <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />kei'n kachuontho ahekni mi ngai'n inmani inna nakeiluutnasik kei'n angme kathosik kha kajetjei.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Khale inruoiya karu sial kapuuk ngaikha, inkhat inkhat ah koina aleinei, ama'n mansakhet padiang aleiti, ‘Angjetme nang in karu diang nipuuk kha?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />‘Olive sariakkok rajakhat’ tia ama'n aleimasang, halli neikaensui pa'n amadiang aleitipi, ‘Napuukna cheihi’ lei inlang ‘Innottheiya in-ong inlang soom ra-nga majiaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Khat-um aleiilaak mipa diang aheitipinook, ‘Nangleii angjet napuukme?’ Ama'n aleimasang, ‘Gehu saangphai lisingkhat,’ neikaensui pa'n amadiang ati, napuukna cheihi lei inlang rajariat majiaro. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Khawajarra huoikajuomak neikaensui pa'n kasingnga atho jarra akaru in aminpaak, ajarchu manmasituol sa ngai'n inmani khangnga inmani inroonna chuonna war sangai neek ah kheella insing.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Halli Jisu'n inlet ah ati, “Nangni'n ningpumtak sik-ah manmasituolla ningnei sial le sum ngaikhan sap boolru, halli khawa kha ahekli nangni kha hektik kaboi innkhan innadonsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Atu ka-ang mi'n kasiinteii chounna ngamna katha mikha choun kalok khannum ngamna katha esik eii; atu ka-ang-in choun kasiinna ngamna kathamak mi khachu akalok chounna-um ngamna thanuni. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nangni'n manmasituol neinaak ah ngamna katha ning emak inchu, tu-in nangnidiang inthiang neinaak ah ngamna nape niame? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Halli nangni'n mi ngai neinaak ah ngamna kaom ning emak inle, tu-in ningta ka-eii neinaak kha nape niame?”<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Angtikseng suok inkhat in karu inni suok ethainuni; ama'n inkhat kha amatirsik eii, inkhat kha aminriangsik eii, emakle inkhatpa chong ajuisik eii, halli inkhatpa chong juinuni. Nangni'n Pathian li neilenung suok esuom theinutun.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Matt 6:24</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Chongril Lekkhat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Matt 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mk 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Sial kamanuom Pharisee ngai'n hiwa chong rakip injet phakhan ama kha inlei innuipui. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Halli ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni ngaihi miring ngai mit-en sik ah katha inleem ning eii, takkha Pathian in ningmalung ngaikha ajet, tichu miring ngai'n inminlur kha Pathian diangchu kathamak khet eii.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Moses Dan li Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n inleimajia ngaikha John Baptist pha katung ileirilthang; khawapha makheiya Pathian Rengram jarra chong kahoi kha karil inleiphut, halli mi rakip in ranak soongnga inleinei, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 11:12">Matt 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Takkha Dan chongramol inkhat kamangsik neek achu marwaan li nuoipil kamangsik kha abei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:18">Matt 5:18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Atu ka-ang pasal in anumei inthenpuili numeisa inkhat ajuonei inchu, zool-inthai eii; halli atu ka-ang pasal in aruothar le inthenjei numeisanu kha ajuonei inchu zool-inthai eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Matt 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Cor 7:10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inchongpa li Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Apha inkhat inchong karaang mi inkhat aleiom ama'n aman katamkhet puonlidiar inluk ah nisuo rakip katui kathai abak ah kahoiya aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Halli sara pasal inkhat araming Lazarus inti apumparaang kapan inkhat aleiom, ama kha inchongpa innkhar kuungnga bu kanisik inleiruoi, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Inchongpa bubakna khamtuol makheiya ajuokachul ngaikha kabak phangsik eii tia aleingaidon, ui ngai kha-um inheiwa ah ama kapan kha injuomaliak. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Hintia aleisuokjei, Sara pakha athiya Pathian tirton ngai'n Abraham omnamun khan inleiruoi, inchongpa kha-um athiya inleiphuum. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Halli ama'n poongna mun meikhur makheiya chungtiang ahong enna Abraham koolla Lazarus in ileiom kha kalaaktak makheiya ahongmu. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ama khan akheek ah ahongti, ‘Kapa Abraham! kei naminriangro halli Lazarus kha juotir inlang akutramolla tuiramol inkhat kamalei juomindainasik juomasarrase, ajarchu keihi meiya poongna kaneijei!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Takkha Abraham in aleitipi, ‘Sapa ngaidonro, nang in naringlai katha rakip namujei, halli Lazarus chu kathamak ngaiseng aleimu, takkha atuunchu ama'n hiwahin hoina imu ejei, halli nang in poongna nimu ejei. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Hiwa rakip ngai chungnga, nangni kahongzoot ngai um hongthei maknasik, keini kajuosik ngai um kinjuo theimaknasik-ah keini li nangni kongkarra inphathei maknasik khurkalok inkhat in na-ook ah omjei.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Inchongpa in aleiti, “Hanchu Kapa Abraham kei'n kanani, Lazarus kha kapa inna natirpiro, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kei ka-u ra-nga inom, hiwa poongnamun hin hongmak nasik ah ama'n sise inlang inmani ngaidiang chong juothakrase. <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abraham in ati, ‘Nang na-u nanai ngaidiang chong kapesik-ah Moses li Pathian chongkachoi ngai inom, na-u nanai ngai'n inmani chongkha rangai rasu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Inchongpa'n ahongmasang, ‘Kapa Abraham! Khawa ngaikhan hunmak, takkha kathi inkhat in aringnga inmani diang ajuoti inchu, inmani'n manu makhaiya malung thuulna nei-inte.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Takkha Abraham in ati, ‘Inmani'n Moses khat-um Pathian chongkachoi ngai chong inrangaimak inchu, angtikniseng inmani'n miring inkhat kathi makheiya intheiya juominchu innum inmani'n malung thuulnunu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Manu Jarra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Matt 18:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mk 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “ Manu thonasik-ah miringngai chungnga matheemna omgersik eii, takkha khawa ngai akamasuok amakha angtuk poongna kaomsikme. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ama'n akasiin naipang ngaikha manu kamintho neek achu, ama riingnga lungchakari inkhit-ah tuipui suungnga indeengjuon kha athadet.” <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ningtheinuo ah insingtheiru!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Na-u nanai inkhat in manu intho inchu, ama kha ranro, halli ama'n amalung ahongthuul inchu rangaidamro. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:15">Matt 18:15</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ama'n nisuokhat ah nangdiang woisari manu athoa, halli woisari nangdiang heikeirra ‘kei kamalung kathuuljei ati inchu,’ nang in ama kha rangaidamro.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inngamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Tirton ngai in Pumi diang inleiti, “Keini ngamnahi naminlokpiro.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Pumi'n aheimasang, “Anchamru tiatbit nang ngamna kha om-inchu, nang in hiwa mulberry thingkuung hi arajungnga inphuk inlang halli tuipuiya juomoongro nati innum! ama'n nang nachongkha ajuisik eii.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suok Chuonthosik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Nangni karra miring inkhat keelngam kakhaal sik khat-um leikakhuoi sik suok inkhat aneiya halli ama'n lei makheiya ahongkir phakhan, amadiang innoottheiya heiwa inlang bu juobaktaro katipisik tu ning ommame? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Khawa rathuulla nang in nakhoong khit inlaang ‘Kabak ka-insik minsuukro, kabak ka-insuo maklaiseng kasepa thoro, khawa suoli nang-um baktro nang in amadiang timak tinnabe.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Suokpa'n ama chongpe ajui jarra minpaak sik rahoi suokmak, ama rahoi suok abe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Khawale in-ang rip-ah, nangnidiang thosik innapeii chounkha ningtho phakhan, ‘Keini chu rahoi kasuokmak suok ngaikha kin eii halli kinthosik kasuok chuonkha kintho eii” tiru.<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Takbangri Karoon Miring soom Mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Jisu'n Jerusalem lamtiang aleisi phakhan Samaria li Galilee kongkarra aleitheng. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ama'n khuosuung aheiluut phakhan kalaak-ah ka-ngirra kaleiom takbangri karool miring soom alei intongpui. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Halli inkheek-ah inheiti, “Jisu, Karu, keini diang naminriangro.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Halli Jisu'n inmani kha aleimuwa aleiti, “Si inlang thiampu ngaidiang juoinmuru.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Halli inmani'n insina lamma in-iroon takbangri kha juodam tirjei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">juodam tirjei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">5:12 enru</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Inmani karra miring inkhat in ama idamkha amupha khan, aheikirnook ah rasa inringnga Pathian aleiminpaak. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Halli Jisu kekuungnga inbok ah inpaakna aleimalar, halli ama kha Samaritan mi alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Kadam kha miring soom emuwabe? Khawa ngai khale hun inom mejei? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hiwa zaatlop mipahi elekleiya aleiilaak heikirra Pathian kaminpaaksik ommu bejei?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Halli Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Inthei inlang sitaro; nang ngamna khan nidam ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pathian Rengram kajuosik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matt 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Pharisee ngai'n Pathian Rengram kha angtik ajuosikme tia Jisu diang inleirakel phakhan, ama'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Pathian Rengram chu eini mit-enna nimu angnnga juonuni. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Tuteii innum tinunu, ‘Enru, hin omjei!’ emakli, ‘Enru, sosun omjei!’ ajarchu Pathian Rengram kha nangni suungnga om.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nangni suungnga; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nangni karra; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jetleitheileiya nangni karra inlar duoi.</char></note>”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Halli ama'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aleiti, “Nangni'n Miring sapa kha ningmuzootna nikhuo inkhat alahongsik eii takkha nangni'n munutun. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Halli mi ngai'n nangnidiang innati sik eii, ‘Sosun enru, emakli hin enru!’ takkha nangni'n juimaru khat-um suokmaru. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ajarchu lairalak mun inkhat makheiya kool juo-inlek phakhan, lairalaak mun inkhatiang ijuowar angnga miring sapa jouni khannum khawa ka-angsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama'n poongna angjet intongpui masasik eii halli hiwa khang mi ngai'n amakha zootnunu. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Khat-um Noah khangnga kaleisuok angnga Miring sapa nikhuoni khannum alasuoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 6:5-8">Inphut 6:5-8</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Noah in rakuong suungnga aluutmak laiseng, inmani'n inbak in-inna, inn inneiya, moi inruoiya inleiom, halli tuikalok tuikalian asuok ah inmani rakip aleiminmangjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 7:6-24">Inphut 7:6-24</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Hiwale in angrip ah Lot nikhuoni khannum, inmani'n inbak in-in, inracho, injour, inling, halli inn insak ah inleiom. <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 18:29">Inphut 18:29</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:25">19:25</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Takkha Lot in Sodom makheiya asuok nikhan marwaan makheiya mei khat-um kaatmei kha ruosur angnga ajuosurra inmani rakip ngaikha aleiminmang. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Miring sapa juo-inlarna nikhuo nikhan num khawa angnga akasuok sik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Khawa nikhuoni khan innchungnga kaom in aneinaak kaleisik-ah innsuungnga juochumkhai marase, halli hiwa angnga leiya kaom atu ka-ang innum inntiang hongkirkhai marase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:17-18">Matt 24:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:15">Mk 13:15</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:16">16</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Lot numei kha ngaidonru! <char style="rq"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Inphut 19:26</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Atu ka-ang in ama ringkhuo kaminringsik ah ka-entok ama khan aminmangsik eii, atu ka-ang in ama ringkhuo kaminmang amakha'n ringna amusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Matt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jn 12:25</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Kei'n kanati, khawani zaanna zaalmun inkhat-ah mi inni inleizaalsik eii, miring inkhatkha aruoisik halli minring inkhat kha adasik eii. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mi inni'n saang inleisuksik eii, miring inkhat aruoisik halli mi inkhat kha adasik eii.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Leiya mi inni inleiomsik eii, miring inkhat kha aruoisik halli miring inkhat kha adasik eii.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Halli inmani'n amadiang inheiti, “Hunme Pumi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">halli Jisu'n aleimasang, “Mikathi kaluong omna munkhan laangkia ngai'n intuupsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Chuulmeinu li Chongkatanpa Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Halli Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang Pathian diang inchat lekleiya nichaknasik khat-um malung juosiin maknasik-ah minkhina chong aleiminchu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Jisu'n aleiti, “Khuopui inkhat-ah Pathian kachimak khat-um mi ngai khoya kathomak chongkatan miring inkhat aleiom; <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Halli khawa khopui khan chuulmei inkhat-um aleiom, numeisanu khan chong katanpa diang aheiwazoolla ajuoti, ‘Kei inhalpui mi ngaikha phaphu naluokpiro aleiti. <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Takkha ama'n apha kasoottak leirangai pimak, halli ahekna ah ama'n atheinuoa inti, keihi Pathian kachimak emakli mi ngai kakayamak ka e-innum, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />chuulmeinu khan keidiang heiwazoolla kanakacher sikneek achu, kei'n amadiang thopidan kasuok kha thopitakte. Halli kei'n kathopimak inchu ama'n heiwa zoolta keihi anaminpoongsik eii!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Halli Pumi in aleiti, “Rangairu kathamak chongkatanpa'n i-tihi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Khat-um Pathian diang suun li zaan boiya Pathian diang niya kaom Pathian ikadang mi ngaikha Pathian in inmanisik-ah phaphu luokpimak niabe? Halli ama'n inmani kasansik hi insuumniabe? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, Pathian in inmani sikbit-ah innottheiya phu aluoksik eii. Miring sapa ajuonikhan nuoipilchung hin, kangamna lamunibo?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharisee li Rampar Kakhoompa Minkhina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Atu ka-ang mi'n atheinuoa mikadik ka eii inti, halli mi ngaichu iteii emu tia kangaidon minkhi nahi Jisu'n aleiril. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Miring inni'n biak-inna Pathian kani inleisi, inkhat khachu Pharisee eii, halli inkhat khachu rampar kakhoompa eii. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Pharisee pa'n atheinuo ah a-ngirra aleini,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">atheinuo ah angirra Pathian aleini; aleiilaak larik achu, intheiya halli ama diang alei inni.</char></note> ‘Pathian, kei'n nang kanaminpaak, tichu mi ngai angnga keihi kakheel innuomma mi ngai kakasuut, malung inthiangmak, emakli zool-inthai emong, hiwa rampar kakhoompa ka-ang um emong. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Kei'n haptakhat-ah sak woini kangei, halli kei'n kimasuok rakip tum soomma tumkhat nangdiang kanapeii.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Takkha rampar kakhoompa khan kalaak-ah a-ngirra aroop kabeenna khat-um chuntiang-um hong-en matormak-ah, ‘Pathian, manu karoon keihi naminriangro tia aleini!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Kei'n kanati,” “Hiwa rampar khakhoompa'n Pathian mit enna aleiilaak mipa khaneek ah mikadik eya inntiang aleisi. Ajarchu apumtaak insaang mikha aminniamsik eii, halli apumtaak inniam mikha aminsaangsik eii.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Matt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Naipang ngaidiang Rawaan pena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matt 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mk 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Halli mi lekkhat in naipang ngaikha ama koolla rawaan penasik-ah inheiruoi, takkha asiamruoi ngai'n inmu phakhan ranna inleinei. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Takkha Jisu'n naipang ngaikha ama koolla aleikoiya ati, “Naipang ngaihi kakoolla heiwarasu, inmani kha khaapmaru, Pathian Rengramhi inmani ka-ang ngaisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Kei'n inthiangnga kanati, hiwa kadoong naipang ngai angnga Pathian Rengramkha ningkeiluutmak inchu angtik niteii Pathian Rengram luuttheinutun.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inchongpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matt 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Jihudi lamkakei inkhat in aheirakel, “Katha karu, hektik kaboi ringkhuo mutheinasik angme kei'n kathosik?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Jisu'n amadiang ati, “Angjarra katha ninatime?” “Tuteii katha ommu Pathian eleiya. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Pathian chongpekha najetbo: ‘Zool-inthai thomaro, mi thatmaro, inruup thomaro, mi ngaikha rilsemaro, nanu napa kayaro,’ ” <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Suok 20:13</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 20:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Innidan 5:18</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 5:19">19</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Ama'n aheimasang, “Hiwa chongpeii rakip ngaichu naipang ka-elai inphut kahongjuijeii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Jisu'n hiwangai ajet phakhan ama diang aleitipi, “Nang in nathosik chuonkhat laom, naneinaak rakip juor inlang sara ngaidiang sempiro, nang in marwaan ramma na-inchongsik eii, halli heikirnook inlang kanuk najuiro.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Takkha ama'n hiwa ajet phakhan amalung leihoimak, ajarchu ama inchongthei mi eii.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Jisu'n amadiang ahei enna ati, “Inchong mi ngai'n Pathian Rengram luutsik hi angtuk intakme. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Ajarchu inchong mi'n Pathian Rengram kaluutsik neek achu Salaileem in simphoi kuorra kaluutsik abeiwiai.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Khawa kajet mi ngai'n amadiang inti, “Hale atume ringna kamusik?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Takkha ama'n ati, “Miring ngaisik-ah ka-ethei makkha, Pathian diangchu ethei eii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Khale inruoiya Peter in aheiti, “Enro, keini'n kin inn kinmathaanna nang nanuk kinnajuijei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />“Oh,” Jisu'n inmani diang aheiti, “Kei'n nangnidiang inthiangnga kinnati, atu ka-ang in a-inn, anumei, a-u ngai emakli anu apa halli asa ngai Pathian Rengram sik-ah ning mathaan inchu <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />atuunna ringkhohin kataamma amusik khat-um kahongsik pha-ah hektik kaboi ringna inmusik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Athisik jarra Woithum Huuina Iril.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matt 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mk 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Khawa suoli Jisu'n asiamruoi soomleini ngaikha akoisuok ah inmani diang aleiti, “Enru! eini'n Jerusalem tiang nisisik eii, halli Pathian chong kachoi ngai'n Miring sapa chungnga inleimajia rakipkha kajuotungsik ejei. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Tichu ama kha zaatlop ngaidiang inpesik eii, halli ama kha innui puisik eii, injak inpesik eii, halli inmachinthuonsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Inmani'n ama kha inwuok ah inthatsik, halli ama kha nithum huuini ahongring nooksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Takkha asiamruoi ngai'n chong ngaihi iteii leijetmu, khat-um hiwa irilsuok chong ngaihi inmani sikbeiya inthuuk ejarra, angtiname tikha inmani'n leijetmu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Bukani Mitkacho Mindamna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matt 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mk 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Halli Jisu'n Jericho aheinei phakhan, Bukani mitkacho inkhat lamsirra in-ongnga leiom. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Halli ama'n mipui sirasa ajet phakhan, ama'n “angjarrame tia alei rakel?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Inmani'n amadiang inleiti, “Nazareth Jisu kha eii kasihi,”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />halli ama'n ahongkheek, “Jisu! David sapa, kei naminriangro!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Halli amatiang kaom mi ngai'n omchianro tia ranna inleinei, takkha kheella ahongkhek nook, “David sapa! kei naminriangro!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Halli Jisu'n a-ngirra, mitkacho pakha amadiang heiruoinasik-ah chong aleipeii, halli ama'n ahong naiphakhan, amadiang aleirakel, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Angme nang in keidiang ninna minthozoot?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">ama'n aleiti, “Pumi,” “Kei kamit kamuzoot nookjei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Halli Jisu amadiang aleiti, “Namit kha kamu etaro! nang inngamna khan inamidam ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Khawapha takkhan amitkha aleimuwa Pathian minpaak ah Jisu nuk aleijui, mi rakip in khawa inmupha khan Pathian kha inmani'n inleiminpaak.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu li Zacchaeus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Jisu'n Jericho rakaanna aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Khawa khan araming Zacchaeus inti pasal inkhat aleiom, ama kha rampar kakhoom kalok khat-um inchong mi inkhat kha alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ama'n Jisu kha tume tihi ajetzoot jarra alei enzoot, takkha amahi mi inniam alei eii, khat-um mipui katamtak in inlei-uum jarra Jisu kha leimu matormak. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Khale inruoiya ama'n Jisu kha amuzoot jarra inmani matiang ataanna Jisu'n rakaannasik lamkhan theibajil kuung kha aleikalla aleiom. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Jisu'n khawa muunkha hongtung phakhan, chungtiang ahong enna aleitipi, “Zacchaeus innoottheiya juochumro awini kei'n nangna innna kaomsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Khale inruoiya ama'n innoottheiya ajuochumma karok tak ah Jisu kha aleidonna, inntiang leiruoijei. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Halli mi rakip in inmupha khan, inraya ah nemnum inleiti “Hiwa mihi manu karoonpa inna khuol mi ka-esik asijei!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zacchaeus in a-ngirra Pumi diang aheiti, “Rangairo karu! Kei kaneinaak herkhat hi sara ngaidiang kapejei, halli kei'n mi ngai neinaak maleisei kathoa kaleidel ngai leisuok inchu tum mili kheella kapekir nooksik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Halli Jisu'n amadiang aheiti, “Awini hiwa innsuung hin Sanminringna juotuungjei, tichu ama hium Abraham phungrui eii. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ajarchu Miring sapa kajuohi akamangngai kaentok khat-um kasanringsik kajuo eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:10">Matt 18:10</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minas Soom jarra Minkhena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matt 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Halli inmani'n hingai rakip inrangai phakhan, Jisu'n Jerusalem aheinaiya hiwa minkhinahi aleirilpinook, halli Pathian Rengram hi atuuntak juosik angjei tia inmani'n inleingaidon. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Khawa jarra Jisu'n ati, “Miring inkhat kalokthei choun karoon inkhat aleiom halli ama'n Reng inkhat inchangnasik ah ram kalaaktak inkhat ah aleisi, reng changsuoli inntiang hongkir nooksik tia aleingaidon. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Halli ama'n asuok soom ngaikha akoiya Minas soomhi inmani diang aleipei, halli inmani diang ati, ‘Hiwa Minas hi kaheikir maklaiseng nangni'n hiwahi leiminweiru.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Takkha amahi ami ngaitak in enzootmuwa ama nuk ah taangwa ngai inleiminsiya ‘Hiwa mipa hi keini reng ka-esik hi manuommung katisik ah inleiminsi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Halli mipa kha reng eya aheikir jei, ama'n Minas hi angjetme inleiminwei ennasik-ah asuok ngaikha ama koolla heiwanasik-ah chong aleiminpeii. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Halli mansakhet suokpa khan ama koolla aheiwa ah ati ‘Karu, nang i-napeii Mina inkhat in Mina soom kaleiminweijei.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Halli ama'n ati, ‘Thajei’ ‘Akatha suokpa! Ajarchu nang in kasiinteii chuonna ngamna katha na-e jarra, khuopui soom karoon etaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />‘Inni huuina suokpa khan heiwa ah ati, Karu, nang mina inkhat in Mina ra-nga kaleiminweijei.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Halli amadiang um ati, ‘Nang um khuopui ra-nga karoon etaro.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />‘Suok inkhat innum heiwa ah ati, Karu, puonna kakhit rep ah kida nang Mina kha hin omjei. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Kei'n nangkha kanachi ajarchu malung kathamak na-eii, nang nata ka-emak nang in nalei khat-um na i-wormak kha nang in narakhool.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Ama'n suokpa diang ati, ‘E suok kathamak! nang inrilsuok chong in chongtanna kananeisik! kata ka-emak kha kalei, khat-um ka i-wormak kha karakhool tia kei kamalung kathamak hi nang in nalei jetjei. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Kha e-inle angjarra nang in kei Mina hi nilei minwei makme? Naleiminwei inchu kei'n kaheikir phakhan Mina niminwei khale inruoiya juoleimak ningngabe?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Halli khawa khanna kangir ngaidiang aleitipi, ama diangnga kaom ‘Mina hi kasut inlang, Mina soom kanei suokpa diang peru.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Halli inmani'n ama diang inti ‘Karu, ama chu Mina soom aneijei!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />‘Kei'n nangnidiang kanati,’ ‘katamma kaneipa diang kheella inpesik eii, takkha i-teii kaneimakpa diang chu i-nei lekteii khaum inleidelsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Matt 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mk 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luk 8:18</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Takkha keihi inmani chungnga in-reng kanamin ezootmak kei nanhalpui mi ngaikha heiruoi inlang kamaikuungnga thatru!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Maika-arra Jerusalemma Iheiluut</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Jn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Hiwa arilsuoli Jerusalem tiang Jisu'n ma sa-ah aleisi. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Halli ama'n Olives chingbung koolla kaom Bethphage li Bethany ahongnai phakhan, asiamruoi inni diang hintipili ma minsa-ah aleitir, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />“Ningma ah kaom khuo khan siru khat-um ningluut phakhan, tuteii in inlachuongmak salungdai teii inthungnga kaomkha muningte, suut inlang hin juoruoiru. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Halli tu ka-ang mi'n nangnidiang salungdai hi angsik-ah ningsuutme tia innarakel inchu, nangni'n hin tipiru, Karu sik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:31: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Karu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">amapupa,</char></note> ah arei om.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n insipha khan Jisu'n irilpi angnga injuomujei. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Halli inmani'n salungdai teii kha insuutpha khan amapupa'n aleiti, “Angsik ah ningsuutme?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Inmani'n inleimasang, “Karu diang arei ompiya eii.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Inmani'n salungdai kha Jisu diang inheiruoi, Inpuondiar kha salungdai chungnga indaap ah Jisu kha inleiminchuong. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Jisu'n achuongnga aheiwa phakhan, inmanin gai'n inpuon ngaikha lamma inleithapi.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ama'n Olives chingmuol makheiya juochumma Jerusalem ajuonai phakhan, anuk kajui mipui rakip in Pathian chountho kalokkha inleimu phakhan inkheek ah inleiminpaak ah inti, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Pumi ramingnga kajuo Renghi rawaan katha eii! marwaanna kadai erase halli lurna kha insaangkhet erase!” <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Minpkla 118:26</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Halli mipui karra Pharisee lekkhat in inti, “Karu,” “Nasiamruoi ngaihi omchian nasik ranro!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Ama'n aleimasang, “Kei'n nangnidiang kitihi eii, inmani'n inomchian inchu, hiwa lung ngai'n inhongkheek sik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Jerusalem sik ah I-chap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Jisu'n Jerusalem khuopui aheinai phakhan, ama'n amuli aleichappuiya ati, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />“Nang in awini nikhuo hin kadai munasik chuon nalajet limbe! takkha atuunchu nang in munutinjei! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ajarchu nachungnga hiwa ka-ang nikhuo ngaihi asuoksik eii, khawakha e-inchu nang inhalpui ngai'n rakul bool-inta nangkha nakahin inta araki miliya nangkha innakhumsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Halli nang khat-um rakul sungnga kaom nang mi ngaikha innathasik eii, halli rakul suungnga kaom lung inkam ngaikha inmani'n minkamma danunujei, ajarchu Pathian in nangni kanasan ajuolai khan leijet makchujei!”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Biak-inn Iminthiang</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matt 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mk 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Jn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Halli Jisu'n biak-inn aheiluut ah neinaak kajuorngai khat-um karachuo ngaikha kapuutsuok aleiphut ah, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Inmani diang aleiti, “Hinthoa Pathian chongnga injiajei, ‘Kei biak-inn chu Pathian nina mun esik eii.’ Takkha nangni'n inruup ngai inthupna mun ningminchangjei.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jer 7:11</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Khat-um Jisu'n biak-inna nisuo rakip aleiminchu, thiampu kalian, Dan karu khat-um mipui lamkakei ngai'n ama kha thatnasik-ah inlei-ensui. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 21:37">Luk 21:37</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 19:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Takkha inmani'n iteii thomator nasik lam leimumu, ajarchu mipui'n ama chongril kha katha tak ah inleirangai.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Matorna jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matt 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mk 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Nisuokhat Jisu'n biak-inna mipui diang iminchu khat-um chong kahoi arilla aleiom phakhan, thiampu kalian ngai, Dan karu ngai khat-um katar ngaikha inheiwa-ah <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Jisu diang injuoti, “Keini diang heitiro, ang ranak naneiya hiwa ngaihi nithome? Emakli tume hiwa thonasik-ah ranak kanapeii?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Kei innum nangnidiang rakelna naneikate, keidiang heitiru, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />John'n baptism imintho kha, Pathian diang makheiya kajuobe emakli manmasi makheiya kajuobe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Halli inmani karra inbiakna inneiya inleiti, “Eini'n ‘Pathian diang makheiya’ niti inchu, ama'n natite halle ‘angjarra amakha ningngamna makme?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Halli ‘Eini'n minring makheiya eii’ niti innum mipui'n eini kha lungnga innadeeng thatsik eii, ajarchu mipui'n John hi Pathian chongkachoi inkhat eii tia inlei.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Khawa jarra inmani'n “Humakheiya kajuome jetmung tia inleimasang.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Ang ranak kaneiya hiwa ngairakip kithome kei innum nangnidiang tinuning.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rahuon Kangaak ngai Minkhina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matt 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mk 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Halli Ama'n hiwa chong minkhi nahi mipui diang karil aleiphut: “Apha inkhat-ah theibombil katho miring inkhat aleiom, rahuonkha chuon katho mi ngaidiang aminhuumma apha kasoot taksik-ah aleisi. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 5:1">Isa 5:1</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Theibom rakhoolpha ahongtungnga ama'n suok inkhat rahuon katho mi ngaidiang ramparman kalei aleiminsi takkha rahuon katho mi ngai'n suokpa kha inleiwuok-ah iteii minchoi lekleiya injuominkir. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Halli ama'n suok inkhat aleiminsi nookjei, ama kha-um inwuok ah jakna kaomthei omchanna inrachaak ah kut karuok-ah inhongmin kirnookjei. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Khawasuoli inthum changna suok kha-um aleitir, inmani'n ama kha kase-ah inwuok-ah inleidenjuon. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Khawa khan rahuon mapu pa'n ati, ‘Angme kei'n kathosik? Kasapa kiminriang inkhat beihi kaminsi inchu inmani'n ama hi kaya inte!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Takkha rahuon katho ngai'n amakha inmupha khan, inmani inkhatli inkhat inlei inti, ‘Hiwahi inluo kaluoksikpa kha eii, ama changsik kasuokkha einita enasik-ah eini'n amahi thattui!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Inmani'n amakha inthat-ah halli akaluong kha rahuon raaltiang inleideengjuon.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">“Jisu'n aleirakel, angme rahuon mapupa in inmani diang athosik?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Ama'n heiwata rahuon kangaak rakip ngaikha thatta, halli rahuon kha aleiilaak rahuon kangaak inkhat diang apesik eii,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Mi ngai'n hiwahi injet phakhan, inmani'n inleiti, “Acha inchu hiwahi kasuok emarase!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Jisu'n inmani diang ahei enna aleiti, “Angme, inthiang chong in iti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Inn kasak ngai'n anemna ommakjei tia indeengjuon lungkha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">akilla kaom nemna kaomkhet lungkha ahong eii.’<char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Minpkla 118:22</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Khawa lungchungnga kajuota miring rakip in alek alek ah inkoisik eii, halli khawa lung inn atu ka-ang diang ajuodeeng inchu ama kha rahut inchangsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rampar Pesik jarra Chongrakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matt 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mk 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Khawapha takkhan thiampu kalian ngaili dan karu ngai'n Jisu kha surnasik inleingaidon, ajarchu inmani'n hiwa minkhina rilsena chonghi inmani diang eii tia inleijet, takkha inmani'n mipu kha inleichi. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n Jisu kha inmaruongnga chong rakel li surra, waikaroonpa li ranak kanei ngai kutchungnga peinasik inmani'n sialla inracho akatha inleem mi lekkhat Jisu kaensuisik inleiminsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Kaensui ngai'n Jisu diang inleiti, “Karu, nangchu kadik khat-um katuunna naminchu halli mi-um khoithen makche, takkha Pathian lungdou katuun kha naminchu tihi keini'n kijet. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Keini'n Caesar diang rampar pesik hi Dan khan koibe koimakbe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Takkha Jisu inmani ngaidon kathamak kha aleijet ah inmani diang aleiti, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Dangkapum kha naminmuro, khawa khan atu ramil omme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Inmani'n inti, “Caesar's.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Caesar takha Caesar's diang peru, halli Pathian takha Pathian diang peru.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Inmani'n mipui karra achongrilla Jisu kha leisur matormu, takkha ama masang nakhan inleingak ah inmani'n rilsik leijeitmuwa inomchianjei.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kathi makheiya Hongringna jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matt 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Khawa khan kathi makheiya kahongring ommak kati Sadducees lekkhat Jisu diang inheiwa ah injuoti, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Chuon 23:8</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />halli inmani'n Jisu diang inleirakel, “Karu, Moses Dan in keini sik-ah aleimajia, ‘Atu ka-ang a-u inkhat numei leineiya asa omleiya a-upa athi inchu anaipa'n anumei kha neita a-upa sik-ah sa aneipi sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Innidan 25:5</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Ulenai sari inleiom, upapa khan numei aneili sa neileiya athijei. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Halli inni huuinapa'n aneinookjei, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />khat-um inthum huuinapa innum aneinook jei, hiwa angnga sari ngai'n innei wiak ah sa neileiya inthiwiakjei. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Khawa suoli numeisanu um athijei. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kha e-inle kathi makheiya hongringni khan numeisanu kha atu numei esik me? Ajarchu numeisanu kha mi sari numei alei ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Atuunnna khangnga sa ngachu inn innei khat-um inn neisik-ah azootpi. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Takkha kahongsik khang khat-um kathiya inphut ringna kamusik rahoi ejei tia inlei mi ngai khachu inn neinunu khat-um inn kanei ti omnunijei. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Ajarchu inmani kha woikhat thinunujei, ajarchu inmani kha marwaan tirton ngaile in-angjei, halli thiya inphut karing sa ngaikha in-e jarra Pathian sangai inejei. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Khawa jarra Moses innum, ‘Abraham Pathian, Isaac Pathian, khat-um Jacob Pathian tia’ akoilai khan kathi rakip inhongringjei tia Pumi jarra suulbuklai kaangna larik munkhan inthiangnga amalarjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Suok 3:6</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 20:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Khawa jarra amahi kathi Pathian emak takkha akaring Pathian eii, halli mi rakip in amadiang ringna inmusik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Dan karu lekkhat ngai'n inhongmasang, “Karu, katha ah namasangjei.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Khawa makheiya inmani'n inngam hiaiya Jisu diang iteii leirakelzoot mujei.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Messiah jarra Rakelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matt 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mk 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Takkha Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Angtho thoa Christa hi nangni'n David phungrui eii ningtime? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Tichu David tak in ati Minpaakla larik ah,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Pumi in kei ka Pumi diang ati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">kei kakut changtiang in-ongro, <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Minpkla 118:22</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Kei'n ninhalpui ngaikha naketouna kaminchang makleiseng.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />David innum ‘Pumi’; tia akoi inle, angtho thoa Messiah hi David's sapa eniame?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Dan Minchuna jarra Chongmakaina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matt 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mk 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Khale inruoiya mipui'n inrangaiya inom phakhan Jisu'n asiamruoi ngaidiang aheiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Dan karu ngai makheiya insingtheiru, songkol inchuol inlukzoot, halli phaisungnga chubei inthosik kamanuom, Synagogue ngaikhan in-ongna kathakhet kakadang, mipui bubakna karra in-ong mun kahoikhet kakadang ngaikha in eii. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Inmani'n Chuulmei ngai innle-lei inkasut, halli aomchan kathoa kasoot ah Pathian kani, inmani ngai poongna kha kheella asedoomsik eii!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Chuulmeinu Kutchoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mk 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Khat-um Jisu'n ahei enphakhan inchong ngai'n biak-inn sialkok ah kutchoi inpe ngaikha aleimu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ama'n chuulmei saranu innum sumsenpum inni ileimachun kha aleimu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ama'n ati, “Kei'n inthiangnga natipikate, hiwa ngai chungnga sara chuulmeinu'n kheella apei. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Tichu Pathian kutchoi penamunna nang ningai rakipchu ning innei chungnga inliak ningpe eii, takkha hiwa chuulmeinu inchu sara e-innum ama ringnasik-ah inei rakipkha i-pe eii.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Biak-inn Koinasik jarra Irilpi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Matt 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Mk 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Halli hiwa lung katha ah insak biak-inn hi angtuk enzoot kaomme khat-um Pathian diang inpei kutchoihi angtuuk enzoot kaomme tia biak-inn jarra asiamruoi lekkhat in inleiril. Halli Jisu'n ati, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Nangni'n ning i-mu rakip ngaihi, lung inkhat chungnga inkhat inkamhi chiamleiya danuni; halli lung rakip minchiam leiya damaknasik apha kha laheiwasik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poongna Raalna kapeii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matt 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mk 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Halli inmani'n inleirakel, “Karu, hiwahi angtik ah kasuoksikme, khat-um hiwa hongsuoknasik angkachang jettheina omsikme?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Tuteii mi'n nangnikha lamleiiya naruoi maknasik inringtheiru, ajarchu mi angjet in kei karamingnga hong inta intisik, kei Christa ka eii, halli aphakha juonaijei intisik eii. Takkha nangni'n inmani nuk juimaru. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Halli nangni'n raal khat-um raalthang ningjet phakhan chimaru, hingai rakip hi ahongsuok masasik eii, takkha aheknachu la-enuni.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Zaat inkhat chungnga zaat inkhat, han rengram inkhat chungnga rengram inkhat in raal inlathosik eii, <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />amun rakip ah rinook ka-ngar, bukawaang, khat-um nanasatna angjet ahongsuoksik, han chikaom omchan inlak marwaanna inphut alasuoksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Takkha hiwa ngaihi suokma ah inmani'n nangni kha nasur inta narachaaksik, halli nangni kha innalaminpoong sik, nangni kha synagogue ngaikhan naruoi inta halli mikhumna-ah nadasik, halli kei raming sikbeiya reng ngaili waikaroon ngai maikuungnga innarouisik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Hiwa phahin ejei nangni'n chong kahoi sik-ah sakhi ning inchangnasik. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Apha kha hongtung maklai nangni'n angme kamasangsik tia ningmalung leimindongmaru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12:11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Tichu nangni'n ning inhalpui ngai'n iteii nalouthei maknasik kei'n nangni diang lungsing lungwar kanapesik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nangni ngaihi ningnu ningpa, ning-u ningnai, ning indiang inwaipui, khat-um ningsappui rakip ngai'n inna-enhalsik eii, halli mi lekkhatchu inmani'n thina um inlapesik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kei kajara mi rakip in nangnikha naenzootnunu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Takkha naluwa samramol inkhat um mangtheinuni. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Nangni deiraat nakhan ringna ningmusik eii.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Jerusalem Kakoisik jarra Irilpi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matt 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mk 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Takkha nangni'n Jerusalem kha raalmi ngai'n inkahiin ningmu phakhan, jetru amangnasik apha anaijei. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Khale inruoiya Judea suungnga kaom mi ngaikha ching ngaikhan taanrasu, khat-um khuopui suungnga kaom mi ngai kha-um suokrasu, halli asir apangnga kaom khuo ngai innum khawakhan heiluut khai marasu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ajarchu inthiang chongnga injia rakip ‘Huui tungnasik ah rachaakna nikhuo’ ngaikha ejei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 9:7">Hos 9:7</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Angtuk poongna khame khawa phakhan naikawon khat-um naidoong kanei numeisa ngaisik! Tichu hiwa ramhi poongna'n asipsik halli Pathian raangna kha hiwa mi ngaidiang omsik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Mi lekkhat kha chemma inthisik eii, mi lekkhat kha raal ringnga suur inta zaat rakip diang inruoi sik eii, halli zaatlop ngai phakha hekmak laiseng Jerusalem hi zaatlop ngai'n ketouna inminchangsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miring Sapa Juonasik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matt 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mk 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Khawasuoli kani, tha, arsi rakipdiang omchan inlak nimusik, halli manmasituol tuipui inruungrasa khan chinale inlaina suokta zaatle phungngai chungnga poongna raalna suoksik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezek 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:31">Jer 2:31</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Chonglar 6:12</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:13">13</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Manmasituolla kasuok rakip en-inta miring rakip malunghi kachi'n sipta injuopursik eii, han lairalaak ah ranak rakipkha minnik sik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Halli Miring sapa kha suumphai chungnga ama ranak ngarna khat-um lurna kajuokha ninmusik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DEU 7:13">Innidan 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Chonglar 1:7</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Hiwa rakip hongsuok phakhan, inthei inlang chungtiang enru, ajarchu nangni sanminringna nikhuo kha ajuonai jei.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Theichang Kuungnga inchuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matt 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mk 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Halli inmani diang chong minkhina aleirilpi: “Theichang kuungli thingkuung ngaidiang enru. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Hiwa ngai'n adoon hongpha khan kholum hongnaijei tia nangni'n ningmuli ninjet. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Khawa kha angnga, nangni'n hiwa chuon kasuok ngairakip ningmu phakhan Pathian Rengram juonaijei tihi jetru.”<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Kei'n inthiangnga kanarilpi, hiwa chuon rakip ngaihi huui tungmak laiseng atuunna mi ngaihi thinunu. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Marwaan khat-um nuoipilchung hi lamang sik, takkha kei kachongngai hichu angtik niteii mangtheinuni.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iringchakru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Kabak ka-in, ju-inrui, tuunlaiya omchan kathamak khan ningmalung peluut maknasik khat-um khawa nikhuo kha changkachim angnga ningchungnga jetlei theileiya chimmak nasik-ah nangni'n inringchakru. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Ajarchu khawa nikhuoni kha manmasituol pumpuiya kaom mi rakip diang kalasuoksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ajuo kasuoksik poongna rakip ah inkhitmak khat-um Miring sapa kekuungnga nangni'n ningngir matornasik apha rakip ah kadei karaat e-inlang nichakru.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Nisuo rakip ah Jisu'n Biak-inna aleiminchu, takkha zaanpha khanchu Olives chingkhan asiya ajuoriak kachak. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Halli ziingtiang rakip chu mipui in biak-inna ama chongril karangaisik-ah inheiwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thatnasik ah chongminsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Jn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Chol inchelmak waipool bakna kahoi tia inkoi Rakaanna kahoi phakha hongnaijei. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />‘Khale inruoiya thiampu kalian khat-um Dan karu ngai'n Jisu kha angtho thoa thatsikme tia ruuk ah inleiensui, takkha inmani'n mipui kha um inleichi.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Judas in Jisu Kajuorsik ah Ileizoot.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matt 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Mk 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Seitan in Judas Iscariot inti asiamruoi soomleini ngai karra inchel amadiang aleiluut. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Khale inruoiya Judas in thiampu kalian ngai khat-um biak-inn kangaak kalok kalian ngaidiang asiya Jisu kha angtho thoa nangnidiang kanapesikme tia inlei inbiak. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Inmani'n ama kha inleirokpui halli sial penasik ah inlei inzootna. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judas in aphakacha enna mipui ngai minjetleiya inmani diang Jisu penasik aleizootpi.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Rakaanna Kahoi Bubak nasik ah Insuukna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matt 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mk 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Jn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Khawa makheiya chol inchelmak waipool bakna nikhuo, tichu rakaanna kahoi sik-ah keelngamteii inthatnasik nikhuo kha hongtungjei. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Halli Jisu'n Peter li John diang hin tipiya aleitir, “Si inlang rakaanna kahoi bu kha eini baksik-ah juominsuuktaru.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Halli inmani'n Jisu diang inheirakel, hunme keini'n minsuuknasik nimanuom?<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ama'n aleimasang, “Nangni'n khuopui suungnga ningsi phakhan, miring inkhat beella tui choiya kaheiwa inkhat intongpui ningte, ama kha jui inlang aluutna innkhan juoluutru, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />halli khawa inn mapupa diang tipiru, ‘Karu'n hongti, kei kasiamruoi ngaile Rakaanna kahoi bu kinbaknasik inn kha hunme?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ama'n chung-inn khan inndunglai kaloktak angrakip indoon dimma kaomkha namingmute, khawa khan leiminsuukru.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Inmani'n ang rakip Jisu iti angnga inleimujei, halli inmani'n rakaanna kahoi bu kha inleiminsuuk.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pumi Zaansak Minsuuk</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matt 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mk 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Cor 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Khat-um apha juotung phakhan, Jisu'n khamtuolla ama tirton ngai khale inlei in-ong, <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ama'n inmani diang aleiti, “Kei'n kapoongnasik hongtung ma-ah hiwa Rakaanna kahoi bubaksik hi kamanuom theijei. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Ajarchu kei'n kanati, Pathian Rengram kha juotung maklaiseng kei'n bakkhai nuningjei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Halli Jisu'n rabing kha aleiya Pathian diang minpaak ah ati, “Hiwahi lei-inlang nangni karra semru. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ajarchu kei'n nangnidiang kanati, atuunna inphut Pathian Rengram kha juotung maklaiseng hiwa theibomju hi kei'n inkhai nuningjei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Halli ama'n waipool kha aleiya Pathian minpaak ah halli akatherra inmani diang hin tipiya aleipeii, “Hiwahi nangni sik-ah kinpesuok kei kapumtak kha eii, hiwahi kei ningna ngaidonnasik ah thoru.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Khawale in-angnga waipool kha inbak suoli rabing kha aleiya aleiti, “Hiwa rabinghi nangni sikbeiya akasar kei thisen makheiya inzootna kathar kha eii.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkha ah chu Jisu iti ching hi hapmu, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hiwahi kei kapum kha eii </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alam 19 halli 20 raja um eii.</char></note>” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Takkha, enru! kei kanajuorsik mipa kha keile khamtuolla kin omsuom! <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Minpkla 41:9</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Miring sapachu Pathian izoot nuoiya athisik eii, takkha ama kajourpa khachu angtuk poongna kaesikme!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Halli inmani karra inlei inkel, atukhame hiwa kathosik.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chungkanung Esik jarra Murruolsiak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Halli inmani karra tume kalokkhet tijarra inmani'n murruolsiak inleitho. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 18:1">Matt 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:34">Mk 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9:46</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Zaatlop reng ngaichu ami ngai chungnga ranak kanei khat-um waikaroon ngai in eii, ‘Mipui ngai sap kin eii inmani'n inleiti.’<char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Matt 20:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mk 10:42-44</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Takkha nangnidiang chu etheinuni, khaneek achu, nangni karra kalokkhet pa'n naipang khet angrase, halli lamkakei pa'n suok ka-ang erase. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Matt 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mk 9:35</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Tichu atukhame akalokkhet, kabaksik-ah in-ongpa khabe, emakli nangni sepa kanathopa khabe? Halle kabaksik-ah in-ongpa kha emak niabe, takkha keichu nangni sepa katho inkhat kha ka eii.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="JHN 13:12-15">Jn 13:12-15</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Nangni ngaihi ning eii kei poongna rakip ah kanahong deipui. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Halli Kapa'n kei diang wairoonnasik ranak i-nape angnga, kei innum nangnidiang khawa angnga kanapesik eii. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Nangni'n kei Rengramma kei khamtuol khan kabak ka-in ning esik eii, halli nangni'n reng in-ongna munna in-ong ningta Israel zaat soomleini chungnga wai ningroonsik eii.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu Zootmaksik jarra Jisu'n Iril</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Jn 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simon, Simon! rangairo! Seitan in nangni ngaihi leikanei pa'n gehu li gehu rasi ikhoithen angnga nangni ngai um nakhoithen nasik inzootpijei. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Takkha, Simon, kei'n nang ngamna kha mangmak nasik ah Pathian kananipi, halli nang in namalung nathuulnook phakhan, na-u nanai ngamna kha mincheetro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ama'n Jisu diang aheiti, “Pumi, Kei'n nangle mikhumna khat-um nangle kathisik-ah ka-inringchak ah kaomjei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Jisu'n aleimasang, “Peter, kei'n kanati” “Awini zaan woithum kei nazootmong natimak laiseng arkhong kha khuongnuni.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sialkok, khouchou halli Chem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n ama siamruoi ngaidiang aheiti, “Kei'n sialkok, khouchou emakli kekok choileiya kanaminsi phakhan, ang ning-insam ame?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">“Iteii insam mung” tia inmani'n inleimasang. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 10:9">Matt 10:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8">Mk 6:8</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:3">Luk 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">10:4</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Jisu'n ati, “Atuunchu” “Tu ka-ang in sialkok emakli khouchuo ningnei inchu choitaru, halli atu ka-ang in chem ningneimak inchu ningpuondiar juor inlang inkhat rachoru. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ajarchu Kei'n nangnidiang kanati, ‘Ama kha manu karoon ngai Poongna kha adei’ tia kei kajarra iril Pathian chongkha inthiangnga huui latungsik eii, ajarchu kei kajarra lei-injia rakip kha huui hongtung sikjei.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Halli inmani'n inleiti, “Enro! Pumi hiwahin chem inni om!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Halli ama'n inmani diang aleiti,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:38: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hiwahin hunjei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emakli </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Khawa khan hunjei.</char></note> “hiwahin hunjei!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Olives Chingnga Pathian Ini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matt 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mk 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Halli Jisu'n aheisuok ah Olives chingtiang a-ngai angnga aleisi, halli asiamruoi ngai'n inleijui. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ama'n khawamun khan atungli inmani diang aleiti, “Matheemna ah chulmak nasik nangni'n Pathian niru.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ama'n lungtum inkhat nideengjuon inkardanna inmani diang makheiya alei inlaak, halli kemurkhup thep ah Pathian aleini. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Ama'n aleiti “Kapa,” “Nang nalungduo e-inchu, Kei diangnga inphut poongna rabinghi nakhaipiro, takkha kei kalungduo emarase, nang nalungduo erase.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Marwaan makheiya Pathian tirton inkhat juominlarra amadiang ranak ngarna aleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Khat-um ama'n poongnakhan asipjarra kheella aleini, halli ama rathan kha neipilla thilom kasar angnga aleisar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leiilaak larik ah achu alam hapmu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Halli ama'n Pathian nina makheiya ahong intheili ama asiamruoi ngai koolla aheiwa ah inmanikha inmalung poonghei jarra inleizaalbirra inleiom kha ama'n ajuomu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Jisu'n inmani diang aleiti, “Angsik ah ningla zaalme? Inthei inlang matheemna khan namator maknasik Pathian niru.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Surna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Jn 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Jisu'n chong arilla omleitak phakhan, mi katamtak inheiwa ah asiamruoi soomleini karra inchel Judas inti ama'n lam heikeiya Jisu kha juonaiya mazoop sik aleitho. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Takkha Jisu'n amadiang aleiti, “Judas, Miring sapa hi mazoop nata najuorsik bejei?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Amale kaom asiamruoi ngai'n angme kasuoksik tihi inleijet phakhan, inmani'n inleiti, “Pumi, keini'n chemma tukjeinungbo?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Halli inmani karra minring inkhat in Thiampu kaliankhet suok inkhatpa changtiang kuor aleitukthakpi.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Takkha Jisu'n aleiti, “Hiwahin hunjei!” Ama'n akuor kha katook piya mindampi nookjei.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Khawa suoa Jisu'n Thiampu kalian ngai, biak-inn kangaak, kalok kalian ngai, khat-um katar ngai'n ama kasur inheiwa phakhan inmani diang aleitipi, “Mi kathamak kasursik angnga chem khat-um ramol ningchoiya ningheiwame? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kei'n nangnile biak-inna nisuo rakip kaomlai khan nangni'n nasursik thomakchu, takkha nangni'n hiwa thonasik apha ejei ajarchu kaziing in wai roonjei.” <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peter in Jisu Zootmakna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Matt 26:57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mk 14:53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Jn 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Inmani'n Jisu kha insurra Thiampu kaliankhetpa inna inleiruoi, halli Peter in inmanile inkar jenna aleijui. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Halli inmani'n tuollaidung laiya mei inlathoa inraya ah inlei in-ong, Peter um inmani ngaile alei in-ong. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Halli suok numeisa inkhat in Peter kha khawa meikoolla in-ong aheimu phakhan numeisanu'n Peter diang ahei enna aleiti, “Hiwa mipa hium Jisule kaomsuom ah eii!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Takkha Peter in leizootmak, halli “numeisanu diang aleiti, ama kha kei'n jetmong.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Halli apha lekkha athengsuo nuk miring inkhat in aheimunook ah aleiti, “Nang um inmani karra na inchelnu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Takkha Peter in aleimasang, “Mipa, kei e-mong!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Phadan inkhat thengnookli miring inkhat innum natheiya aheitinook, “Kadik kha eii hiwa mipa hium Jisu le kaomsuom ajarchu ama hi Galilee mi eii.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Takkha Peter in aleiti, “Mipa, Kei'n inthiangnga nang etikha jetmong” halli chong arilla omlaitak khan arkhong kha ahongkhuongjei.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Pumi'n ahei inlet ah Peter diang ahei-en, halli Peter in Pumi ileiti chongkha ahongngaidon, “Wini arkhong kha hongkhuong ma-ah nang in kei kha woithum najetmong natisik eii.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Halli ama'n asuok ah malung intooktheiya aleichapjei.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu kha Indeii Khat-um Inleiwuok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67">Matt 26:67</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mk 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Halli Jisu kangaak mi ngai'n ama kha inlei innuipui khat-um inleiwuok. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Inmani'n ama kha amit inkhumpiya inleirakel, “Tunme nang kanawuok? heitiro!” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Halli inmani'n amadiang rangaizoot kaommak chongkase angjet inleiril.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Uparup ngaidiang Inleiruoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Jn 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Khawasuoli khuo ajuowarra, uparup ngai, thiampu kalian ngai, halli Dan karu ngai intuupna inleineiya Jisu kha chongtanna inna inleiruoiya inleiti, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />“Keinidiang natipiro,” “nang Christa kha naebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Takkha ama'n aleiti, “Kei'n kanatipi innum, nangni'n ngamna nutun. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Halli kei'n nangnidiang rakelna kananei innum nangni'n namasang nutun. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Takkha atuun makhei achu Miring sapa hi ranak kanei Pathian ama kutchangtiang in-ongsik ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Halli inmani'n rakip in inleiti, halle, “Nang Pathian sapa na-ebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ama'n inmani diang aleimasang, “Nangni'n kei ka-ei ningna tijei.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Halli inmani'n inleiti, “Eini'n iteii sakhi leisik arei ommakjei! ajarchu amur tak-in irilkha eini'n nijetjei!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Jisu Pilate Koolla Inleiruoi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Jn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Mipui ngai'n inhong intheiya Jisu kha Pilate maikuungnga inleiruoi, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Halli inmani'n ama kha noonkuung inpeiya iheiti, “Keini'n kinjet, ama'n Caesar diang rampar pechamak tia eini mi ngaihi kathamak tiang akeiruoijei halli atheinuo ah Reng Christa ka eii inti.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Halli Pilate in aheirakel, “Nang Jihudi ngai reng na-ebe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Jisu'n aheimasang, “Nang eti kha ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilate in Thiampu kalian ngaili mipui diang ati, “Kei'n amadiang athamakna iteii mumong.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Takkha inmani'n kheella inhongkhek ah inleiti, “Ama minchunna khan Judea ramsuungnga kaom mi rakip aminhaangjei. halli ama'n Galilee makheiya aphut ah atuunchu hiwahin aheitungjei.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Herod Koolla Inleiruoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Halli Pilate in hiwajarra ajetpha khan, ama'n aleirakel, “Hiwa mipa hi Galilee mibe?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Halli ama'n Herod roonna ramsuung makheiya eii tia aleijet, halli Herod kha-um khawapha takkhan Jerusalemma aleiompiya Pilate in Jisu kha Herod kooltiang aleiminsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herod in apha kasoottak ah intongpuisik tia ileingaidon Jisu kha amupha khan aleirokthei, ajarchu ama'n Jisu jarra aleijet, halli amadiang makheiya inlak chuon lekkhat ithokha aleimuzoot. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Khale inruoiya Herod in Jisu diang chong katamtak aleirakel, takkha ama'n leimasangmak. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Thiampu kalian ngaili Dan karu ngai'n Jisu diang kanathei noonkuung inleipeii. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Khawa khan Herod khat-um ama raalmi ngai'n Jisu kha kase ah inrilse ah innuipui halli katha puondiar inminluk ah Pilate kooltiang inleiminkirnook. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Inhaltheiya kaleiom Herod li Pilate kha khawa nikhuoni makheiya inhong inngeijei.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thina sik Chongtanna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matt 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mk 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Jn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilate in thiampu kalian ngai, waikaroon ngai khat-um mipui kha aleikoi, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Inmani diang aleiti, “Nangni'n Jisu hi mipui ngai kha lamleiitiang kakeiruoi mi eii tia kei kadiang ningheiruoi jei, enru nangni maikuungnga chong angjet karakella ensuina kaneijei, halli nangni'n ama chungnga noonkuung ningpena ngaikha amadiang iteii mumong. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Herod innum noonkuung pesik mumak khawa jarra ama'n hiwa mipahi einidiang iheiminwa nook eii, enru ama'n thina penasik-ah rahoi kasuok chuon iteii thomak. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Khawa jarra kei'n ama hi rachaak kata kamasuo sikjei.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Rakaanna kahoi inthopha khan Pilate in inmani sikbeiya mikhumna makheiya mi inkhat aleimasuo kachak.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Mipui rakip in inhongkheek, “Ama kha thatro! keini sik-ah Barabbas kha namasuopitaro!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabbas hi khuopuiya lamkathoi khat-um mikathat ejarra mikhumna ah inleida kha eii.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Jisu kha amasuozoot jarra Pilate in woikhat inlet-ah mipui diang hongtinook. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Takkha inmani'n inhongkheek ah inleitinook, “Ama kha Cross ah thatro! Cross ah thatro!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Woithum huuina mipui diang Pilate in ahongrilnook, “Ama'n angkachang kathamak atho ame? Kei'n amahi thina katung penasik noonkuung mumong, kei'n rachaak kata kamasuosik ejei.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Takkha ama kha cross ah that nasik ah, kheella inhongkheek ah inmani kheekrasa kha aleirangai pijei. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Khale inruoiya Pilate in inmani i-manuom kha aleizoot pijei. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ama'n kathamak katho khat-um mikathatpa kha mikhumna makheiya masuopiya, inmani imanuom dungjuiya thonasik-ah Pilate in Jisu kha inmani diang aleipejei.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Cross ah Inthat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Jn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Raalmi ngai'n Jisu kha inleiruoijei, Simon inti Cyrene ram makheiya kaheiwa kha insuira cross kha inleiminput ah Jisu nuk inleiminjui.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mipui katamtak in ama nuk inleijui, khat-um inmani ngai karra numeisa leikhat in inroop inkabeenna inchappuiya Jisu nuk inleijui. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Takkha Jisu'n nuk malet ah aleiti, “Jerusalem numeisa ngai! kei kasik beiya chapmaru, takkha ningpum sile ningsa ngaisik-ah chapru. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ajarchu enru, nikhuo kha lahongtung sik mipui ngai'n inlatisik, ‘Numeisa wonkachoi mak ngai, sa iteii kalanei mak ngai, khat-um angtik niteii aranu kalawaimak numeisa ngaikha angtuk rawaan kathame!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Halli khawa phakhan inmani'n chingbung diang inti, ‘Keni diang juochim inlang najuodeeng taro!’ ‘Halli chingteii diang namakhu taro’ ningti sik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Hos 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:16">Chonglar 6:16</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Tichu, mipui ngai'n thingkuung kha adumlai hiwa chuon ngai intho inle angme kachangsik thingkuung kha ahongcharni khan?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Kathamak katho miring inni kha um Jisu le thatna sik-ah inleiruoi. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Inmani'n “Lukiar” tia inkoinamun inleitung phakhan, khawakhan Jisu kha inmani'n cross ah makaina inleinei, halli kathamak katho inni kha-um khat-in changtiang khat-in weitiang cross ah inleimakai. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Jisu'n ati, “Kapa, inmani kha ngaidampiro! ajarchu inmani'n angme inthohi jetmu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat achu Jisu'n ati </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Kapa, inmani kha ngaidampiro! ajarchu inmani'n angme inthohi jetmu.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iti chong hi ommak</char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Inmani'n rasi in-enna ama puondier inlei insem. <char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Minpkla 22:18</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Mipui'n inngirra inlei enpha khan, waikaroon ngai'n amadiang inleiril seya inti, “Mi ngai khachu nasan, Pathian inakadang Christa kha na e-inchu natheinuo ah insanro.”<char style="rq"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Minpkla 22:7</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Raalmi ngai innum, ama koolla inhongnga ju kathur kha inleipeya inlei innuipui, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />halli “Nang in Jihudi ngai Reng na e-inchu natheinuo ah insanro!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ama luchungnga hiwa chong hi inleimajia. “Amahi Jihudi ngai rengpa eii.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Inmakaiya kaom kathamak katho miringkhat innum arilthaiya aleiti, “Nang Christa emak cheyabe? Napumtak insanro halli keini um nasanro!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Takkha minring khatpa in aheiranna ati, “Nang Pathian chimak chebe? Nang um ama le in-angrip ah poongna nimu ejei. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Eini chu eini nithoman nimu kha eii, takkha ama chu iteii imasial ommak.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Halli ama'n Jisu diang ati, “ Pumi nang na Rengram naluut phakhan keihi najuo ngaidonro!”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Jisu'n ama diang aheiti, “ Kei'n inthiangnga kanati, awini nanghi keile inruoiya Paradise ah nihong-om suomsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Jn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Phadan soomleini chunsiktiang khawa ramsuung rakip ah kaziing in aleisip halli phadan inthumchen aleiziing. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Halli kani ra-ang kha juoziingjei, biak-inn suungnga puonduong kha lekniya inkhoi therjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Suok 26:31-33</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Khale inruoiya Jisu'n inringnga hong kheek ah ati, “Kapa! nang nakut ah kei karatha hi kanapeluut jei!” Ama'n hiwa tisuoli arang chatjei. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Suok 26:31-33</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Raalmi kalokpa'n kasuok rakip amu phakhan hintia Pathian aleiminpaak, “Inthiangnga amahi mi kadik eii!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Khawa khanna ka inchun mipui ngai'n kasuok rakip inmu phakhan, inroop inkabeenna kahoimak theiya inntiang inleikir. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Jisu kajet ngai khat-um Galilee makheiya kaheijui numeisa ngai kha-um kasuok rakipkha kalaak mun makheiya ingirra inhei-en. <char style="rq"><ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8:2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu Thaanna Inreii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Jn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Khawa khan araming Joseph inti pasal inkhat aleiom, ama hi chongtanna munna chuon katho mi inkhat alei eii, khat-um katha li kadik katho mi eii. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Chongkatan ngai chong khat-um chuon rakip ngaikha ama'n leizootmak, amahi Judea khuopui suungnga kaom Arimathea makheiya kaheiwa eii, halli amahi Pathian Rengram kajuosik ka-ngaakchak ah kaom mi alei eii. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ama'n Pilate koolla asiya Jisu kaluong kha ajuoni. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Khale inruoiya ama'n Pumi kaluong kha akeithaak ah ama'n ruipuon kachek ah katuomma tuteii inlareii makna lungkarong thaan khan ajuoreii jei. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Khawa nikhuo kha tuibiak nikhuo elei eii, halli Sabbath nikhuo aheiwasik ejei.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Amale Galilee makheiya kaheijui numeisa ngai'n insiya thaanmunna ama kaluong kha angtho thoa thaanna inreiime tikha inleimu, <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n inheikirra, apumma kanootsik arim kahoi sariak kha injuominsuuk.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Chongpeii dungjuiya Sabbath nikhuoni soong inleimachum. <char style="rq"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Suok 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:14">Dan 5:14</ref> </char><verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Kathi Makheiya Karing</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matt 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Jn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Hapta mansakhet nikhuoni ziingtiang ma-ah inmani'n sariak rim kahoi inminsuuk ngaikha inchoiya thaantiang inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Halli inmani'n thaankhar lung lei-inlong kha inleimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Inmani'n thaansuungnga inluut phakhan Pumi Jisu kaluong kha leiommakjei. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Inmani'n hiwa jarra rildan leijetmuwa inlei omlai, jetlei theileiya puonkachek kasil pasal miring inni inmani koolla inleingir. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Halli inmani'n inchi heiya neipilla injuo inbok phakhan, pasal inni ngai'n inmani diang inheiti, “Kathi ngai kara karing kha nangni'n angsik ning entokme? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ama chu kathi makheiya intheiya hin ommakjei, ama'n Galilee ah omlai nangnidiang angme i-nati kha ngaidonru. <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Matt 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:22">17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:18">20:18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref></char><verse eid="LUK 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Miring sapa kha manu karoon ngaidiang inpesik eii, cross ah inthatsik eii, halli nithum huuini ahongring nooksik eii.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Khawa khan numeisa ngai'n ama chong ngaikha inleingaidon. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Thaan makheiya inheikirra asiamruoi soomleikhat ngaidiang khat-um aleiilaak rakipdiang kasuok hi injuorilpi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Khawa numeisa ngai khachu, Mary Magdalene, Joanna, James nu Mary halli inmanile kasi aleiilaak numeisa ngai'n tirton ngaidiang kasuok omchan ngaikha injuorilpi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Takkha tirton ngai'n numeisa ngai chongkha pangrilla inril keeng tia leileipimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Halli Peter'n intheiya taanna thaan tiang aleisi, ama'n akuunna thaankhur suung enpha khan kathi katuomna puon khabit ajuomu ah rilsik jetmak-ah inntiang aheikir nookjei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat ah alam sumleini hapmu.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emmaus tiang Inleisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Mk 16:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Halli, khawa nikhuoni khan Jisu nuk kajui ngai karra miring inni Jerusalem makheiya mile inni inlaak Emmaus khuotiang inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Inmani inni'n kasuok omchan ngai jarra khatle khatdiang inrilla inleisi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Inmani inni'n inleisi phakhan, Jisu'n inmani koolla heinaiya inmanile aleisi suom. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Inmani'n ama kha inleimu, takkha tume tihi leijet matormu. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Halli ama'n inmani diang ati, “Ang kachang chongme nangni inni'n nisina ah ningril kha?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">khawa khan kahoimathei maisuoa inmani'n inleingir chetjei. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Halli araming Cleopas intipa'n Jisu diang aheimasang, “Tuunlaiya nikhuo lekkhat suungnga Jerusalemma kasuok omchan jetleiya khuolmi inkhat na eya natheinuoa niombe tia inleirakel?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Angkachang chong suok ah mejei?” Inmani'n inleimasang, “Nazareth Jisu jarra kasuok chuon eii” Ama hi Pathian li miring ngai maikuungnga achuontho nali arilna rakip ah ranak kanei Pathian chongkachoi mi eii tia inleingaidon.<verse eid="LUK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Halli eini thiampu kalian ngaili lamkakei ngai'n thinasik-ah kathamak inminchangga ama kha cross ah inthat. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Takkha Israel kakatansik mikha ama eii tia keini'n kinleingaidon, hiwa rakip hi asuokna wini le nithum kha hong ejei. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Keini karra numeisa lekkhat in ziingtiang ma-ah thaanna injuosiya keinihi kinmalung inmindong, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />halli inmani'n akaluong kha injuomumak phakhan, Jisu kha aringjei tia marwaan tirton ngai'n keinidiang mangtalar angnga kinmu tia keinidiang injuoril. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Keini le kaom miring lekkhat in thaanna injuosiya numeisa ngai'n inti angnga injuomu, takkha inmani innum ama kha juomumu.<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Halli Jisu'n inmani diang ati, “Nangni angtuk ning amme, Pathian chong kachoi ngai'n inleiti rakip ningmalungnga kangamna sik-ah ning insuumjei! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Christa'n poongna rakip adeisuoli ama lurna khan luutmakniabe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Jisu'n angrakip ama jarra Moses khat-um Pathian chong kachoi ngai'n inleiril khat-um chong inthiang in ileiti ngaikha rilpina aleinei.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Khale inruoiya inmani'n intungnasik khuo inheinai phakhan, Jisu'n kasicheisik omchan angnga inmani diang aleithopi. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Takkha khuo ajuoboi jarra keinile onsuomtui tia inmani'n ama kha ranak-ah khaapna inleinei, halli ama'n inmanile asiya injuoriakjei. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ama'n inmanile bubakna sik-ah inlei in-ongsuom phakhan, waipool aleiya Pathian aleiminpaak halli katherra inmani diang aleipei. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Halli inmani mit hongwarra Jisu ejei tia inleijet, halli inmani maikuung makheiya Jisu'n aleimang deljei. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Inmani'n khatli khatdiang inlei inti, “Jisu einile lamma thurchi nirillai khat-um ama'n einidiang chong inthiang katha ah niminchulai eini malung kha mei angnga kaang ma-abe?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Khawapha takkhan inmani'n Jerusalem tiang inkirnook ah amale kasi siamruoi soomleikhat ngaikha mi ngaile intuup ah inleiom kha injuomu. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Inmani'n injuoti, “Pumi kha inthiangnga aringjei, halli Simon diang juo inlarjei!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Khat-um lamma kasuok chuon ngai jarra khat-um waipool katherkhoi laiya inmani'n ang omchanna ama kha inhongjetme tijarra inmani diang inleirilpi.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Asiamroui ngaidiang Inlar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Jn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Chuon 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Inmani'n hithowa inrilla inomlai takkhan, jetlei theileiya Pumi'n apumtak inmani karra ajuo ngirra inmani diang aleitipi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lek khat ah inmani diang ati, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Nangni chungnga kadai omrase.” </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iti chonghi ommak.</char></note> “Nangni chungnga kadai omrase.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Inmani'n ratha kathamak inkhat kimujei tia inleichi theiya inlei-inlai. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Ama'n inmani diang aheiti, “Angjara ning poongme? Halli angjarra ning malungnga inngamsamna ningneime? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Enru kakutli kakeii ngaihi, kei ka eii, nakatook inlang na-enru, kei ningnamu angnga ratha kathamak chu taksali saru omnuni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ama'n inmani diang aleitisuoli inmani diang akutli akeii ngaikha aminmu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:40: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Larik lekkhat'n alam soommili hapmu.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Khawa khan inmani'n inngamna leiom maklai, karokli kangak in asiplai, Nipumi'n inmani diang aleiti, hiwahin bakphur inkhat ningneibe? <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Inmani'n ngarou alekkhat inleipeii, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Ama'n aleiya inmani maikuungnga alei-ei.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Halli ama'n inmani diang ati, “Hiwahi kei kachong kha eii, kei'n nangni karra kaleiomlai kanati, angrakip Moses Danna, Pathian chongkachoi ngai'n khat-um Minpaakla ah inlei majia rakip huui latungsik eii.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Achong inthiang injetnasik-ah inmani malungkha aleimalongpi. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Halli inmani diang ati, “Hinthoa lei-injia, Christa'n poongna aneisik halli nithum huuini akathi makheiya ahongring nooksik eii. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Jerusalemma inphut malung thuulnali manu ngaidampina chongngai kha zaat rakipdiang ningrilpi sik eii. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Nangni hi hiwangai rakip chungnga sakhi ning ejei. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Enru, kei'n Kapa chongkhitna kha nangni chungnga kanapesik eii; takkha Pathian in nangni kha chungtiangnga ranak khan puon angnga naminsil maklaiseng nangni'n Jerusalemma leiomru.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jisu'n Marwaan tiang Kalna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mk 16:19</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Chuon 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Khawa phakhan inmani kha Bethany katung akeiruoiya halli akut duongpiya inmani kha rawaan aleipei. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ama'n inmani kha rawaan aleipeli ama'n inmani kha inthenpui jei, halli ama kha marwaan tiang inruoijei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:51: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laarik lekkhat achu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Marwaan tiang inruoijei. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iti chong hi ommak.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Jisu kha chubei inthoa Jerusalem tiang karok ah inlei kirjei. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Halli inmani'n Biak-inna apha rakip ah Pathian kha inleiminpaak ah inleiom.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>